'衰：观察细致，思维多项，广杂不精；研究欲强，心胸旷达，不计较小人言行；但晚年遇事有些力不从心，性格稍微保守。',
'病：有正义感，脾气不稳，爱憎强烈，交往平凡，焦虑过多，心思沉重，注意财气，嫉妒竞争，防止被人不当利用。',
'死：外柔内刚，有学问，有才能，工作努力，一生事业月圆月缺几度起落，但个别家庭坎坷，女命婚姻难圆满，夫缘易变。',
'墓：热情大方，执着追求，生性顽固，交往嫌杂，心胸狭窄，猜疑性大。但是婚后易生口角。',
'绝：精打细算，执着追求，孤独，早婚不利，人际关系差，少受信赖，一生漂泊不定，慎重协调人际关系，财源几起几落。',
'胎：心地善良，沉默，无视现实，与双亲缘份淡薄，慎重社会交往，防止被人不当利用。',
'养：性情温和，意志坚定，女性刻苦耐劳，与丈夫缘分淡薄。心理活动复杂，一生几起几落，家庭温温热，情感平凡，淡然处之。'];

const BZ_YEAR_TEXT = ['林下之猪。性刚直不顺，不易受欺之人；女命能持家兴业，家财丰厚，晚年福寿全美之命。',
'屋上之鼠，为人少学少成，心情急躁，办事有始无终，幼年有灾，兄弟少力，男主女大，女主夫长，可配夫妻美满。聪明、善良之命。',
'海中之牛，少年运气不好，有父母重婚之兆。夫妇皆好，儿女不孤，爱好九流艺术。',
'为山林之虎。其性格不定，心直口快，手足忙碌，不利官。女主贤良，聪明伶俐之命。',
'为望月之兔，一生手足不停，身心不闲，衣禄可以，可算富贵，女命好静，一生有福之命。',
'为清温之龙，喜气春风，出入压群。利官，近贵，骨肉刑伤，儿女无力；女命主温良贤达，心直口快，必嫁好夫。',
'福气之蛇，有功名之征兆，伶俐聪明，夫妇命和，做事能遂心愿，财丰田足；女命衣良无缺，良妇之命。',
'堂里之马。快口无心，利官有贵，衣禄有余。男主权，女主益夫旺子，秀气之命。',
'得禄之羊，一生情性宽大志高，少年不利，夫妇和谐，头胎见子有刑，女命持家兴旺。',
'清秀之猴，情高手巧，聪明伶俐，有智谋，遇事多变。和气春风，功名有分，有贤德之妻，女主貌美色姿。',
'楼宿之鸡。说话流利，巧言善辩，办事公正，无私心，衣良平稳。六亲无缘，晚景旺相，女命益夫助夫兴家。',
'守门之犬。口快舌尖，用心不用力，有权柄，名声四海；夫妇相合；女命旺夫生财，兴家立业。',
'过往之猪。与人和顺，初年多灾。父母有刑伤，再拜无妨，夫妇无刑皆老，存心中正，丰足兴旺，子息有克破，晚儿方好。',
'田内之鼠。为人胆大有权，机谋超人，早年平，中年好转，老年大好。女命主口舌利快。',
'湖内之牛。待人和睦，衣禄不亏。早年财不丰富，晚景有余，骨肉无情，见迟方好；夫妇和顺，女命旺夫，持家，贤良之命也。',
'过山之虎。为人性急猛烈，易恶，反眼无情，早年勤俭，离祖方能发达，必主聪明伶俐。',
'出林之兔。一生衣食自然有，不受人欺，六亲冷落，骨肉难为，妻长所配佳；女命主乡邻和睦，善良优贤之妇。',
'怒性之龙。一生和气欠佳，劳碌雪霜，不受人欺，利官近贵，名利双全，衣食有余之命。',
'冬藏之蛇。为人机谋多变，志气人，一生衣食无亏，主有贵人扶持之征兆，晚年快乐之命。',
'军中之马。为人勤俭，父母有刑伤，灾危可折，早年财物有紧，晚年旺相有余；女命，主兴家也，为贤良之妇。',
'群内之羊。一生有快乐之心，广行方便，只是救人无恩，反招是非，命中财来不聚，女命贤德持家，晚年荣昌。',
'过树之猴。一生衣禄不少，性情温柔。出入皆压人，初运不利，末运却佳。夫妇美满，儿女迟见为好；女命持家，丰物兴旺，贤孝之妇。',
'唱午之鸡。心直口快，有口无恶心，志气高，衣食足，福寿双全，弟兄多，但不得力；女命主兴财，平稳之命。',
'白眼之犬。一生多吉利，有招财进宝象征，自立家业，至老荣华；女命财旺，兴家有方。',
'过山之猪。性温，手巧聪明，自立家业。儿女有刑伤，见迟方好，一生好善；女命衣禄平稳，无风浪。',
'仓内之鼠。计算超人，文武皆能，儿女早年有克，迟得安全，夫妇白头和好；女命贤良发达。',
'栏内之牛。口快心无恶，艺术、才能过人，一生衣食不亏。但男女皆主再娶嫁，花烛重明之应。',
'出山之虎。心情急躁，口恶心善，有志气，握权柄，利官贵。反复多变，衣食不亏；女命荣华，内助兴家。',
'蟾窟之兔。口快，有权。利官近贵身闲，心忙，六亲少靠，自立自成家业；女命持家，兴家旺相。',
'行雨之龙。为人辛勤劳碌，终日手足不停，早岁运悔，晚景财旺发福；女命为一生操持家业，助夫兴家。',
'草中之蛇。聪明伶俐，财来不聚，晚年不同前，发财有福；女命贤良，兴家助夫。',
'春中之马。对人和气如春风，好交朋友，利官近贵。遇凶化吉，一生无刑。女命能言善语，口尖舌快。',
'敬重之羊。容貌端正，少年勤俭，初年平顺无大难，晚年聚财巨富，兄弟少力，子息不孤，立家兴业之命。',
'山上之猴。衣食足用有余，交易买卖必主财旺，早年运不通，晚景胜从前，女命主善，财旺，兴家发达之命。',
'独立之鸡。对人如春风温和，受人欢喜，利外。初年辛劳，身忙心苦，老来丰财旺家业，女命清秀，命伴天才，吉昌之命也。',
'进山之犬。和气待人，家业自创自立，早年不幸，物财耗散，晚来宜得财，行师艺术，中平之命。',
'道院之猪。手巧技艺多，一生衣禄安稳，六亲有克，夫妇各顺；女命主清闲，老来乐观之命。',
'梁上之鼠。人人尊重，妻主安稳清正，持家有权柄，衣食不亏，通达之命；女命主旺财，并逢凶化吉。',
'路途之牛。对人温和，初年有意外之危。衣食虽有，但进财不存，老来福寿双至；女命贤良，旺财之命。',
'过林之虎。心直口快，不暗地生非。夫妇，儿女有克，迟方好。初年财不聚，事事难好，晚景丰足之命。',
'树木之兔。酒食不欠，福寿有余，逢凶化吉，一生平安、兴隆一世；女命中末运气欠佳，操持家务一生。',
'有道之龙。待人有礼，安守本分，众人敬重，一生清闲如意，虽劳不碌，财旺自来；女命贤巧兴家。',
'出穴之蛇。为人端正，对人恰似春风，犯指背凶煞，救人也无功，行善不得好，早年子女有刑，迟见方好，女命后运好。',
'路行之马。一生清闲，初年有财难聚，无主意，兄弟各自成家，后运旺财发家；女命清正手巧持家。',
'失群之羊。一生喜怒无常，多口舌，是非不可无。有名利，骨肉生疏，妻迟子晚好；女命财旺助夫，利夫小之命。',
'独立之猴。一生急性，作事反复无常，劳碌辛苦，但利官近贵，儿女刑伤，财帛足用；女命贤良懂事，文武皆精，手巧心活，利子女之命。',
'报晓之鸡。一生衣食有余，但六亲难靠，早子见妇，聪明好学，百一皆通；女命淫邪多变，一生无灾之命。',
'寺院之犬。一生快活，丑年有灾，作事机巧，百事如意；女命主聪明伶俐，手巧，能助夫兴家旺财之命。',
'圈内之猪。一生不贪闲事，不惹是非，早年财物不足，到老荣华；女命主体壮，能兴家立业。',
'叶上之鼠。幼年不灾，中年大运大好，衣食足用，主有好妻，身忙心苦，喜忧交替，兄弟少力，六亲疏淡，凡事自作自为；女命主贤良，持家之命。',
'栏外之牛。衣食不少，初年财多不聚，不管闲事，父母难为，骨肉少力，夫妇皆好，儿女迟见为好。',
'立定之虎。一生利官利贵，家丰财，足衣食，财源繁多，有刑父母，双亲有重拜之灾；女主夫大，男主妻长之命。',
'得道之兔。志高气昂，多计多谋，进事称心如意，文武皆能。女命主一生福寿无亏之命。',
'上天之龙。一生衣食无亏，有名有利，四海春风，爱友喜朋，女命主贤能手巧口巧，旺夫兴家之命。',
'塘内之蛇。利官有贵，性刚不顺，身居长位，事业显荣；女命美丽，贤达会治家，有财旺夫之命。',
'殿内之马。衣禄自然有，五官端正，志气宽宏，少年有灾，骨肉有刑；女命难得姐妹之助，后来兴旺自立之命。',
'草野之羊。口快善变，衣食自来，前程显达，有贵人扶，百事华荣，旺相之命。',
'食果之猴。一生手足不停，清高利官，但救人不得好报，女命六亲冷淡老来兴旺之命。',
'笼藏之鸡。一生伶俐，精神爽朗，口舌能辩，六亲生疏，女命主贤德治家，老来荣华之命。',
'顾家之犬。一生好行善，初年平平，末年兴旺。'];

const BZ_MONTH_TEXT = ['正月出生的人，前年四月受胎，立春节后出生，官吏敬重富贵增荣，为人忠厚仁德待人，同情心深，命中无刑克，能成人之美，待人接物，礼貌有加，大事成小，凡事仔细，重感情破前程，出外营商致富，能招四方之财，幼年平平，中年云开见日，处处称心，晚年增荣，福禄富贵，半真半假之命。',
'二月出生的人前年五月受胎，惊蛰节后出生。性格纯良温婉，对人从无恶语相加，但嫌六亲少缘，父母兄弟姊妹乏其助力，初限艰苦，处处靠自力更生，循步渐进，可望百尺竿头，蒸蒸日上，中年过后，家运事业皆见兴隆，凡事不宜急躁，尤戒贪婪，贪则失误，为色情而害家庭，宜要谨慎得荣幸。晚运一般 ，真假各半之命。',
'三月出生的人，前年六月受胎，清明节后出生。人心不凡，宽怀大量，忍耐，为人有志，意向坚定，头脑精明，擅交际，有手腕，胸怀宽大厚，重色情，喜社交，爱情亦难专一，提防桃花为患，欢场烟消云散花之地勿近为佳，中年运防水月镜花，错过良机，有名无实，晚年能守，福泽可期，乃倒啖甘蔗先苦后甜之命。',
'四月出生的人，前年七月受胎，立夏节后出生，心性如野马难安，行动似脱兔奔野，不安于室，广交朋友满天下，雪中送炭无一人，此命从事艺术可望成功，惜欲望过大，心性难以收拾，虽有祖业，无力固守，初限平平，受尽艰难，中运自立家园，所谓-玉不琢，不成器也-，末限晚年，富贵齐来，晚景无忧之命。',
'五月出生的人，前年八月受胎，芒种节后出生，此命有权势，八面威风，且性格刚强，心有机谋，有权势，行正道，贵人提拨，但虑凡语冲口而出自坏自事，又因为人冷热不定，作事虎头蛇尾，坐看良机消失，婚姻亦利迟不利早，否则夫妻半途恐有相克，乃为富贵荣华照晚景之命。',
'六月出生的人，前年九月受胎，小署节后出生，为人具艺术头脑，心巧伶俐，有就变能力，信念坚定，思考精密，但手头阔绰，交友四海，尤忌千金散尽不复来，此命不守祖业，运到中年始可见成，平生机谋太重，须防背后小人，夫妻可望和谐，白首到老，中年顺境，未限安逸之命。',
'七月出生的人，前年十月受胎，立秋节后出生，为人宅心仁厚，外刚而内柔，属阴柔之命，意志坚固，作事始终，初限一般，忌早婚，否则婚姻易散，且子女缘薄，一生性情复杂，运程浮游不定，心底慈善，做事仔细，中年后渐能开泰守成，衣食有余，晚年家运可卜畅通，财源大旺，未限舒泰之命。',
'八月出生的人，前年十一月受胎，白露节后出生，此命具驿马，尤以生性固执，不纳人言，凡事一意孤行，远离群众。朋友亲属均无助力，且命途多变喜悲参半，为人眼目光辉，文章显达，正直无私，宽宏大度，无耐性，初年独木难支，自食苦果。中运有成，晚无忧，运到福泽绵长，乃孤鸟守林之命。',
'九月出生的人，前年十二月受胎，寒露节后出生，秉金秋之气，性格刚强，广招四方财，手中有权柄，凡事不善忍让，难免招惹是非，虽有权威近贵人，但仍防命带刑克。中年家运有变，妻迟子晚方吉，平生不善处事交友，事业亦倏起倏落，夜来静己思过，自然晚福绵长，中年能改进，晚景可无虑，乃波浪起伏之命。',
'十月出生的人，正月受胎，立冬节后出生，此命大佳，命中有吉星高照衣禄终身，女命虽能旺夫益子，惜个性懒随，性格刚强，且多刑克，夫妻难和睦，招来分飞路。男命：心如海宽，不勤不富，男女多相克，夫妇难到老，宜行善作福祈神免灾，一生衣禄丰盈，无忧之命。',
'十一月出生的人，二月受胎，大雪节后出生，此命有权可掌，独嫌性急躁，作事机智，八面玲珑，能近贵人，但防机谋过多，会招妨忌，且重色情，易惹桃花之灾，交友小心，尤异性为然，莫羡飞来艳福，提防花底藏刀。六亲缘疏，骨肉难靠，初限难为，中年平，未运晚达，晚景欢愉，乃独木枝厦之命也。',
'十二月出生的人，三月受胎，小寒节后出生，为人心直口快，兄弟缘小，百事劳苦，千斤重担一身担。初限有暗疾 侵身，中运衣禄自然来，四方财可得，女命能旺夫，但须小心病痛及小灾。凡事若成功还防失败，宜多祈神保平安，虽有衣禄，但一生坎坷较多，乃水流无定之命。'];

const BZ_DAY_TEXT = ['初一日，此日生人，福禄双全，财星高照，事业发达，利路亨通，春风得意，男主荣华，有贵人指引，尤以九岁至二十五岁者最佳，可望少年得志，女命得旺夫发福，晚景福禄。',
'初二日，此日生人，性格善良，与人和睦，身体健康，家庭缘薄，离祖成家，青年辛苦，中年运开。男主清奇有智慧，但应提防刑克父母，且六亲无所助，兄弟亦难靠，色情小小，提防祸起萧墙，女命主聪明能独立，但防相克，家远难安，中年晚运安泰。',
'初三日，此日生人，子息有乏，需修身布德，初年多难，二十运开，被人提拨，四十盛运，诸事如意 。男主家运昌盛，女命欠佳，刑夫克子，有婚变之危，终身应布德施恩，可望祈福。',
'初四日，此日生人，为人博学多才，才智出众，姻缘宜早配，初限少有成就，中限运泰渐通，家庭美满，左右逢源，但宜外不宜内，远方经营为佳，未限富贵吉利之命。',
'初五日，此日生人，为人聪明伶俐，作事近贵，衣禄有余，兄弟和顺，持有艺能，但惜命带孤苦，衣禄虽然有余，但中限需防破败，喜有贵人提拨，刻意经营，可卜晚景大旺。',
'初六日，此日生人，多学少成，秉性反复易变，一生经历风霜，初限富贵，中年平平，顺守到近卅之年，赖贵人提拨，始有所成，晚年安乐，末运大旺，乃家境平和，长寿之命也。',
'初七日，此日生人，性格活泼，厌静易动，沉浮起伏，波澜不定，初限平平，二五方开泰运，佳命渐至，家庭美满，兄弟如意，若是女命主富贵福禄。',
'初八日，此日生人，男女皆主聪明机智，才华横溢，幸福安乐，无忧无虑，父母无缘，出外逢贵，但妨克父母，宜离祖外出寻求发展，中年可卜成功，晚运 欢乐富贵之命。',
'初九日，此日生人，体魄健全，品行端庄，受人钦慕，德被乡里。但女人应忌刑夫克子，男宜远行经营为佳，属中年平庸，晚景较佳之命。',
'初十日，此日生人，为人伶俐，精诚待人，家庭缘薄，飘泊四海，少年辛苦，中年开发，晚年大兴，男女皆宜婚姻迟配，可免刑克，属先苦后甜之命。',
'十一日，此日生人，性格随和，善解人意，远迟开发，早年艰辛，中年衣食有余，独惜六亲不得其力，兄弟亦未得其助，晚年能享天伦之乐，乃中平之命也。',
'十二日，此日生人，为人温柔，刻苦耐劳，勤奋节俭，博学且才高，但惜早运不隆，难有父业，少年多波折，中年始称佳，末限可卜有所成就，乃一波三折之命也。',
'十三日，此日生人，鸿运可达，福禄有余，恪守道德，受人钦慕，奋发进取，贵人提拨，在有作为，福禄双收，男主事业成功，女主旺夫富贵，家庭美满幸福，子孙昌盛之命。',
'十四日，此日生人，男主天资聪颖，文采斐然，若逢贵人相助，前程不可限量，女主容貌娟秀，天姿国色，风度翩翩，但防早克父母，兄弟有克，双亲难在堂，且六亲疏远，手足情薄，乃晚年得运发达之命。',
'十五日，此日生人，主性格刚强，争强好斗，惹事生非，以致破坏前程，男宜离祖，它乡发展，女人克夫，必配硬命，以期夫妻偕老，乃属平常之命。',
'十六日，此日生人，聪明机智，才华之人，琴棋超群，书画出众，爱好广泛，多才多艺，一生衣禄丰足，独惜六亲无靠，青年用功，中年艺精，成功发达，乃晚运富贵之命。',
'十七日，此日生人，刚毅果断，忍耐力强，富有上进心，可望事业成功，但兄弟缘薄，口角频生，诸亲不助，作事难安，需自求才能多福，乃中平之命也。',
'十八日，此日生人，智能超群出众，才华出类拔萃，道德高尚，受人尊重，衣禄丰足名利双收，一生显贵，尤以女命更佳，乃上等之命也。',
'十九日，此日生人，智慧出众，通权达变，谙熟人际关系，故能事业成功，名利双收，但身有暗病，烦闷自叹，早婚不利，中限平常，末运有财，乃福禄富贵，荣华双全之命。',
'二十日，此日生人，凡事心身皆劳苦，波涛汹涌，处处阻挠，故谋多成少，事倍功半，祖业难富，亲朋无靠，女命克父母，男人宜离祖，出处能得财，属中平之命。',
'廿一日，此日生人，艺高胆大，喜好投机，孤高自负，不服他人，早年平平，事不称心，但只要尽力而为，中限可卜大有成就，乃先苦后甜之命。',
'廿二日，此日生人，一生聪明乖巧，善思机谋，心诚守信，作事无虚，少年艰辛，苦中得甘，廿五运到，前程锦绣，如再勉力，晚景大兴，宏图大展，乃名利双收之命。',
'廿三日，此日生人，争强好胜，事业心极强，为人有小聪明，衣禄亦由天早定，独嫌父母皆无助，宜独善其身，中年平淡，运道一般，中平之命也。',
'廿四日，此日生人，大有才气，作事专心，有头有尾，待人亲切，受人尊敬，但才多招人忌，文采洋溢，作幕僚必居首位，不乏贵人临命，需防小人暗中作梗。妻财子禄皆有，中上之命也。',
'廿五日，此日生人，为人忠厚，喜好公益，巧理家庭，容易经营，事业发达但多管理闲事，容易树敌，女命主衣禄禄无忧，嫁后旺夫益子，晚年发达，大旺之命。',
'廿六日，此日生人，为人仁慈，心怀慈悲，聪明伶俐，作事无虚，广交朋友，四海为家，勤俭积蓄，衣禄丰厚，一生起伏不定，中运渐佳，晚运通达。乃富贵之命。',
'廿七日，此日生人，为人奇巧有机谋，励精图治前景好，命运多波折，夫妻中和好，但恐难谐老，尤以女命之人，刑夫克子，谨作提防，男主离祖外出，中平之命也。',
'廿八日，此日生人，幼年不幸，体弱多病，婚姻不宜太迟，凡事多谋，少有成就，若能逆境奋起，恪守人事，或可挽回 厄运，以胜天命，属末限富贵吉利之命。',
'廿九日，此日生人，心性昂扬，财禄丰足，为人忠厚，重义守信，豪侠仗义，慷慨待人，但嫌命罡，六亲无助，兄弟姐妹亦难有所助，初限平顺，中年运到晚运显达，幸福之命。',
'三十日，此日生人，心性聪敏，为人活泼，才思敏捷，出口成章，文采卓然，利于文职发展，若能艰苦奋斗，必是前程锦绣，属末运兴隆，大旺之命。'];

const BZ_HOUR_TEXT = ['子时生人：（午夜十一时至一时）玉扇星，财库入命，为人性格刚强，孤独自负，有勇欠谋，是非多端，小事不拘，父母得力，夫妇相克，初年好学上进，中运奔波，晚运富贵，乃公卿之命也，运到好如春，叶绿花更红。*适业：军人、政法、经济、建筑、电气等，金水事业佳，忌土类。*吉凶年：十一、十八、三十六、四十九、五十八、八十四岁。',
'丑时生人：(夜半一时至三时)闾皇星带刑入命，有忠直之心，权威之命，为人多才多艺，志气高昂，父母难长，家族缘薄，性情暴躁，惹事生非，幼年多灾，起落不平，唧唧啾啾作事迟延，二十运开，四五兴旺，晚年发福，乃衣禄之命也，时遇晚秋熟，禾谷积满仓。*适业：工商业、技师、教员、官吏、学者、饮食、治炼等，火土事业吉，忌木类。*吉凶年：十八、二十三、三十一、四十六、七十二岁。',
'寅时生人: （黎明三时至五时）白帝星入命，自创乾坤之数，少年辛苦，六亲相克，不守祖业，异乡发迹，十七败害，四十发福，大器晚成，受人钦仰，胆大妄进，威猛如虎，乃风强忠毅之命也，扶持如遇贵，金榜定题名。*适业: 政治、法律、医师、音乐家、美术家、艺人、流浪职业等，木、土事业吉，忌金类。*吉凶年: 二十六、二十九、三十三、四十九、六十六、七十八岁。',
'卯时生人: （早上五时至七时）贵元星主命。为人聪明正直、出祖入舍，居官显贵，旭日初升，必祝祯祥，福多劳少，父母难为，夫妇和合，兄弟难靠，出外经宫，利路亨通，先难后易，自力成功，乃富贵之命也，人间称卯日，天上应房星。*适业: 机械、官员、演员、作家、美术、出版业、宗教家等，木土事业，忌金火类。*吉凶年: 十六、二十、五十五、七十二岁。',
'辰时生人:（上午七时至九时） 马元星入命，带三刑六害，若得风去志，飞腾上碧天，为人聪明伶俐，意志坚定，刚愎自用，目中无人，衣禄光辉，有扶弱挫强之侠义心肠，乃秉权好斗之命也，女人孤独，自信太重，峥嵘头角风浪里，不得风云志不休。*适业; 实业家、政治家、军事家、仲介人、教育家、工矿业等，火土事业大吉，忌木类。*吉凶年: 十九、二十九、三十六、六十六、七十九等。',
'巳时生人：(上午九时至十一时)禄元星入命，科名显达，名扬四海，为人聪明伶俐，智能非凡，自成家业，六亲无缘，快乐待人，女人虚华难得缘，中年更好，有操权荣，乃聪敏多谋之命也。聪明百慧冠英，满腹文章锦绣生。*适业：政治、作家、评论家、思想家、工矿业、加工业等，木、土事显达，忌水类。*吉凶年；三十一、三 十六、四十七、四十九、六十三、八十九岁',
'午时生人:（中午十一时至一时）太阳星入命，祖业难招，白手起家，为人忠直有主见，见义不惜财，主人清雅，谋略出众，伶俐敏捷，不守祖业，自作聪明，女人妖娇，主意极端，多浪费用，宽宏厚重心明朗，财帛丰盈家道兴。*适业: 医师、护士、政治、明星、技艺、冶炼、企业、料理店、油业等木火事业吉，忌金水类。*吉凶年: 六、十二、三十三、四十五、八十五岁',
'未时生人: （下午一时至三时）太阳星入命，闲游芳草地，足食享田园，为人神气骄傲，独断专行，作事心性不足，身旺方为福，身弱则为殃，外满内虚，初年财来财去不聚财。父母难为，夫妇相克，兄弟无靠，中限惊恐，女子多智，事业合作，多变易动，乃富贵双全之命。*适业: 土木业、电气商、建筑业、工程师、企业家等，火土事业大吉，忌木水等。*吉凶年: 十九、二十六、五十六、七十岁。',
'申时生人:（下午三时至五时）海角星入命，饱食山头果，思临涧底泉，虽有刑冲破，为人优柔寡断，时起时落，进退失据，成败迭见，羁绊不显，克陷刑伤，难为子息，败来败去，宜离祖业，父母无靠，夫妇和谐，女人破婚，宜养操节，心 情末定，多情破败，虽在贵人不临之方，尚有身登高地之命。*适业: 经纪人、料理业、金融界、银楼、钟表等，土金事业较吉，忌土木类。*吉凶年: 十九、二十二、二十八、四十二、五十四、七十二岁',
'酉时生人: （下午五时至七时）天皇星入命，报晚长随月，起舞独争先，为人忠孝仁慈，性格良善，一生财禄丰足，多招是非，可取四方之财，幼年辛苦，兄弟分离，乏子宜行善，六亲不相和，男女多情惹灾，善守机密，自尊心强，争强好胜。诗曰：酉时衣禄旺，文武足才谋，居家反不利，父母更担忧。乃福寿双全之命。*适业: 化学、记者、教员、政法、军人、新兴事业、加工业、工矿业等金水事业，忌火土类。*吉凶年: 十九、二十五、三十二、四十九、七十、七十七岁。',
'戌时生人: （晚上七时至九时）地母星入命，河魁原本位，象应类金星，为人富有胆力，忠心尽职，重义气，讲信用，独行奋斗，福禄有进，歌乐一生，女人虚华，性情暴躁，无忍耐性，偏重情感，不重金钱，福禄中平，戌时主权威，公明得安然，平生衣禄有，好运积钱财，努力上进，可掌权柄之命。*适业: 军人、保镖、诗人、作家、投机、五金、农林、机械等，火土事业吉，忌木类*吉凶年: 十六、二十六、三十五、四十四、四十九、五十七、七十八岁',
'亥时生人: （晚上九时至十一时）天父星入命，漫游四园青草盛，出入清新步步高，为人品行端正，勤勉俭朴，忠心正直，作事公平，心慈好善，有为人之心，无伤人之意，意志坚强，沉着热心，女人性刚易怒易解，天禄勤劳，财帛大旺，亥时君子居，衣禄更有余，居家变学诗，属官贵双显之命，爵位得高升。*适业: 企业家、董事长、外科医生、僧侣、旅馆、艺术、政治、五金等金、水事业，忌火土类。*吉凶年: 十一、二十六、三十六、三十九、四十九、五十六、七十八、八十八岁。'];

const BZ_SHISHEN_SEAT = ['比肩坐比肩，平吉，无主权，或为人养子，父缘薄，多为兄弟朋友协助有生离死别之象，而月干主副星比肩，孤独。男命婚迟。',
'比肩坐劫财，大凶。自身为亲友受损失，兄弟多龃龉，夫妻不和，年月柱有三柱比肩者，与父亲缘薄，或死别，两柱有一财星，逢近邻三位克者尤验。',
'比肩坐食神，大吉，食禄丰厚，有创业才能，万事顺遂。',
'比肩坐伤官，不吉，助人不利，反被忌弃，为金钱诸事扰亲友，为养子而破家。',
'比肩坐偏财，因父母或情妇之故，在营业上多发生纷扰且有疾病及色情之灾。',
'比肩坐正财，大吉，财利丰顺，能娶良妻，诸事顺利。',
'比肩坐偏官，大凶，一生劳碌，兄弟朋友多烦扰，更有盗诈病灾。',
'比肩坐正官，半吉半凶，争权夺利，是非不绝，能主正义，得人信仰。',
'比肩坐偏印，大凶，劳碌损失，居无定所，万事不顺，比肩过多，冷酷无情，有婚变之灾。',
'比肩坐正印，大吉，经商或偏业均可获利，得贵人扶持，日渐繁荣昌盛，过分宠爱部下，得罪上司。',
'劫财坐比肩不吉，家事婚事不顺，为兄弟亲友劳苦。若女命因丈夫品行不正而烦恼。',
'劫财坐劫财大凶，父非早亡，即疾病缠绵，谋事难成，合作事业解放，男命克妻或婚变。',
'劫财坐食神大吉，贵人扶持，可得意外之财，物质享受丰富，女命二次婚，方获幸福。',
'劫财坐伤官大凶，品性不正，枉法犯纪，身败名裂，遗恨终生。在时柱者，伤妻损儿。',
'劫财坐偏财大凶，破财不积财，男婚后再嫁妇人，或因妾赦尽家财。女命败财不贞洁。',
'劫财坐正财大凶，克妻遭诈欺，破财，或因亲友之事而烦恼。',
'劫财坐偏官，半凶半吉，凡事多成多败，浮沉未定，虽有发达条件，可不得遇，即使成功亦散尽业财。',
'劫财坐正官，半凶半吉，浮沉未定，虽能发达，但与部属不和，多不如意，并有免职，疾病破财之灾。若女命则有被丈夫凌虑之苦。',
'劫财坐偏印大凶，职业生活不稳定，经营副业多失败。劫财过多，心冷无情。',
'劫财坐正印不吉，外表繁荣，内里空虚，获小失大，为他人冷落，但得部下协助，逐渐招好运。',
'食神坐比肩主吉，往往成富家养子，有经济才能，兴业有贵人，六亲朋友，兄弟相助，财缘艳福佳。',
'食神坐劫财吉，凶中变吉获利，如遭破反得财，有财有福，近亲死后继承产业，如不景气被揎卖财产，财因能获高利，反成巨富。取食神为喜，食神最喜劫财乡，诚能得财福双美',
'食神坐食神大富之命，福禄丰厚，事业可获大利，一生无盗难，不宜任官使，食神违抗官星多是非，其祸无穷。',
'食神坐伤官，虽发达，但事业每至中途而障碍频生，男女皆为子嗣配偶引起烦恼。',
'食神坐偏财大吉，易得钱财，上下亲热，艳福亦佳，凡事进取有功。女命贤孝子嗣。',
'食神坐正财大吉，承蒙长辈，或长官爱护，常获大利，福分很高。',
'食神坐偏官大凶，易生灾祸，诸事不顺，半世奴婢，一生劳碌贫困，且易发怒，脾气不好',
'食神坐正官，安分守纪，获众人信任，福分日增。女命配佳婿，家庭幸福。',
'食神坐偏印大凶，疾病诸灾，连绵不断，多成多败，此两星近邻或同柱有偏财，能制凶反呈吉。',
'食神坐正印大吉，诚实有作用，傅得赞誉，得贵人扶持，业务繁荣，诸事顺利，事业发达之命。',
'伤官坐比肩不吉，自招家庭不和，六亲不睦，婚姻不顺，婚后一时生是非。',
'伤官坐劫财不顺，娶妻以财为对象，心胸横霸，太过则破财，离别亲人，身心劳苦。',
'伤官坐食神，与长辈的意见冲突，但受长辈的影响而获利。',
'伤官坐伤官大凶，痼疾短命，生涯劳碌，若即使有富贵亦不长久。',
'伤官坐偏财大福，理财高手，腾达发财，宜慎戒色情之祸。女命成寡妇，生活稳定。',
'伤官坐正财，须防他人破财，成全自己之利，又得妻助主大吉昌。',
'伤官坐偏官主凶，终生劳苦，有劳无功，遭人非议，毁谤甚至含冤莫白，夫妻离别。',
'伤官坐正官主凶，骂人成癖，万事止滞，权柄复失，夫妻离别，亦为凶象配置也。',
'伤官坐偏印，本业成功，则副业失败，副业成功。本业失败，或长辈矢败，导致自己成功，吉凶并存。',
'伤官坐正印，健康长寿，且得贵人扶助，事业成功，诸事顺遂，主吉命。',
'偏财坐比肩，不吉，其父飘零，运气难通，终死他乡，与父不和，或父有病，继承祖业有纷争。男命易生色情风波，有偏官出于不克父。',
'偏财坐劫财，大凶，父亲飘零，有灾，阳偏财与劫财，父必破败。男命为色情招致家庭纷扰婚变。女命有婚变，财被人夺，受害非浅。',
'偏财坐食神，大吉，则为遇食增福，生涯顺遂，多利多益，得父或妾之助而发达。为官运途中享通，经商营业，繁荣昌盛。',
'偏财坐伤官，主吉，愈增福力，他人失败，反变自己之利，但母亲及情妇易交苦心。',
'偏财坐偏财，大吉，富有经济手腕，发于他乡，亦其月干偏财者亦然。',
'偏财坐正财，主吉，经营工商业可获厚利，有两种职业倾向，若原命另见偏才正财者，则只是外表盛大，而内则空虚。',
'偏财坐偏官，不吉与父缘薄，父亲离乡谋生，客死他乡。经营工商业可获利，但辛劳备至，旦为女人散财，女命有婚配错误，招至再嫁之虑。',
'偏财坐正官，吉含凶得父之爱，众人之助，诸事发达，责任观念强，但暗中有小人陷害，告密诉讼等灾。',
'偏财坐偏印，凶，能得小利，劳苦不绝，易受他人拖累而损失，不得父爱，反与伯父投机。',
'偏财坐正印，大吉，天赐大福，幸福圆满，享受平生之乐福。',
'正财坐比肩，财缘甚佳，女命尤甚，虽有兄弟亲友拖累，但大体顺遂，主大富贵。',
'正财坐劫财，不吉，父亲早亡，或父业衰微，须防兄弟，六亲借钱不还。',
'正财坐食神，大吉，妻贤子孝，幸福发达，财禄丰厚。',
'正财坐伤官，半吉半凶，为他人失败或损失，反而自己获利，外衰内实，因浮沉转变多家运不吉。',
'正财坐偏财，平吉，利益虽多，开支亦繁，不满现状，兼营数业，徒增心劳，应忌色情，严防灾来。',
'正财坐正财，大吉，信用卓著，财源茂盛，主克母亲。男婚美满，女命子息稀，与子缘薄。',
'正财坐偏官，吉兆，所费虽多，从商可获巨利，无妨碍。女命尤吉，情夫君克妇道，恩爱鸳鸯羡煞人间。',
'正财坐正官，大吉，品质高洁，素获众望，上提携下援助，职位高尚，获取财利，女命尤吉，必配佳婿，家庭美满。',
'正财坐偏印，半吉半凶，久欠耐力，诚实，广交人缘佳，从事副业，必得巨利。',
'正财坐正印，凶兆，志愿难达，与人竟争易招灾祸，母妻不和，有独立能力，方可迁出。切忌贪图不义之财，安分守己，以妨灾害，若反正印坐正财尤甚。',
'偏官坐比肩，不吉，为六亲，朋友招致损失，又暗示有陷盗被难，诈谋不和，疾病等凶。若女命每为丈夫招致痛苦。',
'偏官坐劫财，平庸，能获权柄，但为狭义招之破损，夫情之间苦情多。若女命有再嫁之忧。',
'偏官坐食神，安稳之命，经商多成多败。若女命婚姻不顺。',
'偏官坐伤官，太凶，为长辈而劳苦，受他人连累受灾。有破家之兆。命局正印及日刃并存者，化凶为吉。',
'偏官坐偏财，与父缘薄，凡事不逐，为金钱失约。若女命为父亲而受苦。',
'偏官坐正财，大吉，经商顺遂，可获巨利。男命得佳儿，女命和夫宠。',
'偏官坐偏官，太凶，进退不利，诸事苦恼，为子女劳苦，女命和平夫累，且翁姑缘薄。',
'偏官坐正官，太凶，为杀露坐官，其祸百端，招致损失，表面不平，内里空虚，逢事多迷感，与人不睦，缺乏决断力。女命尤凶，一不再醮，便是红杏出墙。',
'偏官坐偏印，平，经商异乡，旅游客地，苦乐进尝，易抗上面易发，或经商发达。女命亦作凶论。',
'偏官坐正印，大吉，业务茂盛，发达扬名。女命尤佳，能配不得，得公姑宠爱。',
'正官坐比肩，大吉兆。性端庄谨严，有首领之器，可继承祖业。还复有继承他姓之象。若为女命，凡属良妇，得配贤婿，而成助夫齐家之功，稍有凌夫之嫌，丈夫有点花心。',
'正官坐劫财，不吉。兄弟不睦。有被人连累受害及色情之灾。',
'正官坐食神，大吉。信用卓著，上下和睦，子必显贵，有发达之兆，女人可获美满姻缘。',
'正官坐伤官，大凶。被小人伤害，配偶病弱。男命与妻子别离；女命妨夫，不得夫宠。',
'正官坐偏财，大吉兆。信用卓著，得长辈扶持，信誉佳，在社会上得到荣位，经营商业必昌隆发达，物质享受丰裕。',
'正官坐正财，大吉兆。信誉佳，在社会上可得荣位，物质享受丰裕。',
'正官坐偏官，凶兆。少逸多劳，遭人排斥，诽谤，灾异不绝，易陷迷妄而多损害，若为女命尤凶，绝有色情之灾，不贞之妇，多夫乱来之象，明暗丈夫。前夜丈夫，后夜情夫。',
'正官坐正官，男命大吉昌（不超过三个官杀）。女命不吉，有婚变再嫁之嫌，乃离婚之兆。',
'正官坐偏印，凶兆。代人谋事不成，反受打击。商工业失利，担任公职或静态之学术机构，能扬名获利。',
'正官坐正印，大吉兆。名利亨通，可成就伟业，为名利富贵双收之象。',
'偏印坐比肩，贵人暗而不明，多为人作养子，或继母养育，一生劳碌，常遭遇波折，经营副食，每多损财而失利。',
'偏印坐劫财，大凶，辛劳不绝，与人合作，以方无收获，官独立经营为佳。男女婚姻不遂。',
'偏印坐食神，必受长辈掣制，本身不得自由，大成大败，有始无终，终破家产。若女命则有难产之厄。或暗示与子女有生离死别之凶。',
'偏印坐伤官，主凶，经济不佳，生活困难，家庭频发灾害，有破家与家人离散吉等凶。若女命则有破夫之运，又克子女，克夫之虑。',
'偏印坐偏财大吉，能逃灾祸，一生平安，一有不测，亦有代之，但为副业必招致损失之虑。',
'偏印坐正财最吉，贵人明显，如努力能获得长辈或长官提拨，事业发达迅速，偏业利厚。',
'偏印坐偏官大凶，支出多，收入少，人不敷出，一生多成多败，若抗上，则克身，如柱中有大贵神，则逢凶化吉。',
'偏印坐正官，吉内含凶，外表地位，权力俱重，但内在空虚不足，若女命常使丈夫伤心，且有背弃丈夫，或被丈夫遗异之暗示。',
'偏印坐偏印，生活不固定，易招盗贼、水灾，有失权、龃龉，易患长期暗病，每离家出外，亦辛劳奔波，且受人欺凌，若女命则欺凌丈夫，与子女缘薄。',
'偏印坐正印，吉内含凶，有兼营两种事业，或管家权力，凡事多迷感，易招损失。',
'正印坐比肩主吉，对兄弟朋友善于尽力，诸事顺利，发达，但利润有限。',
'正印坐劫财主吉。业务兴隆，为人慈善，为亲戚朋友招之损矢，但无妨，其经济发达。',
'正印坐食神，受人尊敬，得贵人提拔，步步高升，业务繁荣昌盛，大获财利。',
'正印坐伤官，大凶，名败利破，百事挫折，且与母亲意见相佐。',
'正印坐偏财主吉，家庭圆满，业务繁荣，财丰利厚。',
'正印坐正财，凶兆，谋事难遇良机，病质劳苦，金钱缺乏，母妻不和，或一方久病栊虑。',
'正印坐偏官大吉，正直诚实，信用卓著，获意外之财，家内和睦，能忍让，幸运发展。女命尤吉，可配敦厚佳婿，子嗣孝养。所谓印居煞地，杀助仁德。',
'正印坐正官大吉，吉祥发达，交友慈善，正直诚实，信誉特佳，上级信住器重，逢印有官十有七贵，为大发之命。女命值此及丈夫最佳贤内助。',
'正印坐偏印，不满足一业，但无决断力，常遭失败，多愁善感，与子缘薄。女命尤甚。',
'正印坐正印，不吉，过分厂目信，反遭失败，职业不定，劳苦不绝，与子缘薄，女命尤甚。'];

const BZ_PILLAR_STR_Y = [1.2,0.9,0.6,0.7,1.2,0.5,0.9,0.8,0.7,0.8,1.5,0.9,1.6,0.8,0.8,1.9,1.2,0.6,0.8,0.7,0.5,1.5,0.6,1.6,1.5,0.7,0.9,1.2,1.0,0.7,1.5,0.6,0.5,1.4,1.4,0.9,0.7,0.7,0.9,1.2,0.8,0.7,1.3,0.5,1.4,0.5,0.9,1.7,0.5,0.7,1.2,0.8,0.8,1.9,0.6,0.8,1.6,1.0,0.7,0.6];

const BZ_PILLAR_STR_M = [0.6,0.7,1.8,0.9,0.5,1.6,0.9,1.5,1.8,0.8,0.9,0.5];

const BZ_PILLAR_STR_D = [0.5,1.0,0.8,1.5,1.6,1.5,0.8,1.6,0.8,1.6,0.9,1.7,0.8,1.7,1.0,0.8,0.9,1.8,0.5,1.5,1.0,0.9,0.8,0.9,1.5,1.8,0.7,0.8,1.6,0.6];

const BZ_PILLAR_STR_H = [1.6,0.6,0.7,1.0,0.9,1.6,1.0,0.8,0.8,0.9,0.6,0.6];

function getMingGongBaZhai(mgBranchIdx) {
    const i = mgBranchIdx % 12;
    if (i === 0 || i === 1) return "★子丑宫，土星之垣也，生于此垣，以土为主。其为人也，才擅专门，宜习农林，矿产，铁路，工程，地质，建筑等学科，造诣必高。";
    if (i === 2 || i === 11) return "★寅亥宫，木星之垣也，以木为主。其为人也，宜习法律，经济，医学等科,利于公共机构与慈善团体之活动，如在宗教，学校，医院，社会等事业。";
    if (i === 3 || i === 10) return "★卯戌宫，火星之垣也，以火为主。其为人也，宜习有关理科之学术，利于化工，机械，土木，兵工一类。";
    if (i === 4 || i === 9) return "★辰酉宫，金星之垣也。生于此垣，以金为主。其为人也，多才多艺，宜于攻习文艺，书画，音乐，喜剧，雕刻，金石，装饰及有关美术之学艺。";
    if (i === 5 || i === 8) return "★巳申宫，水星之垣也。生于此垣，以水为主，其为人聪明才智，宜攻读文科,利于文化教育事业。如格局低者，则精神每多忧郁。";
    if (i === 6) return "★午宫，太阳之垣，生于此宫，其为人也，士农工商，无不咸宜。最利攻读政治，功业自然显著，倘格局不利，可能发生心脏病。";
    if (i === 7) return "★未宫，太阴之垣，生于此宫，其为人也，每多自得之情，宜习商科，从事航运，经营流动性之工商业，或办产科医院及任护士。立命此宫，颇有谦让之表现。";
    return "";
}



        function getStemIdx(stem) { return STEMS.indexOf(stem); }
        function getBranchIdx(branch) { return BRANCHES.indexOf(branch); }
        const GZ_60_MAP = Object.fromEntries(GZ_60_ORDER.map((gz, i) => [gz, i]));
        function getGZIdx(gz) { return GZ_60_MAP[gz] ?? -1; }

        // 十神: dayStem为日主, pillarStem为柱天干
        function getTenGod(dayStem, pillarStem) {
            const j = getStemIdx(dayStem) + 1;
            const k = getStemIdx(pillarStem) + 1;
            const A = [1,0,3,2,5,4,7,6,9,8];
            let idx;
            if (j % 2 === 1) idx = (k - j + 10) % 10;
            else idx = A[(k - j + 11) % 10];
            return { short: LIU_QIN[idx], full: LIU_QIN_FULL[idx], cat: SHI_SHEN_J[Math.floor(idx/2)] };
        }

        // 十神类别 (用于五行分析)
        function getTenGodCatIdx(dayStem, pillarStem) {
            const s = getTenGod(dayStem, pillarStem).short;
            return s === '比' || s === '劫' ? 0 :
                s === '食' || s === '伤' ? 1 :
                s === '才' || s === '财' ? 2 :
                s === '杀' || s === '官' ? 3 : 4;
        }

        // 纳音 (通过干支索引)
        function getNaYinForGZ(gz) {
            const idx = getGZIdx(gz);
            if (idx === -1) return '';
            return NAYIN[Math.floor(idx / 2)] || '';
        }

        // 藏干
        function getHiddenStems(branch) {
            const idx = getBranchIdx(branch);
            return CANG_GAN[idx] || '';
        }

        // 十二长生
        function get12Stage(dayStem, branch) {
            const R = getStemIdx(dayStem);
            const Z = getBranchIdx(branch);
            const i = R + 1;
            let s;
            if (i === 1) s = (1 + Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 2) s = (12 + 6 - Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 3) s = (10 + Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 4) s = (12 + 9 - Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 5) s = (10 + Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 6) s = (12 + 9 - Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 7) s = (7 + Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 8) s = (12 - Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 9) s = (4 + Z) % 12;
            else s = (12 + 3 - Z) % 12;
            return ZHANG_SHENG[s];
        }
        function get12StageIdx(dayStem, branch) {
            const R = getStemIdx(dayStem);
            const Z = getBranchIdx(branch);
            const i = R + 1;
            let s;
            if (i === 1) s = (1 + Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 2) s = (12 + 6 - Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 3) s = (10 + Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 4) s = (12 + 9 - Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 5) s = (10 + Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 6) s = (12 + 9 - Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 7) s = (7 + Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 8) s = (12 - Z) % 12;
            else if (i === 9) s = (4 + Z) % 12;
            else s = (12 + 3 - Z) % 12;
            return s;
        }
        // 十神坐基索引（用于BZ_SHISHEN_SEAT查找）
        function getRiZuo(pillarGZIdx, dayGZIdx) {
            const pStem = pillarGZIdx % 10;
            const pBranch = pillarGZIdx % 12;
            const dStem = dayGZIdx % 10;
            // 十神 = (pStem - dStem + 10) % 10 → 0=比肩,1=劫财,...
            const ssIdx = (pStem - dStem + 10) % 10;
            // 地支藏干本气十神
            const cangGanMain = CANG_GAN[pBranch] ? CANG_GAN[pBranch][0] : '';
            const cgIdx = cangGanMain ? (STEMS.indexOf(cangGanMain) - dStem + 10) % 10 : 0;
            // 组合索引: ssIdx * 10 + cgIdx
            return ssIdx * 10 + cgIdx;
        }

        // 天干五行索引
        function getStemWxIdx(stem) {
            const si = getStemIdx(stem);
            return Math.floor(si / 2);
        }
        // 地支五行索引
        function getBranchWxIdx(branch) {
            const map = { '寅':0,'卯':0,'巳':1,'午':1,'申':3,'酉':3,'亥':4,'子':4,'辰':2,'戌':2,'丑':2,'未':2 };
            return map[branch] !== undefined ? map[branch] : -1;
        }

        // 八字重量
        function getBaziWeight(yearGZ, monthGZ, dayGZ, hourBranch) {
            const yi = getGZIdx(yearGZ);
            const mi = getGZIdx(monthGZ);
            const di = getGZIdx(dayGZ);
            const hi = getBranchIdx(hourBranch);
            if (yi === -1 || mi === -1 || di === -1 || hi === -1) return 0;
            return BZ_WT_Y[yi] + BZ_WT_M[mi % 12] + BZ_WT_D[di % 30] + BZ_WT_H[hi];
        }

        // 空亡
        function getXunKong(gz) {
            const idx = getGZIdx(gz);
            if (idx === -1) return '';
            const xunIdx = Math.floor(idx / 10);
            const z1 = BRANCHES[(xunIdx * 10) % 12];
            const z2 = BRANCHES[(xunIdx * 10 + 1) % 12];
            return '(' + z1 + z2 + ')空';
        }

        // 五行分布统计 (从天干地支统计)
        function countWuxing(stems, branches) {
            const cnt = { '木': 0, '火': 0, '土': 0, '金': 0, '水': 0 };
            const idxToName = ['木','火','土','金','水'];
            for (const s of stems) { const i = getStemWxIdx(s); if (i >= 0) cnt[idxToName[i]]++; }
            for (const b of branches) { const i = getBranchWxIdx(b); if (i >= 0) cnt[idxToName[i]]++; }
            return cnt;
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  工具函数
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        // lunisolar 库闰月编码为 month+100 (如闰三月=103)，统一归一化
        function normLunarMonth(m) { m = Math.abs(m); return m > 100 ? m - 100 : m; }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  倒家杀判定（年倒家杀 + 月倒家杀）
        //  年倒家杀：年天干定日干支
        //  月倒家杀：农历月定日干支（含多个干支组合）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const DAOJIA_YEAR = { '甲':'庚午','己':'庚午', '乙':'甲申','庚':'甲申', '丙':'戊戌','辛':'戊戌', '丁':'壬子','壬':'壬子', '戊':'甲寅','癸':'甲寅' };
        const DAOJIA_MONTH = {
            1: ['壬寅'], 2: ['壬午'], 3: ['庚寅','庚申'], 4: ['辛未'], 5: ['乙亥'], 6: ['辛卯'],
            7: ['壬寅'], 8: ['壬午'], 9: ['庚寅','庚申'], 10: ['辛未'], 11: ['乙亥'], 12: ['辛卯']
        };
        // 年倒家杀：年干定基准日，取同支5日（如甲己→庚午→甲午丙午戊午庚午壬午）
        // 月倒家杀：农历月定指定干支日
        // 年干以立春为界，由 lunisolar char8.year 保证
        function isDaojiaYearDay(yearStem, dayGZ) {
            if (!yearStem || !dayGZ) return false;
            const yDj = DAOJIA_YEAR[yearStem];
            return !!(yDj && dayGZ[1] === yDj[1]);
        }
        function isDaojiaMonthDay(lunarMonth, dayGZ) {
            if (!lunarMonth || !dayGZ) return false;
            const lm = normLunarMonth(lunarMonth);
            const mDj = DAOJIA_MONTH[lm];
            return !!(mDj && mDj.includes(dayGZ));
        }
        function isDaojiaDay(yearStem, dayGZ, lunarMonth) {
            return isDaojiaYearDay(yearStem, dayGZ) || isDaojiaMonthDay(lunarMonth, dayGZ);
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  设置持久化
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function loadSetting(key, def) {
            try { const v = localStorage.getItem('cal_'+key); return v !== null ? JSON.parse(v) : def; }
            catch(e) { return def; }
        }
        function _flashMsg(msg) {
            let el = document.getElementById('flashToast');
            if (!el) {
                el = document.createElement('div');
                el.id = 'flashToast';
                el.style.cssText = 'position:fixed;top:1rem;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);background:#c62828;color:#fff;padding:0.5rem 1.2rem;border-radius:20px;font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:700;z-index:9999;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity 0.3s;';
                document.body.appendChild(el);
            }
            el.textContent = msg;
            el.style.opacity = '1';
            clearTimeout(el._timer);
            el._timer = setTimeout(() => { el.style.opacity = '0'; }, 2500);
        }
        function saveSetting(key, val) {
            try { localStorage.setItem('cal_'+key, JSON.stringify(val)); }
            catch(e) { _flashMsg('存储空间不足，设置未保存'); }
        }
        window.onSettingChange = function() {
            saveSetting('showWulu', document.getElementById('togWuluBadge').checked);
            saveSetting('showDaojiaMonth', document.getElementById('togDaojiaMonth').checked);
            saveSetting('showDaojiaYear', document.getElementById('togDaojiaYear').checked);
            renderCal(_barY, _barM);
        };

        const ZODIAC = [
            { n: '摩羯座', e: '♑', t: '坚韧务实·厚积薄发', s: [12, 22], end: [1, 19] },
            { n: '水瓶座', e: '♒', t: '独立创新·思想超前', s: [1, 20], end: [2, 18] },
            { n: '双鱼座', e: '♓', t: '浪漫敏感·富有直觉', s: [2, 19], end: [3, 20] },
            { n: '白羊座', e: '♈', t: '热情勇敢·行动力强', s: [3, 21], end: [4, 19] },
            { n: '金牛座', e: '♉', t: '稳健可靠·品味卓越', s: [4, 20], end: [5, 20] },
            { n: '双子座', e: '♊', t: '机智灵活·善于沟通', s: [5, 21], end: [6, 21] },
            { n: '巨蟹座', e: '♋', t: '温柔顾家·情感细腻', s: [6, 22], end: [7, 22] },
            { n: '狮子座', e: '♌', t: '自信慷慨·天生领袖', s: [7, 23], end: [8, 22] },
            { n: '处女座', e: '♍', t: '细致严谨·追求完美', s: [8, 23], end: [9, 22] },
            { n: '天秤座', e: '♎', t: '优雅公正·和谐至上', s: [9, 23], end: [10, 23] },
            { n: '天蝎座', e: '♏', t: '深邃敏锐·意志坚定', s: [10, 24], end: [11, 22] },
            { n: '射手座', e: '♐', t: '乐观自由·探索未知', s: [11, 23], end: [12, 21] }];

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  工具函数
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function getZodiac(m, d) {
            for (const z of ZODIAC) {
                const afterStart = (m === z.s[0] && d >= z.s[1]);
                const beforeEnd = (m === z.end[0] && d <= z.end[1]);
                if (afterStart || beforeEnd) return z;
            }
            return ZODIAC[0];
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  二十八宿值日 — 《协纪辨方书》七元甲子法
        //  420日一大周期(60甲子×7元), 锚点: 1996-01-28 = 一元甲子·虚宿
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const XIU_YUAN_START = [10, 14, 18, 22, 26, 2, 6]; // 虚,奎,毕,鬼,翼,氐,箕 在XIU中的索引
        function xiuIndex(y, m, d) {
            const anchor = Date.UTC(1996, 0, 28);
            const target = Date.UTC(y, m - 1, d);
            const daysDiff = Math.round((target - anchor) / 86400000);
            const cyclePos = ((daysDiff % 420) + 420) % 420;
            const yuanIdx = Math.floor(cyclePos / 60);
            const dayOff = cyclePos % 60;
            return (XIU_YUAN_START[yuanIdx] + dayOff) % 28;
        }

        // 红砂日（小红砂）— 以节气月建+日支判定
        function isHongSha(monthBranch, dayBranch) {
            const meng = new Set(['寅','巳','申','亥']); // 四孟月
            const zhong = new Set(['卯','午','酉','子']); // 四仲月
            const ji = new Set(['辰','未','戌','丑']); // 四季月
            if (meng.has(monthBranch) && dayBranch === '酉') return true;
            if (zhong.has(monthBranch) && dayBranch === '巳') return true;
            if (ji.has(monthBranch) && dayBranch === '丑') return true;
            return false;
        }

        // 金神七煞日 — 值此七宿则为犯煞
        const JINSHEN_XIU = new Set([0, 1, 8, 14, 15, 22, 24]); // 角亢牛奎娄鬼星
        function isJinShen(xiuIdx) { return JINSHEN_XIU.has(xiuIdx); }

        // 灭门大祸日 — 以农历月+日支判定
        const MIEMEN_MAP = {
            1: ['巳','亥'], 2: ['辰','戌'], 3: ['卯','酉'], 4: ['寅','申'],
            5: ['丑','未'], 6: ['子','午'], 7: ['巳','亥'], 8: ['辰','戌'],
            9: ['卯','酉'], 10: ['寅','申'], 11: ['丑','未'], 12: ['子','午']
        };
        function isMiemenDay(lunarMonth, dayBranch) {
            const branches = MIEMEN_MAP[normLunarMonth(lunarMonth)];
            return branches ? branches.includes(dayBranch) : false;
        }

        // 受死日 — 以农历月+日支判定
        const SHOUSI_MAP = { 1:'戌', 2:'辰', 3:'亥', 4:'巳', 5:'子', 6:'午', 7:'丑', 8:'未', 9:'寅', 10:'申', 11:'卯', 12:'酉' };
        function isShousiDay(lunarMonth, dayBranch) {
            const lm = normLunarMonth(lunarMonth);
            return SHOUSI_MAP[lm] === dayBranch;
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  三丧日 — 春辰·夏未·秋戌·冬丑（农历月定季）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function isSansangDay(lunarMonth, dayBranch) {
            const lm = normLunarMonth(lunarMonth);
            if (lm >= 1 && lm <= 3) return dayBranch === '辰';
            if (lm >= 4 && lm <= 6) return dayBranch === '未';
            if (lm >= 7 && lm <= 9) return dayBranch === '戌';
            if (lm >= 10 && lm <= 12) return dayBranch === '丑';
            return false;
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  重丧日 — 月令定忌干（正甲二乙三月戊…）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const CHONGSANG_MAP = { 1:'甲', 2:'乙', 3:'戊', 4:'丙', 5:'丁', 6:'己', 7:'庚', 8:'辛', 9:'戊', 10:'壬', 11:'癸', 12:'己' };
        function isChongsangDay(lunarMonth, dayStem) {
            return CHONGSANG_MAP[normLunarMonth(lunarMonth)] === dayStem;
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  横天朱雀日 — 农历初一·初九·十七·廿五
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const HENGTIAN_DAYS = new Set([1, 9, 17, 25]);
        function isHengtianDay(lunarDay) { return HENGTIAN_DAYS.has(lunarDay); }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  大煞白虎入中宫 — 按旬查日柱
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const DASHA_XUN = { 0: 4, 1: 3, 2: 2, 3: 1, 4: [0, 9], 5: 8 };
        function isDashaDay(dayGZ) {
            const idx = getGZIdx(dayGZ);
            if (idx === -1) return false;
            const xun = Math.floor(idx / 10);
            const k = idx % 10;
            const target = DASHA_XUN[xun];
            if (target === undefined) return false;
            return Array.isArray(target) ? target.includes(k) : k === target;
        }

        // 雷霆白虎入中宫 — 按月天干查日柱
        const LEITING_MAP = {
            '甲': new Set(['丁卯','丙子','甲午','癸卯','壬子','辛酉','乙酉']),
            '己': new Set(['丁卯','丙子','甲午','癸卯','壬子','辛酉','乙酉']),
            '乙': new Set(['戊辰','丁丑','丙子','乙未','甲辰','癸丑','壬戌']),
            '庚': new Set(['戊辰','丁丑','丙子','乙未','甲辰','癸丑','壬戌']),
            '丙': new Set(['辛未','庚辰','己丑','戊戌','丁未','丙辰']),
            '辛': new Set(['辛未','庚辰','己丑','戊戌','丁未','丙辰']),
            '丁': new Set(['乙丑','甲戌','癸未','壬辰','辛丑','庚戌','己未']),
            '壬': new Set(['乙丑','甲戌','癸未','壬辰','辛丑','庚戌','己未'])
        };
        function isLeitingDay(monthStem, dayGZ) {
            const s = LEITING_MAP[monthStem];
            return s ? s.has(dayGZ) : false;
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  天地空亡 — 八宫掌诀推算法（后天八卦配十二支）
        //  口诀：午值天空子地空。年上起月，月上起日，顺行八宫。
        //  公式：日卦位 = (年卦位 + 月数 + 日数 - 2) mod 8
        //  卦位4(离/午)→天空日，卦位0(坎/子)→地空日
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const GONG_DZ = [
            ['子'],           // 0 坎
            ['丑','寅'],      // 1 艮
            ['卯'],           // 2 震
            ['辰','巳'],      // 3 巽
            ['午'],           // 4 离
            ['未','申'],      // 5 坤
            ['酉'],           // 6 兑
            ['戌','亥']       // 7 乾
        ];
        function _getGongIdx(branch) {
            for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {
                if (GONG_DZ[i].includes(branch)) return i;
            }
            return -1;
        }
        function getKongwangResult(yearBranch, lunarMonth, lunarDay) {
            const gi = _getGongIdx(yearBranch);
            if (gi === -1) return '';
            // 闰月同前月宫位，统一归一化
            const dayGi = (gi + normLunarMonth(lunarMonth) + lunarDay - 2) % 8;
            if (dayGi === 4) return '天空';
            if (dayGi === 0) return '地空';
            return '';
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  三伏天 — 夏至三庚入伏，立秋一庚末伏
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const _sanfuCache = new Map();
        function getSanfuPeriods(year) {
            if (_sanfuCache.has(year)) return _sanfuCache.get(year);
            // 找夏至（约6月21-22日）
            let xzDate = null, lqDate = null;
            for (let d = 20; d <= 23; d++) {
                const lsr = lunisolar(new Date(year, 5, d, 12, 0, 0));
                if (lsr.solarTerm && lsr.solarTerm.toString() === '夏至') { xzDate = new Date(year, 5, d); break; }
            }
            if (!xzDate) { _sanfuCache.set(year, null); return null; }
            // 找立秋（约8月7-8日）
            for (let d = 6; d <= 9; d++) {
                const lsr = lunisolar(new Date(year, 7, d, 12, 0, 0));
                if (lsr.solarTerm && lsr.solarTerm.toString() === '立秋') { lqDate = new Date(year, 7, d); break; }
            }
            if (!lqDate) { _sanfuCache.set(year, null); return null; }
            // 从夏至起找出所有庚日
            const gengDays = [];
            const endDate = new Date(year, 7, 20); // 搜到8月20日足够
            const cur = new Date(xzDate);
            while (cur <= endDate) {
                const y = cur.getFullYear(), m = cur.getMonth(), d = cur.getDate();
                const lsr = lunisolar(new Date(y, m, d, 12, 0, 0));
                const gz = lsr.char8.day.toString();
                if (gz[0] === '庚') gengDays.push(new Date(y, m, d));
                cur.setDate(cur.getDate() + 1);
            }
            if (gengDays.length < 4) { _sanfuCache.set(year, null); return null; }
            const chufuStart = gengDays[2]; // 第3个庚日（0-indexed）
            const zhongfuStart = gengDays[3]; // 第4个庚日
            // 末伏：立秋后第一个庚日
            let mofuStart = null;
            for (const gd of gengDays) {
                if (gd >= lqDate) { mofuStart = gd; break; }
            }
            if (!mofuStart) { _sanfuCache.set(year, null); return null; }
            const chufuEnd = new Date(zhongfuStart); chufuEnd.setDate(chufuEnd.getDate() - 1);
            const zhongfuEnd = new Date(mofuStart); zhongfuEnd.setDate(zhongfuEnd.getDate() - 1);
            const mofuEnd = new Date(mofuStart); mofuEnd.setDate(mofuEnd.getDate() + 9);
            const result = {
                chufu: { start: chufuStart, end: chufuEnd },
                zhongfu: { start: zhongfuStart, end: zhongfuEnd },
                mofu: { start: mofuStart, end: mofuEnd }
            };
            _sanfuCache.set(year, result);
            return result;
        }
        function getSanfuInfo(y, m, d) {
            const periods = getSanfuPeriods(y);
            if (!periods) return null;
            const date = new Date(y, m - 1, d);
            const ONE_DAY = 86400000;
            if (date >= periods.chufu.start && date <= periods.chufu.end) return { period: '初伏', day: Math.floor((date - periods.chufu.start) / ONE_DAY) + 1 };
            if (date >= periods.zhongfu.start && date <= periods.zhongfu.end) return { period: '中伏', day: Math.floor((date - periods.zhongfu.start) / ONE_DAY) + 1 };
            if (date >= periods.mofu.start && date <= periods.mofu.end) return { period: '末伏', day: Math.floor((date - periods.mofu.start) / ONE_DAY) + 1 };
            return null;
        }

        // 冰消瓦解日 — 满宫掌法：太岁上起正月，月上起初一，遇子为冰消，遇午为瓦解
        function getBingXiaoWaJie(yearBranch, lunarMonth, lunarDay) {
            const yi = BRANCHES.indexOf(yearBranch);
            if (yi < 0) return null;
            const lm = normLunarMonth(lunarMonth);
            const monthStartIdx = (yi + lm - 1) % 12;
            const dayIdx = (monthStartIdx + lunarDay - 1) % 12;
            const dayBr = BRANCHES[dayIdx];
            if (dayBr === '子') return '冰消';
            if (dayBr === '午') return '瓦解';
            return null;
        }

        function shaDir(branchVal) {
            if ([2, 6, 10].includes(branchVal)) return '北';
            if ([8, 0, 4].includes(branchVal)) return '南';
            if ([11, 3, 7].includes(branchVal)) return '西';
            if ([5, 9, 1].includes(branchVal)) return '东';
            return '';
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  时柱计算（五鼠遁法, 参照6tail/lunar源码）
        //  原理：以日干定子时起始天干，依时辰地支推演
        //  甲己日→甲子起, 乙庚日→丙子起, 丙辛日→戊子起, 丁壬日→庚子起, 戊癸日→壬子起
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function getShichen(hour) {
            const idx = Math.floor(((hour + 1) % 24) / 2);
            return { index: idx, name: SHICHEN_FULL[idx], branch: BRANCHES[idx] };
        }
        function getHourGZ(dayStem, hour) {
            const dayStemIdx = STEMS.indexOf(dayStem);
            const shichen = getShichen(hour);
            const startStem = (dayStemIdx % 5) * 2;
            const hourStemIdx = (startStem + shichen.index) % 10;
            const hourStem = STEMS[hourStemIdx];
            return { stem: hourStem, branch: shichen.branch, gz: hourStem + shichen.branch, shichen: shichen.name };
        }
        function getNayinForGZ(stem, branch) {
            return getNaYinForGZ(stem + branch);
        }
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  十神计算 (以日干为中心)
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const SHISHEN_NAMES = ['比肩','劫财','食神','伤官','偏财','正财','七杀','正官','偏印','正印'];
        const STEM_YANG = [true,false,true,false,true,false,true,false,true,false];
        function getShiShen(dayStem, targetStem) {
            const di = STEMS.indexOf(dayStem);
            const ti = STEMS.indexOf(targetStem);
            const dElem = Math.floor(di / 2), tElem = Math.floor(ti / 2);
            const sameYinYang = STEM_YANG[di] === STEM_YANG[ti];
            if (dElem === tElem) return sameYinYang ? '比肩' : '劫财';
            if ((dElem + 1) % 5 === tElem) return sameYinYang ? '食神' : '伤官';
            if ((dElem + 2) % 5 === tElem) return sameYinYang ? '偏财' : '正财';
            if ((dElem + 3) % 5 === tElem) return sameYinYang ? '七杀' : '正官';
            if ((dElem + 4) % 5 === tElem) return sameYinYang ? '偏印' : '正印';
            return '——';
        }
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  时辰黄道黑道 — 日支定青龙，顺推十二神
        //  口诀：道远几时通达，路遥何日还乡
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const HUANGDAO_SHEN = ['青龙','明堂','天刑','朱雀','金匮','天德','白虎','玉堂','天牢','玄武','司命','勾陈'];
        const HUANGDAO_YELLOW = [true,true,false,false,true,true,false,true,false,false,true,false];
        const HUANGDAO_KJ = { '青龙':'道','明堂':'远','天刑':'几','朱雀':'时','金匮':'通','天德':'达','白虎':'路','玉堂':'遥','天牢':'何','玄武':'日','司命':'还','勾陈':'乡' };
        const QINGLONG_START = { '寅':'子','申':'子','卯':'寅','酉':'寅','辰':'辰','戌':'辰','巳':'午','亥':'午','子':'申','午':'申','丑':'戌','未':'戌' };
        function getShichenHuangHei(dayBranch) {
            const ql = QINGLONG_START[dayBranch];
            if (!ql) return [];
            const qlIdx = BRANCHES.indexOf(ql);
            const rows = [];
            for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {
                const offset = (i - qlIdx + 12) % 12;
                const god = HUANGDAO_SHEN[offset];
                rows.push({ branch: BRANCHES[i], god, koujue: HUANGDAO_KJ[god], yellow: HUANGDAO_YELLOW[offset], full: SHICHEN_FULL[i] });
            }
            return rows;
        }
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  空亡计算
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function getXunKongBranches(stem, branch) {
            const si = STEMS.indexOf(stem);
            const bi = BRANCHES.indexOf(branch);
            const jiaBranch = (bi - si + 12) % 12;
            return [BRANCHES[(jiaBranch + 10) % 12], BRANCHES[(jiaBranch + 11) % 12]];
        }
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  藏干 (地支藏干 - object map)
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const CANG_GAN_OBJ = {
            '子': ['癸'], '丑': ['己','癸','辛'], '寅': ['甲','丙','戊'],
            '卯': ['乙'], '辰': ['戊','乙','癸'], '巳': ['丙','庚','戊'],
            '午': ['丁','己'], '未': ['己','丁','乙'], '申': ['庚','壬','戊'],
            '酉': ['辛'], '戌': ['戊','辛','丁'], '亥': ['壬','甲']
        };
        function getCangGan(branch) { return CANG_GAN_OBJ[branch] || []; }
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  旺相休囚死 (以月支定季节)
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function getWangXiang(monthBranch) {
            const season = BRANCH_WX[monthBranch] || '土';
            const result = { '木':'','火':'','土':'','金':'','水':'' };
            const order = ['木','火','土','金','水'];
            const si = order.indexOf(season);
            result[order[si]] = '旺';
            result[order[(si + 1) % 5]] = '相';
            result[order[(si + 4) % 5]] = '休';
            result[order[(si + 3) % 5]] = '囚';
            result[order[(si + 2) % 5]] = '死';
            return result;
        }
        function getStemWuxing(stem) { return WUXING_STEM[STEMS.indexOf(stem)] || ''; }
        function getBranchWuxing(branch) { return WUXING_BRANCH[branch] || ''; }
        function getWuxingCSS(wx) {
            const map = {
                '木': { color: 'var(--wx-wood)', bg: 'var(--wx-wood-bg)', border: 'var(--wx-wood-border)' },
                '火': { color: 'var(--wx-fire)', bg: 'var(--wx-fire-bg)', border: 'var(--wx-fire-border)' },
                '土': { color: 'var(--wx-earth)', bg: 'var(--wx-earth-bg)', border: 'var(--wx-earth-border)' },
                '金': { color: 'var(--wx-metal)', bg: 'var(--wx-metal-bg)', border: 'var(--wx-metal-border)' },
                '水': { color: 'var(--wx-water)', bg: 'var(--wx-water-bg)', border: 'var(--wx-water-border)' }
            };
            return map[wx] || { color: '#999', bg: '#f5f5f5', border: '#ddd' };
        }
        function renderPillarCard(label, stem, branch, nayin, opts = {}) {
            const { isDayMaster = false, shichen = '', detailId = '' } = opts;
            const sWx = getStemWuxing(stem);
            const bWx = getBranchWuxing(branch);
            const sCss = getWuxingCSS(sWx);
            const bCss = getWuxingCSS(bWx);
            const dmClass = isDayMaster ? ' day-master' : '';
            return `<div class="pillar-card${dmClass}"${detailId ? ' id="'+detailId+'"' : ''}>
              <div class="pillar-label">${label}${isDayMaster ? '<span class="day-master-badge">日主</span>' : ''}</div>
              <div class="pillar-gz">
                <span class="stem-char" style="color:${sCss.color};background:${sCss.bg};border:1.5px solid ${sCss.border}">${stem}</span>
                <span class="branch-char" style="color:${bCss.color};background:${bCss.bg};border:1.5px solid ${bCss.border}">${branch}</span>
              </div>
              <div class="pillar-nayin">${nayin}</div>
              ${shichen ? '<div class="pillar-shch">'+shichen+'</div>' : ''}
              ${isDayMaster ? '<div class="pillar-detail-hint">点击展开解读 <i class="ti ti-chevron-down"></i></div>' : '<div class="pillar-detail-hint">点击展开 <i class="ti ti-chevron-down"></i></div>'}
            </div>`;
        }
        function getWuxingCounts(yearGZ, monthGZ, dayGZ, hourGZ) {
            const counts = { '木': 0, '火': 0, '土': 0, '金': 0, '水': 0 };
            [yearGZ, monthGZ, dayGZ, hourGZ].forEach(gz => {
                if (!gz || gz.length < 2) return;
                const sw = getStemWuxing(gz[0]);
                const bw = getBranchWuxing(gz[1]);
                if (sw) counts[sw] = (counts[sw] || 0) + 1;
                if (bw) counts[bw] = (counts[bw] || 0) + 1;
            });
            return counts;
        }
        function renderWuxingDist(counts, wangXiangMap = null) {
            const order = ['木', '火', '土', '金', '水'];
            const values = order.map(w => counts[w] || 0);
            const total = values.reduce((a,b) => a+b, 0) || 1;
            const colors = ['#2e7d32','#c62828','#e65100','#f9a825','#1565c0'];
            const wxLabels = { '旺':'旺','相':'相','休':'休','囚':'囚','死':'死' };
            const wxClass = { '旺':'wx-status-wang','相':'wx-status-xiang','休':'wx-status-xiu','囚':'wx-status-qiu','死':'wx-status-si' };
            let h = '<div class="wx-bar-wrap">';
            for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {
                const pct = Math.round(values[i] / total * 100);
                const status = wangXiangMap ? wangXiangMap[order[i]] : '';
                const sc = status ? wxClass[status] : '';
                h += '<div class="wx-bar-item"><span class="wx-bar-label" style="color:' + colors[i] + '">' + order[i] + '</span><div class="wx-bar-bg"><div class="wx-bar-fill" style="width:' + pct + '%;background:' + colors[i] + '"></div></div><span class="wx-bar-pct">' + values[i] + '</span>' + (status ? '<span class="wx-row-status ' + sc + '">' + wxLabels[status] + '</span>' : '') + '</div>';
            }
            h += '</div>';
            return h;
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  每日记事（localStorage）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const NOTE_PREFIX = 'cal_note_';
        function noteKey(y, m, d) { return NOTE_PREFIX + [y, String(m).padStart(2,'0'), String(d).padStart(2,'0')].join('-'); }
        function loadNote(y, m, d) { return localStorage.getItem(noteKey(y, m, d)) || ''; }
        function saveNote(y, m, d, text) {
            const key = noteKey(y, m, d);
            try {
                if (text.trim()) localStorage.setItem(key, text);
                else localStorage.removeItem(key);
            } catch(e) { _flashMsg('存储空间不足，笔记未保存'); }
        }
        function hasNote(y, m, d) { return !!localStorage.getItem(noteKey(y, m, d)); }
        function preloadMonthNotes(y, m) {
            const set = new Set();
            const prefix = `cal_note_${y}-${String(m).padStart(2,'0')}-`;
            for (let i = 0; i < localStorage.length; i++) {
                const key = localStorage.key(i);
                if (key && key.startsWith(prefix)) {
                    const d = parseInt(key.slice(prefix.length), 10);
                    if (d >= 1 && d <= 31 && localStorage.getItem(key)) set.add(d);
                }
            }
            return set;
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  节日数据（严格参照资料）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════

        // 公历节日（按日期），type: #=放假 I=主要 .=其它
        const SOLAR_RAW = {
            1: ['01#元旦','06.2005-9999中国13亿人口日','08.1976-9999周恩来逝世','09.1979-9999叶风扬诞辰','21.1924-9999列宁逝世','26.1924-9999国际海关日','27.1893-9999宋庆龄诞辰'],
            2: ['02.1996-9999世界湿地日','10.1960-9999国际气象节','14I情人节','19.1997-9999邓小平逝世'],
            3: ['01.1983-9999国际海豹日','03.2000-9999全国爱耳日','05.1963-9999学雷锋纪念日','05.1898-9999周恩来诞辰','08I妇女节','12I植树节','12.1925-9999孙中山逝世','14.国际警察日','15I1983-9999消费者权益日','17.1929-9999中国国医节','17.国际航海日','21.1972-9999世界森林日','21.2001-9999世界睡眠日','21.1976-9999消除种族歧视国际日','21.世界儿歌日','22I1993-9999世界水日 中国水周','23I1950-9999世界气象日','24.1982-9999世界防治结核病日','25.全国中小学生安全教育日','30.巴勒斯坦国土日'],
            4: ['01I1564-9999愚人节','01.全国爱国卫生运动月','01.税收宣传月','07I世界卫生日','13I傣族泼水节13-15日','22I世界地球日','22.1870-9999列宁诞辰','23.1995-9999世界图书和版权日','24.亚非新闻工作者日','26.2000-9999世界知识产权日'],
            5: ['01#1889-9999劳动节','03.世界新闻自由日 太阳日','04I1919-9999五四运动纪念日','04I1939-9999青年节','05.碘缺乏病防治日','08.1948-9999世界红十字日 微笑日','12I1912-9999国际护士节','15I1994-9999国际家庭日','17.1969-9999国际电信日','18.国际博物馆日','20.1990-9999全国学生营养日 全国母乳喂养宣传日','20.1999-9999世界计量日','23.国际牛奶日','26.1993-9999人体极限挑战日','29.2002-9999国际维和人员日','29.1981-9999宋庆龄逝世','30I1925-9999五卅反帝运动纪念日','31I无烟日'],
            6: ['01I1925-9999国际儿童节','05.1974-9999世界环境保护日','06.1996-9999全国爱眼日','11.2002-9999世界无童工日','14.2004-9999世界献血者日','17.防治荒漠化和干旱日','20.2001-9999世界难民日','23.国际奥林匹克日','25.1991-9999全国土地日','26I国际禁毒日'],
            7: ['01I1997-9999香港回归纪念日','01I1921-9999中国共产党建党纪念日','01.1985-9999世界建筑日','02.国际体育记者日','06.1976-9999朱德逝世','07I1937-9999抗日战争纪念日','11I1987-9999世界50亿人口日','11.2005-9999中国航海日','20.1969-9999人类月球日','30.非洲妇女日'],
            8: ['01I1927-9999建军节','06.1932-9999国际电影节','08.1988-9999中国男子节','13.1975-9999国际左撇子日','15I1945-9999抗日战争胜利纪念'],
            9: ['08.1966-9999国际扫盲日','08.国际新闻工作者日','09.1976-9999毛泽东逝世纪念','10I1985-9999中国教师节','14.世界清洁地球日','16.1987-9999国际臭氧层保护日','18I1931-9999九·一八事变纪念日','20.1989-9999爱牙日','21I2002-9999国际和平日','25I1881-9999鲁迅诞辰','27.1979-9999世界旅游日','28I孔子诞辰'],
            10: ['01#1949-9999国庆节','01.1980-9999世界音乐日','01.1991-9999国际老人节','02#1949-9999国庆假日','02.1949-9999国际和平与民主自由斗争日','03#1949-9999国庆假日','04.1949-9999世界动物日','08.1998-9999全国高血压日','08.世界视觉日','09.1969-9999世界邮政日','10I1911-9999辛亥革命纪念日','10.1992-9999世界精神卫生日','12I1999-9999世界60亿人口日','13.世界保健日','13.国际教师节','14I1969-9999世界标准日','15.1984-9999国际盲人节','16.1979-9999世界粮食日','17.1992-9999世界消除贫困日','19.1936-9999鲁迅逝世','22.1992-9999世界传统医药日','24.1945-9999联合国日','28.2000-9999男性健康日','31.世界勤俭日'],
            11: ['07.1917-9999十月社会主义革命纪念日','08.2000-9999中国记者日','09.1992-9999全国消防安全宣传教育日','10.1946-9999世界青年节','11.国际科学与和平周','12.1866-9999孙中山诞辰','12.1969-9999刘少奇逝世','14.1991-9999世界糖尿病日','17.1946-9999国际大学生节','20.彝族年','21.彝族年','21.1973-9999世界问候日','21.1996-9999世界电视日','22.彝族年','24.1893-9999刘少奇诞辰','29.1977-9999国际声援巴勒斯坦人民国际日'],
            12: ['01.1988-9999世界艾滋病日','01.1886-9999朱德诞辰','02.1986-9999废除一切形式奴役世界日','03.1992-9999世界残疾人日','05.1985-9999国际经济和社会发展志愿人员日','07.1994-9999国际民航日','09.1935-9999一二·九运动纪念日','09.1995-9999世界足球日','10.1950-9999世界人权日','12I1936-9999西安事变纪念日','13I1937-9999南京大屠杀纪念日','20.1999-9999澳门回归纪念','21.国际篮球日','24I平安夜','25I圣诞节','26.1893-9999毛泽东诞辰纪念','28.1987-9999世界小丑节','29.1994-9999国际生物多样性日']
        };

        // 解析后的公历节日 Map<'MM-DD', [{type,name}]>
        const SOLAR_HOLIDAYS = new Map();
        function buildSolar() {
            for (const [m, arr] of Object.entries(SOLAR_RAW)) {
                const mm = String(m).padStart(2,'0');
                for (const entry of arr) {
                    const dd = entry.substring(0,2);
                    const type = entry[2];
                    let rest = entry.substring(3);
                    let startY = -Infinity, endY = Infinity;
                    if (/^\d{4}-\d{4}/.test(rest)) {
                        startY = +rest.substring(0,4);
                        endY = +rest.substring(5,9);
                        rest = rest.substring(9); // "YYYY-YYYY" = 9 chars
                    }
                    const key = mm + '-' + dd;
                    if (!SOLAR_HOLIDAYS.has(key)) SOLAR_HOLIDAYS.set(key, []);
                    SOLAR_HOLIDAYS.get(key).push({ type, name: rest.trim(), startY, endY });
                }
            }
        }
        buildSolar();

        // 周基节日：month, week(1-5, 0=最后), dayOfWeek(0日-6六), type, name
        const WEEK_HOLIDAYS = [
            [1, 1, 0, '.', '黑人日'],[1, 0, 0, '.', '世界麻风日'],
            [3, 0, 1, '.', '中小学生安全教育日'],[4, 3, 0, '.', '世界儿童日'],
            [4, 0, 3, '.', '秘书节'],[5, 1, 2, '.', '世界哮喘日'],
            [5, 2, 0, 'I', '母亲节'],[5, 3, 0, 'I', '全国助残日'],
            [5, 3, 2, '.', '国际牛奶日'],[6, 3, 0, 'I', '父亲节'],
            [7, 1, 6, '.', '国际合作节'],[7, 3, 0, '.', '被奴役国家周'],
            [8, 3, 6, '.', '荷兰海红节'],[8, 0, 3, '.', '西班牙番茄节'],
            [9, 1, 1, '.', '美国劳动节'],[9, 3, 6, '.', '全民国防教育日'],
            [9, 3, 2, 'I', '国际和平日'],[9, 4, 0, '.', '国际聋人节 世界儿童日'],
            [9, 0, 0, 'I', '世界海事日 世界心脏日'],
            [10, 1, 1, '.', '世界人居日 国际住房日'],
            [10, 1, 3, 'I', '国际减轻自然灾害日'],[11, 4, 4, 'I', '感恩节'],
            [12, 2, 0, '.', '国际儿童电视广播日']
        ];

        // 农历节日（按农历月日），type: #=放假 I=主要 .=其它  month: 1-12, 99=除夕
        const LUNAR_HOLIDAYS = [
            [1, '初一', '#', '春节 大年初一'],
            [1, '初二', '#', '大年初二'],
            [1, '初三', '#', '大年初三'],
            [1, '十五', 'I', '元宵节 上元节 壮族歌墟节 苗族踩山节'],
            [1, '十六', '.', '侗族芦笙节'],
            [1, '廿五', '.', '填仓节'],
            [1, '廿九', '.', '送穷日'],
            [2, '初一', '.', '瑶族忌鸟节'],
            [2, '初二', '.', '春龙节(龙抬头) 畲族会亲节'],
            [2, '初八', '.', '傈傈族刀杆节'],
            [3, '初三', '.', '北帝诞 苗族黎族歌墟节'],
            [3, '十五', '.', '白族三月街'],
            [3, '廿三', '.', '天后诞 妈祖诞'],
            [4, '初八', '.', '牛王诞'],
            [4, '十八', '.', '锡伯族西迁节'],
            [5, '初五', '#', '端午节 黎族朝花节 苗族龙船节'],
            [5, '十三', '.', '关帝诞 阿昌族泼水节'],
            [5, '廿二', '.', '鄂温克族米阔鲁节'],
            [5, '廿九', '.', '瑶族达努节'],
            [6, '初六', '.', '姑姑节 天贶节 壮族祭田节 瑶族尝新节'],
            [6, '廿四', '.', '火把节 星回节(彝/白/佤/纳西/基诺)'],
            [7, '初七', '.', '七夕(乞巧节/女儿节)'],
            [7, '十三', '.', '侗族吃新节'],
            [7, '十五', '.', '中元节 盂兰盆会 普米族转山会'],
            [8, '十五', '#', '中秋节 拉祜族尝新节'],
            [9, '初九', 'I', '重阳节'],
            [10, '初一', '.', '祭祖节(十月朝)'],
            [10, '十五', '.', '下元节'],
            [10, '十六', '.', '瑶族盘王节'],
            [12, '初八', '.', '腊八节'],
            [12, '廿三', '.', '北方小年 灶君节'],
            [12, '廿四', '.', '南方小年 祭灶节'],
            [99, '三十', '#', '除夕'],
            [99, '廿九', '#', '除夕'] // 小月除夕
        ];

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  节日查询函数
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function getHolidays(y, m, d, lunarMonthNum, lunarDayName, lunarDayNum, lunarMonthDays, weekDay) {
            const holA = []; // 放假/重大节日
            const holB = []; // 主要节日/纪念日
            const holC = []; // 其它

            // 1) 公历节日
            const sk = String(m).padStart(2,'0') + '-' + String(d).padStart(2,'0');
            if (SOLAR_HOLIDAYS.has(sk)) {
                for (const h of SOLAR_HOLIDAYS.get(sk)) {
                    if (y < h.startY || y > h.endY) continue;
                    if (h.type === '#') holA.push(h.name);
                    else if (h.type === 'I') holB.push(h.name);
                    else holC.push(h.name);
                }
            }

            // 2) 周基节日
            const firstWday = new Date(y, m - 1, 1).getDay();
            const firstOcc = 1 + ((weekDay - firstWday + 7) % 7); // 本月第1个weekDay是几号
            const nth = d >= firstOcc ? Math.floor((d - firstOcc) / 7) + 1 : 0;
            const lastDay = new Date(y, m, 0).getDate();
            const total = lastDay >= firstOcc ? Math.floor((lastDay - firstOcc) / 7) + 1 : 0;
            const isLast = (nth === total);
            for (const [wm, wn, wd, wt, wname] of WEEK_HOLIDAYS) {
                if (wm !== m || wd !== weekDay) continue;
                if (!((wn === 0 && isLast) || (wn === nth))) continue;
                if (wt === '#') holA.push(wname);
                else if (wt === 'I') holB.push(wname);
                else holC.push(wname);
            }

            // 3) 农历节日 (lunarMonthNum: 1-12, 取绝对值去闰)
            if (lunarMonthNum && lunarDayName) {
                const lm = normLunarMonth(lunarMonthNum);
                for (const [hm, hd, ht, hname] of LUNAR_HOLIDAYS) {
                    if (hd !== lunarDayName) continue;
                    if (hm === lm || hm === 99) {
                        // 除夕(99): 十二月最后一天
                        if (hm === 99) {
                            if (lm !== 12) continue;
                            if (hd === '三十' && lunarDayNum === 30) { /* ok */ }
                            else if (hd === '廿九' && lunarDayNum === 29 && lunarMonthDays === 29) { /* ok */ }
                            else continue;
                        }
                        if (ht === '#') holA.push(hname);
                        else if (ht === 'I') holB.push(hname);
                        else holC.push(hname);
                    }
                }
            }

            return { A: holA, B: holB, C: holC, isVacation: holA.length > 0 };
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  日数据缓存 & 计算
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const CACHE_MAX = 200;
        const cache = new Map();

        function computeDay(y, m, d) {
            const key = `${y}-${m}-${d}`;
            if (cache.has(key)) return cache.get(key);
            try {
                const lsr = lunisolar(new Date(y, m - 1, d, 12, 0, 0));
                const lu = lsr.lunar;
                const ch = lsr.char8;
                const loc = lsr.getLocale();
                const dayGZ = ch.day.toString();
                const monthBranch = ch.month.branch.toString();
                const stem = dayGZ[0];
                const branch = dayGZ[1];
                const br = ch.day.branch;
                const conflictBr = br.conflict;
                const duty12 = lsr.theGods.getDuty12God();
                const by12 = lsr.theGods.getBy12God('day');
                const gGods = (lsr.theGods.getGoodGods('MD') || []).map(g => g.name || g);
                const bGods = (lsr.theGods.getBadGods('MD') || []).map(g => g.name || g);
                const pGan = lsr.format('彭祖干忌');
                const pZhi = lsr.format('彭祖支忌');
                const weekDay = new Date(y, m - 1, d).getDay();
                const xi = xiuIndex(y, m, d);
                const hgzNoon = getHourGZ(stem, 12);
                const jqMonth = ((BRANCHES.indexOf(monthBranch) - 2 + 12) % 12) + 1;
                const data = {
                    lunarYear: ch.year.toString(),
                    lunarMonth: lu.month,
                    isLeap: lu.isLeapMonth,
                    lunarDay: lu.day,
                    lunarDaysInMonth: lu.daysInMonth || lu.monthDays || 30,
                    dayGZ, stem, branch,
                    stemWX: WUXING_STEM[STEMS.indexOf(stem)],
                    branchWX: WUXING_BRANCH[branch] || '',
                    dayNaYin: getNaYinForGZ(dayGZ),
                    monthGZ: ch.month.toString(),
                    monthNaYin: getNaYinForGZ(ch.month.toString()),
                    yearGZ: ch.year.toString(),
                    yearNaYin: getNaYinForGZ(ch.year.toString()),
                    hourGZ: hgzNoon.gz,
                    hourNaYin: getNaYinForGZ(hgzNoon.gz),
                    hourShichen: hgzNoon.shichen,
                    jianchu: duty12 ? duty12.name : '——',
                    goodGods: gGods,
                    badGods: bGods,
                    by12Name: by12 ? by12.name : '——',
                    by12Luck: (by12 && typeof by12.luckLevel === 'number') ? by12.luckLevel : 0,
                    chong: conflictBr ? loc.chineseZodiac[conflictBr.value] : '',
                    sha: shaDir(br.value),
                    pengzu: (pGan !== '彭祖干忌' ? pGan : '') + (pZhi !== '彭祖支忌' ? ' ' + pZhi : ''),
                    solarTerm: lsr.solarTerm ? lsr.solarTerm.toString() : '',
                    xiu: XIU[xi],
                    xiuAnimal: XIU_ANIMAL[xi],
                    xiuFull: XIU[xi] + '宿' + XIU_ANIMAL[xi],
                    nineStar: getNineStar(dayGZ, jqMonth),
                    duty12Name: duty12 ? duty12.name : '——',
                    duty12Good: duty12 && DUTY12_GOOD[duty12.name] ? true : false,
                    wulu: isWuluDay(stem, branch),
                    daojia: isDaojiaDay(ch.year.toString()[0], dayGZ, lu.month),
                    daojiaYear: isDaojiaYearDay(ch.year.toString()[0], dayGZ),
                    daojiaMonth: isDaojiaMonthDay(lu.month, dayGZ),
                    hongsha: isHongSha(ch.month.toString()[1], branch),
                    jinshen: isJinShen(xi),
                    miemen: isMiemenDay(lu.month, branch),
                    shousi: isShousiDay(lu.month, branch),
                    bingxiao: getBingXiaoWaJie(ch.year.toString()[1], lu.month, lu.day),
                    sansang: isSansangDay(lu.month, branch),
                    chongsang: isChongsangDay(lu.month, stem),
                    hengtian: isHengtianDay(lu.day),
                    dasha: isDashaDay(dayGZ),
                    leiting: isLeitingDay(ch.month.toString()[0], dayGZ),
                    kongwang: getKongwangResult(ch.year.toString()[1], lu.month, lu.day),
                    sanfu: getSanfuInfo(y, m, d)
                };
                cache.set(key, data);
                while (cache.size > CACHE_MAX) { const firstKey = cache.keys().next().value; cache.delete(firstKey); }
                return data;
            } catch (e) {
                return null;
            }
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  月度日数据预计算（单次遍历）
        //  优化：避免日历渲染时每个日期创建两次 lunisolar 实例
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function precomputeMonthDays(y, m) {
            const dim = new Date(y, m, 0).getDate();
            const data = {};
            for (let d = 1; d <= dim; d++) {
                try {
                    const lsr = lunisolar(new Date(y, m - 1, d, 12, 0, 0));
                    const gz = lsr.char8.day.toString();
                    const lu = lsr.lunar;
                    const ld = lu.day;
                    let lr = CDAY[ld - 1] || ld;
                    if (ld === 1) {
                        const lm = normLunarMonth(lu.month);
                        lr = (lu.isLeapMonth ? '闰' : '') + (CMON[lm - 1] || lm + '月');
                    }
                    const duty12 = lsr.theGods.getDuty12God();
                    const weekDay = new Date(y, m - 1, d).getDay();
                    const monthBranch = lsr.char8.month.toString()[1];
                    const jqMonth = ((BRANCHES.indexOf(monthBranch) - 2 + 12) % 12) + 1;
                    data[d] = {
                        gz, lr,
                        xiu: XIU[xiuIndex(y, m, d)],
                        solarTerm: lsr.solarTerm ? lsr.solarTerm.toString() : '',
                        lm: lu.month,
                        ld: lu.day,
                        isLeap: lu.isLeapMonth,
                        ldim: lu.daysInMonth || lu.monthDays || 30,
                        nineStar: getNineStar(gz, jqMonth),
                        jianchu: duty12 ? duty12.name : '——',
                        wulu: isWuluDay(gz[0], gz[1]),
                        daojia: isDaojiaDay(lsr.char8.year.toString()[0], gz, lu.month),
                        daojiaYear: isDaojiaYearDay(lsr.char8.year.toString()[0], gz),
                        daojiaMonth: isDaojiaMonthDay(lu.month, gz),
                        hongsha: isHongSha(monthBranch, gz[1]),
                        jinshen: isJinShen(xiuIndex(y, m, d)),
                        miemen: isMiemenDay(lu.month, gz[1]),
                        shousi: isShousiDay(lu.month, gz[1]),
                        bingxiao: getBingXiaoWaJie(lsr.char8.year.toString()[1], lu.month, lu.day),
                        sansang: isSansangDay(lu.month, gz[1]),
                        chongsang: isChongsangDay(lu.month, gz[0]),
                        hengtian: isHengtianDay(lu.day),
                        dasha: isDashaDay(gz),
                        leiting: isLeitingDay(lsr.char8.month.toString()[0], gz),
                        kongwang: getKongwangResult(lsr.char8.year.toString()[1], lu.month, lu.day),
                        sanfu: getSanfuInfo(y, m, d)
                    };
                } catch (e) {
                    data[d] = { gz: '', lr: '', xiu: '', solarTerm: '', lm: 1, ld: 1, isLeap: false, ldim: 30, wulu: false, daojia: false, hongsha: false, jinshen: false, miemen: false, shousi: false, bingxiao: null, sansang: false, chongsang: false, hengtian: false, dasha: false, leiting: false, kongwang: '', sanfu: null };
                }
            }
            return data;
        }

        // 当前月预计算数据缓存（供日历点击事件使用，避免重复计算）
        let currentMonthDays = null;

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  实时时辰显示（当天动态，与节气并排）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        let currentViewDate = { y: 0, m: 0, d: 0, dayStem: '' };
        let shichenTimer = null;
        let _lastShichenIdx = -1;
        function updateShichenLive() {
            const today = new Date();
            if (currentViewDate.y === today.getFullYear() &&
                currentViewDate.m === today.getMonth() + 1 &&
                currentViewDate.d === today.getDate() &&
                currentViewDate.dayStem) {
                const cst = new Date(new Date().getTime() + (new Date().getTimezoneOffset() * 60000) + (8 * 3600000));
                const sc = getShichen(cst.getHours());
                if (sc.index === _lastShichenIdx) return;
                _lastShichenIdx = sc.index;
                const scEl = document.getElementById('liveShichen');
                if (scEl) scEl.textContent = sc.name;
                const scElFull = document.getElementById('liveShichenFull');
                if (scElFull) scElFull.textContent = sc.name;
                const hgz = getHourGZ(currentViewDate.dayStem, cst.getHours());
                const nayin = getNayinForGZ(hgz.stem, hgz.branch);
                const hourCard = document.getElementById('hourPillarCard');
                if (hourCard) {
                    const sCss = getWuxingCSS(getStemWuxing(hgz.stem));
                    const bCss = getWuxingCSS(getBranchWuxing(hgz.branch));
                    const gzDiv = hourCard.querySelector('.pillar-gz');
                    if (gzDiv) gzDiv.innerHTML = `<span class="stem-char" style="color:${sCss.color};background:${sCss.bg};border:1.5px solid ${sCss.border}">${hgz.stem}</span><span class="branch-char" style="color:${bCss.color};background:${bCss.bg};border:1.5px solid ${bCss.border}">${hgz.branch}</span>`;
                    const nayiDiv = hourCard.querySelector('.pillar-nayin');
                    if (nayiDiv) nayiDiv.textContent = nayin;
                    const shchDiv = hourCard.querySelector('.pillar-shch');
                    if (shchDiv) shchDiv.textContent = hgz.shichen;
                }
            }
        }
        function startShichenTimer() {
            if (shichenTimer) return;
            updateShichenLive();
            shichenTimer = setInterval(updateShichenLive, 30000);
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  大运排盘计算 (简化: 以当前日当作出生日)
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function renderDayun(dat) {
            if (!dat || !dat.yearGZ || !dat.monthGZ) return '<div class="dayun-empty">数据不足</div>';
            const yearStem = dat.yearGZ[0];
            const yearStemIdx = STEMS.indexOf(yearStem);
            const isYangYear = STEM_YANG[yearStemIdx];
            // 默认顺排 (阳年男/阴年女)
            const forward = isYangYear;
            const monthStem = dat.monthGZ[0];
            const monthBranch = dat.monthGZ[1];
            const msi = STEMS.indexOf(monthStem);
            const mbi = BRANCHES.indexOf(monthBranch);
            const html = [];
            for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {
                const offset = forward ? (i + 1) : -(i + 1);
                const si = (msi + offset + 60) % 10;
                const bi = (mbi + offset + 60) % 12;
                const gz = STEMS[si % 10] + BRANCHES[bi % 12];
                const nayin = getNayinForGZ(STEMS[si % 10], BRANCHES[bi % 12]);
                const ageStart = i * 10 + 1;
                const ageEnd = (i + 1) * 10;
                html.push(`<div class="dayun-item">
                  <span class="dayun-age">${ageStart}-${ageEnd}岁</span>
                  <span class="dayun-gz">${gz}</span>
                  <span class="dayun-nayin">${nayin}</span>
                </div>`);
            }
            return html.join('');
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  渲染：侧边信息栏
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function renderSide(y, m, d, monthDays) {
            const side = document.getElementById('sideBody');
            const dat = computeDay(y, m, d);
            currentViewDate = { y, m, d, dayStem: dat ? dat.stem : '' };
            _lastShichenIdx = -1;
            // 始终用当前北京时间实时计算时柱
            if (dat) {
                const cst = new Date(new Date().getTime() + (new Date().getTimezoneOffset() * 60000) + (8 * 3600000));
                const hgz = getHourGZ(dat.stem, cst.getHours());
                dat.hourGZ = hgz.gz;
                dat.hourNaYin = getNayinForGZ(hgz.stem, hgz.branch);
                dat.hourShichen = hgz.shichen;
            }
            if (!dat) {
                side.innerHTML = '<div class="panel"><p style="text-align:center;color:#999;">数据暂不可用</p></div>';
                return;
            }

            const lm = normLunarMonth(dat.lunarMonth);
            const lunarStr = (dat.isLeap ? '闰' : '') + (CMON[lm - 1] || lm + '月') + (CDAY[dat.lunarDay - 1] || dat.lunarDay);
            const chongS = dat.chong ? `冲${dat.chong}` : '无冲';
            const shaS = dat.sha ? `煞${dat.sha}` : '无煞';
            const ll = dat.by12Luck;
            const godS = dat.by12Name + (ll > 0 ? ' · 吉' : ll < 0 ? ' · 凶' : '');

            const pzGanRows = PZ_GAN.map(([k, v]) =>
                `<tr${k === dat.stem ? ' class="hl"' : ''}><td>${k}</td><td>${v}</td></tr>`).join('');
            const pzZhiRows = PZ_ZHI.map(([k, v]) =>
                `<tr${k === dat.branch ? ' class="hl"' : ''}><td>${k}</td><td>${v}</td></tr>`).join('');

            // 节气卡片：从预计算数据提取
            const jqItems = monthDays
                ? Object.entries(monthDays)
                    .filter(([_, v]) => v.solarTerm)
                    .map(([dd, v]) => `${dd}日 ${v.solarTerm}`)
                : (dat.solarTerm ? [`${d}日 ${dat.solarTerm}`] : []);
            const jqHTML = jqItems.length
                ? `<div class="jq-card"><h4><i class="ti ti-leaf"></i> ${y}年${m}月 节气</h4>${
                    jqItems.map(x => `<span class="jq-item">${x}</span>`).join(' ')}</div>`
                : '';
            // 同步更新顶部节气栏
            const jqTop = document.getElementById('jqTopBar');
            if (jqTop) jqTop.innerHTML = jqHTML;

            const noteText = loadNote(y, m, d).replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;').replace(/"/g,'&quot;');
            const noteHas = hasNote(y, m, d);
            // 节日计算
            const wday = new Date(y, m - 1, d).getDay();
            const ldName = CDAY[dat.lunarDay - 1] || dat.lunarDay;
            const hols = getHolidays(y, m, d, dat.lunarMonth, ldName, dat.lunarDay, dat.lunarDaysInMonth, wday);
            const holHTML = (hols.A.length + hols.B.length + hols.C.length) > 0 ? `
              <div class="holiday-row">
                ${hols.A.map(h => `<span class="hol-tag hol-a"><i class="ti ti-confetti"></i> ${h}</span>`).join('')}
                ${hols.B.map(h => `<span class="hol-tag hol-b"><i class="ti ti-pin"></i> ${h}</span>`).join('')}
                ${hols.C.length > 0 && !hols.A.length && !hols.B.length ? hols.C.slice(0,3).map(h => `<span class="hol-tag hol-c">· ${h}</span>`).join('') : ''}
              </div>` : '';
            const holExtraHTML = (hols.A.length + hols.B.length) > 0 && hols.C.length > 0 ? `
              <div class="holiday-row" style="margin-top:0.15rem;">
                ${hols.C.slice(0,6).map(h => `<span class="hol-tag hol-c">· ${h}</span>`).join('')}
              </div>` : '';
            side.innerHTML = `
            <div class="panel">
              <h3><i class="ti ti-calendar"></i> ${y}年${m}月${d}日 · 星期${WEEK[wday]}</h3>
              <p style="text-align:center;font-size:0.82rem;color:#5c3d2e;margin-bottom:0.3rem;line-height:1.6;">
                ${getYearZodiac(y).icon} 农历 ${dat.lunarYear}年（${dat.yearNaYin}）· ${(dat.isLeap ? '闰' : '') + (CMON[lm - 1] || lm + '月')}${dat.monthGZ}（${dat.monthNaYin}）${ldName}${dat.dayGZ}（${dat.dayNaYin}）
              </p>
              ${dat.solarTerm ? `<p style="text-align:center;font-size:0.75rem;color:#c9781a;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.3rem;"><i class="ti ti-bolt"></i> ${dat.solarTerm}<span style="color:#8b6946;font-weight:600;margin-left:0.6rem;font-size:0.7rem;">· <span id="liveShichen">${dat.hourShichen}</span></span></p>` : `<p style="text-align:center;font-size:0.75rem;color:#8b6946;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:0.3rem;"><i class="ti ti-moon"></i> <span id="liveShichen">${dat.hourShichen}</span></p>`}
              ${dat.nineStar ? `<div class="nine-star-card">
                <div class="ns-line">
                  <span class="ns-badge ${dat.nineStar.good ? 'good' : 'bad'}">${dat.nineStar.good ? '<i class="ti ti-star"></i> 吉星' : '<i class="ti ti-star"></i> 凶星'}</span>
                  <span class="ns-name ${dat.nineStar.good ? 'good' : 'bad'}">${dat.nineStar.name}</span>
                  <span class="ns-sep">值神</span>
                  <span class="ns-value ${dat.by12Luck > 0 ? 'good' : 'bad'}">${godS}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="ns-meaning">${dat.nineStar.meaning}</div>
              </div>` : ''}
              ${(() => {
                const scData = getShichenHuangHei(dat.branch);
                if (!scData.length) return '';
                const curSCH = (_barH ?? 12);
                const curSC = Math.floor(((curSCH + 1) % 24) / 2);
                let h = '<div class="shichen-legend"><span><span class="dot ylw"></span>黄道</span><span><span class="dot blk"></span>黑道</span></div>';
                h += '<div class="shichen-table">';
                for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {
                    const sc = scData[i];
                    const isCur = i === curSC;
                    h += '<div class="shichen-cell ' + (sc.yellow ? 'yellow' : 'black') + (isCur ? ' active' : '') + '" title="' + sc.full + ' ' + sc.god + '（' + (sc.yellow ? '黄道' : '黑道') + '）">';
                    h += '<span class="sc-br">' + sc.branch + '</span>';
                    h += '<span class="sc-kj">' + sc.koujue + '</span>';
                    h += '</div>';
                }
                h += '</div>';
                return h;
              })()}
              ${dat.wulu ? '<div class="wulu-notice"><i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i> 今日为<strong>无禄日</strong>，十恶大败日，诸事不宜</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.daojia ? '<div class="daojia-notice"><i class="ti ti-exclamation-mark"></i> 今日为<strong>倒家杀</strong>，起造，埋葬禁忌</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.hongsha ? '<div class="hongsha-notice"><i class="ti ti-triangle"></i> 今日为<strong>红砂日</strong>（小红砂），百事多忌</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.jinshen ? '<div class="jinshen-notice"><i class="ti ti-bolt"></i> 今日为<strong>金神七煞日</strong>（值' + XIU[xiuIndex(y, m, d)] + '宿）</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.miemen ? '<div class="miemen-notice">💀 今日为<strong>灭门大祸日</strong>，百事勿用</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.shousi ? '<div class="shousi-notice">🕯 今日为<strong>受死日</strong>，婚事/入宅/开市/签约/出行皆不宜</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.bingxiao ? '<div class="bingxiao-notice">🧊 今日为<strong>' + dat.bingxiao + '日</strong>大事勿用，宜避开</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.sansang ? '<div class="sansang-notice">🪦 今日为<strong>三丧日</strong>，忌埋葬·迁葬</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.chongsang ? '<div class="chongsang-notice">⚰ 今日为<strong>重丧日</strong>，大凶之日，忌丧葬·移柩·下葬</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.hengtian ? '<div class="hengtian-notice">🐦 今日为<strong>横天朱雀日</strong>，忌嫁娶·上梁·出灵·搬家</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.dasha ? '<div class="dasha-notice">🐅 今日为<strong>大煞入中宫</strong>，忌修造中宫，诸事不宜</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.leiting ? '<div class="dasha-notice"><i class="ti ti-bolt"></i> 今日为<strong>雷霆白虎入中宫</strong>，忌中宫修造</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.kongwang === '天空' ? '<div class="kongwang-notice">🕳 今日为<strong>天空亡日</strong>，忌竖造·起屋</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.kongwang === '地空' ? '<div class="kongwang-notice">🪦 今日为<strong>地空亡日</strong>，忌安坟·埋葬</div>' : ''}
              ${dat.sanfu ? '<div class="sanfu-notice"><i class="ti ti-flame"></i> ' + (dat.sanfu.day === 1 ? '今天进入<strong>' + dat.sanfu.period + '第1天</strong>' : '今日<strong>' + dat.sanfu.period + '第' + dat.sanfu.day + '天</strong>') + '，盛夏酷热，宜避暑养心</div>' : ''}

              ${holHTML}${holExtraHTML}

              <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="it"><span class="k">五行：</span> <span class="v">${dat.dayNaYin}</span></div>
                <div class="it"><span class="k">建除：</span> <span class="v">${dat.jianchu}</span></div>
                <div class="it"><span class="k">冲煞：</span> <span class="v">${chongS}·${shaS}</span></div>
                <div class="it"><span class="k">廿八宿： </span> <span class="v">${dat.xiuFull}</span></div>
                <div class="it"><span class="k">吉神：</span> <span class="v">${dat.goodGods.slice(0, 4).join('、') || '——'}</span></div>
                <div class="it"><span class="k">凶神：</span> <span class="v">${dat.badGods.slice(0, 4).join('、') || '——'}</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="note-panel">
              <h3><i class="ti ti-pencil"></i> 每日记事 ${noteHas ? '<span style="font-size:0.65rem;color:#c9781a;">(已有记录)</span>' : ''}</h3>
              <textarea id="noteTextarea" placeholder="在这里记录当天的备忘、心情、事件…">${noteText}</textarea>
              <div class="note-actions">
                <span class="note-info" id="noteInfo">${noteHas ? '<i class="ti ti-pin"></i> 该日期已有记事' : '<i class="ti ti-pencil"></i>️ 暂无记事'}</span>
                <button class="note-btn del" id="noteDelBtn" style="${noteHas ? '' : 'display:none;'}" onclick="deleteNote(${y},${m},${d})"><i class="ti ti-trash"></i> 删除</button>
                <button class="note-btn save" id="noteSaveBtn" onclick="saveNoteAction(${y},${m},${d})"><i class="ti ti-device-floppy"></i> 保存</button>
              </div>
              <div class="note-saved-msg" id="noteSavedMsg"><i class="ti ti-check"></i> 已保存</div>
            </div>

            <details class="pz">
              <summary>
                <span><i class="ti ti-books"></i> 彭祖百忌对照表 点击打开</span>
                <span class="pz-hint">高亮：${dat.dayGZ} 对应条</span>
              </summary>
              <div class="pz-body">
                <div class="pz-grid">
                  <table class="pz-tbl">
                    <thead><tr><th style="width:32px;">干</th><th>忌辞</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>${pzGanRows}</tbody>
                  </table>
                  <table class="pz-tbl">
                    <thead><tr><th style="width:32px;">支</th><th>忌辞</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>${pzZhiRows}</tbody>
                  </table>
                </div>
                <div class="pz-src">
                  按通行《通书》体系整理；高亮条为本日干支对应。参考：<a href="https://www.ifreesite.com/calendar/pengzu.htm" target="_blank">iFreeSite</a> · <a href="https://www.gdzaofutang.com/h-nd-246.html" target="_blank">造福堂</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </details>`;
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  完整详情页（点击日历日 → 全屏展示）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function renderFullDetail(y, m, d) {
            const dat = computeDay(y, m, d);
            if (!dat) return;
            currentViewDate = { y, m, d, dayStem: dat.stem };
            _lastShichenIdx = -1;
            // 始终用当前北京时间实时计算时柱
            const cst = new Date(new Date().getTime() + (new Date().getTimezoneOffset() * 60000) + (8 * 3600000));
            const hgz = getHourGZ(dat.stem, cst.getHours());
            dat.hourGZ = hgz.gz;
            dat.hourNaYin = getNayinForGZ(hgz.stem, hgz.branch);
            dat.hourShichen = hgz.shichen;

            const wday = new Date(y, m - 1, d).getDay();
            const lm = normLunarMonth(dat.lunarMonth);
            const lunarStr = (dat.isLeap ? '闰' : '') + (CMON[lm - 1] || lm + '月') + (CDAY[dat.lunarDay - 1] || dat.lunarDay);
            const chongS = dat.chong ? `冲${dat.chong}` : '无冲';
            const shaS = dat.sha ? `煞${dat.sha}` : '无煞';
            const ldName = CDAY[dat.lunarDay - 1] || dat.lunarDay;
            const liveHGZ = getHourGZ(dat.stem, _barH ?? 12);
            const counts = getWuxingCounts(dat.yearGZ, dat.monthGZ, dat.dayGZ, liveHGZ.gz);
            const wxMap = getWangXiang(dat.monthGZ ? dat.monthGZ[1] : '辰');
            const godS = dat.by12Name + (dat.by12Luck > 0 ? ' · 吉' : dat.by12Luck < 0 ? ' · 凶' : '');
            const body = document.getElementById('fullDetailBody');
            body.innerHTML = `
            <div class="sticky-date-info">
            <div class="section" style="padding:0.3rem 0.5rem;margin-bottom:0.3rem;">
              <h4><i class="ti ti-calendar"></i> ${y}年${m}月${d}日 · 星期${WEEK[wday]}</h4>
              <p style="text-align:center;font-size:1rem;color:#5c3d2e;margin-bottom:0.3rem;">
                ${getYearZodiac(y).icon} 农历 ${dat.lunarYear}年（${dat.yearNaYin}）· ${(dat.isLeap ? '闰' : '') + (CMON[lm - 1] || lm + '月')}${dat.monthGZ}（${dat.monthNaYin}）${ldName}${dat.dayGZ}（${dat.dayNaYin}）
              </p>
              ${dat.solarTerm ? `<p style="text-align:center;font-size:0.8rem;color:#c9781a;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:0.3rem;"><i class="ti ti-bolt"></i> ${dat.solarTerm}<span style="color:#8b6946;font-weight:600;margin-left:0.6rem;">· <span id="liveShichenFull">${dat.hourShichen}</span></span></p>` : `<p style="text-align:center;font-size:0.8rem;color:#8b6946;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:0.3rem;"><i class="ti ti-moon"></i> <span id="liveShichenFull">${dat.hourShichen}</span></p>`}
            </div>
            ${dat.nineStar ? `<div class="ns-line" style="justify-content:center;padding:0.3rem 0;">
              <span class="ns-badge ${dat.nineStar.good ? 'good' : 'bad'}">${dat.nineStar.good ? '<i class="ti ti-star"></i> 吉星' : '<i class="ti ti-star"></i> 凶星'}</span>
              <span class="ns-name ${dat.nineStar.good ? 'good' : 'bad'}">${dat.nineStar.name}</span>
              <span class="ns-sep">值神</span>
              <span class="ns-value ${dat.by12Luck > 0 ? 'good' : 'bad'}">${godS}</span>
            </div>` : ''}
            ${(() => {
                const scData = getShichenHuangHei(dat.branch);
                if (!scData.length) return '';
                const curSCH = (_barH ?? 12);
                const curSC = Math.floor(((curSCH + 1) % 24) / 2);
                let h2 = '<div class="shichen-legend"><span><span class="dot ylw"></span>黄道</span><span><span class="dot blk"></span>黑道</span></div>';
                h2 += '<div class="shichen-table">';
                for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {
                    const sc = scData[i];
                    const isCur = i === curSC;
                    h2 += '<div class="shichen-cell ' + (sc.yellow ? 'yellow' : 'black') + (isCur ? ' active' : '') + '" title="' + sc.full + ' ' + sc.god + '（' + (sc.yellow ? '黄道' : '黑道') + '）">';
                    h2 += '<span class="sc-br">' + sc.branch + '</span>';
                    h2 += '<span class="sc-kj">' + sc.koujue + '</span>';
                    h2 += '</div>';
                }
                h2 += '</div>';
                return h2;
            })()}
            ${dat.wulu ? '<div class="wulu-notice"><i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i> 今日为<strong>无禄日</strong>，十恶大败日，诸事不宜</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.daojia ? '<div class="daojia-notice"><i class="ti ti-exclamation-mark"></i> 今日为<strong>倒家杀</strong>，忌入宅、安床、开业、修造</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.hongsha ? '<div class="hongsha-notice"><i class="ti ti-triangle"></i> 今日为<strong>红砂日</strong>（小红砂），百事多忌</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.jinshen ? '<div class="jinshen-notice"><i class="ti ti-bolt"></i> 今日为<strong>金神七煞日</strong>（值' + XIU[xiuIndex(y, m, d)] + '宿）</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.miemen ? '<div class="miemen-notice">💀 今日为<strong>灭门大祸日</strong>，今日为灭门大祸日，百事勿用</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.shousi ? '<div class="shousi-notice">🕯 今日为<strong>受死日</strong>，婚事/入宅/开市/签约/出行皆不宜</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.bingxiao ? '<div class="bingxiao-notice">🧊 今日为<strong>' + dat.bingxiao + '日</strong>大事勿用，宜避开</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.sansang ? '<div class="sansang-notice">🪦 今日为<strong>三丧日</strong>，忌埋葬·迁葬</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.chongsang ? '<div class="chongsang-notice">⚰ 今日为<strong>重丧日</strong>，大凶之日，忌丧葬·移柩·下葬</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.hengtian ? '<div class="hengtian-notice">🐦 今日为<strong>横天朱雀日</strong>，忌嫁娶·上梁·出灵·搬家</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.dasha ? '<div class="dasha-notice">🐅 今日为<strong>大煞入中宫</strong>，忌修造中宫，诸事不宜</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.leiting ? '<div class="dasha-notice"><i class="ti ti-bolt"></i> 今日为<strong>雷霆白虎入中宫</strong>，忌中宫修造</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.kongwang === '天空' ? '<div class="kongwang-notice">🕳 今日为<strong>天空亡日</strong>，忌竖造·起屋</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.kongwang === '地空' ? '<div class="kongwang-notice">🪦 今日为<strong>地空亡日</strong>，忌安坟·埋葬</div>' : ''}
            ${dat.sanfu ? '<div class="sanfu-notice"><i class="ti ti-flame"></i> ' + (dat.sanfu.day === 1 ? '今天进入<strong>' + dat.sanfu.period + '第1天</strong>' : '今日<strong>' + dat.sanfu.period + '第' + dat.sanfu.day + '天</strong>') + '，盛夏酷热，宜避暑养心</div>' : ''}
            </div>

            <div class="section" style="text-align:center;">
              <h4><i class="ti ti-building-castle"></i> 建除十二神</h4>
              <div class="duty12-strip">${DUTY12_ORDER.map(dn => {
                const isGood = DUTY12_GOOD[dn];
                const isActive = dn === dat.jianchu;
                return `<div class="duty12-item ${isGood ? 'good' : 'bad'}${isActive ? ' active' : ''}" title="${DUTY12_MEANING[dn]}">${dn}${isActive ? '<div class="d12-label">今日</div>' : ''}</div>`;
              }).join('')}</div>
              <p class="duty12-desc">今日值神：<strong>${dat.jianchu}</strong> — ${DUTY12_MEANING[dat.jianchu] || ''}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
              <h4><i class="ti ti-clipboard-list"></i> 神煞</h4>
              <div class="info-grid" style="margin-top:0.5rem;">
                <div class="it"><span class="k">五行：</span><span class="v">${dat.dayNaYin}</span></div>
                <div class="it"><span class="k">建除：</span><span class="v">${dat.jianchu}</span></div>
                <div class="it"><span class="k">冲煞：</span><span class="v">${chongS}·${shaS}</span></div>
                <div class="it"><span class="k">廿八宿：</span><span class="v">${dat.xiuFull}</span></div>
                <div class="it"><span class="k">吉神：</span><span class="v">${dat.goodGods.slice(0, 6).join('、') || '——'}</span></div>
                <div class="it"><span class="k">凶神：</span><span class="v">${dat.badGods.slice(0, 6).join('、') || '——'}</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="section" style="padding:0.3rem 0.5rem;">
              <h4 style="font-size:0.72rem;"><i class="ti ti-chart-bar"></i> 五行分布</h4>
              ${renderWuxingDist(counts, wxMap)}
              <p style="font-size:0.55rem;color:#8b6946;margin-top:0.2rem;">月令：${dat.monthGZ ? dat.monthGZ[1] : '——'} · ${['木','火','土','金','水'].map(w=>w+wxMap[w]).join(' ')}</p>
            </div>

            <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:0.5rem;">
              <button class="note-btn save" style="font-size:0.65rem;padding:0.3rem 1rem;" onclick="exportText()"><i class="ti ti-clipboard-list"></i> 导出文本</button>
              <button class="note-btn" style="font-size:0.65rem;padding:0.3rem 1rem;background:#f0e6d3;color:#5c3d0e;border:1px solid #dccaa5;margin-left:0.4rem;" onclick="closeFullDetail()"><i class="ti ti-arrow-left"></i> 返回月历</button>
            </div>`;

            document.getElementById('fullDetailOverlay').classList.add('show');
            document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
            startShichenTimer();
        }

        window.closeFullDetail = function() {
            document.getElementById('fullDetailOverlay').classList.remove('show');
            document.body.style.overflow = '';
        };

        // 记事操作（详情页版本）
        window.saveNoteFull = function(y, m, d) {
            const ta = document.getElementById('noteTextareaFull');
            if (!ta) return;
            saveNote(y, m, d, ta.value);
            const msg = document.getElementById('noteSavedMsgFull');
            if (msg) { msg.classList.add('show'); setTimeout(() => msg.classList.remove('show'), 1500); }
            const info = document.getElementById('noteInfoFull');
            if (info) info.innerHTML = ta.value.trim() ? '<i class="ti ti-pin"></i> 该日期已有记事' : '<i class="ti ti-pencil"></i>️ 暂无记事';
            const delBtn = document.getElementById('noteDelBtnFull');
            if (delBtn) delBtn.style.display = ta.value.trim() ? '' : 'none';
            refreshCalDots();
        };
        window.deleteNoteFull = function(y, m, d) {
            saveNote(y, m, d, '');
            const ta = document.getElementById('noteTextareaFull');
            if (ta) ta.value = '';
            const info = document.getElementById('noteInfoFull');
            if (info) info.innerHTML = '<i class="ti ti-pencil"></i>️ 暂无记事';
            const delBtn = document.getElementById('noteDelBtnFull');
            if (delBtn) delBtn.style.display = 'none';
            const msg = document.getElementById('noteSavedMsgFull');
            if (msg) { msg.innerHTML = '<i class="ti ti-check"></i> 已删除'; msg.classList.add('show'); setTimeout(() => { msg.innerHTML = '<i class="ti ti-check"></i> 已保存'; msg.classList.remove('show'); }, 1500); }
            refreshCalDots();
        };
        function renderCal(y, m) {
            const cal = document.getElementById('calBody');
            const today = new Date();
            const tY = today.getFullYear(), tM = today.getMonth() + 1, tD = today.getDate();

            // 单次遍历：一次算出当月所有日期的数据（干支、农历日、宿、节气）
            currentMonthDays = precomputeMonthDays(y, m);

            const first = new Date(y, m - 1, 1);
            const sd = first.getDay();
            const dim = new Date(y, m, 0).getDate();
            const pd = new Date(y, m - 1, 0).getDate();

            // 构建所有单元格（含上月/下月填充）
            const cells = [];
            for (let i = sd - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                cells.push({ d: pd - i, m: m === 1 ? 12 : m - 1, y: m === 1 ? y - 1 : y, cur: false });
            }
            for (let dd = 1; dd <= dim; dd++) {
                cells.push({ d: dd, m, y, cur: true });
            }
            const rem = (7 - (cells.length % 7)) % 7;
            for (let dd = 1; dd <= rem; dd++) {
                cells.push({ d: dd, m: m === 12 ? 1 : m + 1, y: m === 12 ? y + 1 : y, cur: false });
            }

            const noteDays = preloadMonthNotes(y, m);

            let h = '<table><tr><th>日</th><th>一</th><th>二</th><th>三</th><th>四</th><th>五</th><th>六</th></tr>';
            for (let i = 0; i < cells.length; i++) {
                if (i % 7 === 0) h += '<tr>';
                const c = cells[i];
                const isToday = c.y === tY && c.m === tM && c.d === tD;
                const cls = isToday ? 'today' : '';
                const op = c.cur ? '' : 'opacity:0.33;';

                // 从预计算数据直接取（本月日期走 cache，填充日期单独算）
                let gzS = '', lrS = '', xiS = '', jqS = '', nsS = '', jcS = '', badgesHtml = '';
                const showWulu = loadSetting('showWulu', true);
                const showDaojiaMonth = loadSetting('showDaojiaMonth', true);
                const showDaojiaYear = loadSetting('showDaojiaYear', true);
                const badges = [];
                if (c.cur && currentMonthDays[c.d]) {
                    const dd = currentMonthDays[c.d];
                    gzS = dd.gz;
                    lrS = dd.lr;
                    xiS = dd.xiu;
                    if (dd.solarTerm) jqS = `<span class="jq">${dd.solarTerm}</span>`;
                    if (dd.nineStar) { const ns = dd.nineStar; nsS = `<span class="ns" style="color:${ns.good?'#c43d3d':'#1e1e1e'}">${ns.name}</span>`; }
                    if (dd.jianchu) { const jGood = DUTY12_GOOD[dd.jianchu]; jcS = `<span class="jc" style="color:${jGood?'#c43d3d':'#1e1e1e'}">${dd.jianchu}</span>`; }
                    if (dd.daojiaMonth && showDaojiaMonth) badges.push('<span class="wulu-badge dao-badge">倒</span>');
                    if (dd.daojiaYear && showDaojiaYear) badges.push('<span class="wulu-badge dao-badge">倒</span>');
                    if (dd.wulu && showWulu) badges.push('<span class="wulu-badge wu-badge">无</span>');
                    if (badges.length) badgesHtml = '<span class="badge-stack">' + badges.join('') + '</span>';
                } else if (!c.cur) {
                    try {
                        const lsr = lunisolar(new Date(c.y, c.m - 1, c.d, 12, 0, 0));
                        const gz = lsr.char8.day.toString();
                        gzS = gz;
                        const lu = lsr.lunar;
                        const ld = lu.day;
                        lrS = CDAY[ld - 1] || ld;
                        if (ld === 1) {
                            const lm2 = normLunarMonth(lu.month);
                            lrS = (lu.isLeapMonth ? '闰' : '') + (CMON[lm2 - 1] || lm2 + '月');
                        }
                        const offWeekDay = new Date(c.y, c.m - 1, c.d).getDay();
                        xiS = XIU[xiuIndex(c.y, c.m, c.d)];
                        const monthBrOff = lsr.char8.month.toString()[1];
                        const jqMonthOff = ((BRANCHES.indexOf(monthBrOff) - 2 + 12) % 12) + 1;
                        const ns = getNineStar(gz, jqMonthOff);
                        if (ns) nsS = `<span class="ns" style="color:${ns.good?'#c43d3d':'#1e1e1e'}">${ns.name}</span>`;
                        const duty12 = lsr.theGods.getDuty12God();
                        if (duty12) { const jName = duty12.name; const jGood = DUTY12_GOOD[jName]; jcS = `<span class="jc" style="color:${jGood?'#c43d3d':'#1e1e1e'}">${jName}</span>`; }
                        if (badges.length) badgesHtml = '<span class="badge-stack">' + badges.join('') + '</span>';
                    } catch (e) { /* 填充日期计算失败，跳过 */ }
                }

                const noteDot = (c.cur && noteDays.has(c.d)) ? '<span class="note-dot"></span>' : '';
                h += `<td class="${cls}" style="${op}" data-y="${c.y}" data-m="${c.m}" data-d="${c.d}" data-cur="${c.cur}">
                  <span class="solar-num">${c.d}${noteDot}${badgesHtml}</span>
                  <span class="gz">${gzS}</span>
                  <span class="lr">${lrS}</span>
                  <span class="xiu">${xiS}</span>
                  ${nsS}${jcS}${jqS}
                </td>`;
                if (i % 7 === 6) h += '</tr>';
            }
            h += '</table>';
            cal.innerHTML = h;

            // 默认高亮今天（本月）或1号
            const selD = (y === tY && m === tM) ? tD : 1;
            _barY = y; _barM = m;
            document.getElementById('barDateDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_barY, _barM, _barD, _barH, _barMin);
            highlightCell(y, m, selD);
            renderSide(y, m, selD, currentMonthDays);
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  高亮日历中的指定日期（选中态）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function highlightCell(y, m, d) {
            const cal = document.getElementById('calBody');
            cal.querySelectorAll('td').forEach(td => td.classList.remove('selected'));
            const cell = cal.querySelector(`td[data-y="${y}"][data-m="${m}"][data-d="${d}"]`);
            if (cell) cell.classList.add('selected');
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  日历点击事件代理（两击导航）
        //  第1次点击：高亮 + 右侧面板显示当日摘要
        //  第2次点击同一格：跳转详情页
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        window.openFullDetail = function() {
            renderFullDetail(_barY, _barM, _barD);
        };
        function onCalendarClick(e) {
            const td = e.target.closest('td');
            if (!td) return;
            const y = +td.dataset.y, m = +td.dataset.m, d = +td.dataset.d;
            if (td.dataset.cur !== 'true') return;
            const now = new Date();
            _barY = y; _barM = m; _barD = d; _barH = now.getHours(); _barMin = now.getMinutes();
            document.getElementById('barDateDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_barY, _barM, _barD, _barH, _barMin);
            highlightCell(y, m, d);
            renderSide(y, m, d, currentMonthDays);
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  初始化 & 导航
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  日期时间选择器 — 原生滚动滚轮（scroll-snap）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const DT_ROW = 44;
        let _dtCtx = null, _dtMode = 'solar';
        let _barY, _barM, _barD, _barH, _barMin;
        let _zeY, _zeM, _zeD, _zeH, _zeMin;
        let _bzY, _bzM, _bzD, _bzH, _bzMin;
        let _dtLongitude = 111.67, _dtLocationLabel = '—';
        // 模态框内部 draft 状态
        let _dtDraft = new Date();
        let _dtSyncing = false;
        let _dtYearList = [], _dtMonthList = [], _dtDayList = [], _dtHourList = [], _dtMinuteList = [];
        function _pad2(n) { return String(n).padStart(2, '0'); }
        function fmtDt(y, m, d, h, min) {
            return y + '年' + String(m).padStart(2,'0') + '月' + String(d).padStart(2,'0') + '日 ' + String(h).padStart(2,'0') + ':' + String(min).padStart(2,'0');
        }
        function _daysInMonth(y, m) { return new Date(y, m, 0).getDate(); }
        function _clampDay(y, m, d) { return Math.min(d, _daysInMonth(y, m)); }
        function _setDraftSolar(y, m, d, h, i) {
            _dtDraft = new Date(y, m - 1, _clampDay(y, m, d), h, i, 0, 0);
        }
        function _buildYearRange() { const a = []; for (let y = 1940; y <= 2050; y++) a.push(y); return a; }
        function _eotMinutes(d) {
            const n = Math.floor((d - new Date(d.getFullYear(), 0, 0)) / 86400000);
            const B = 2 * Math.PI * (n - 81) / 365;
            return 9.87 * Math.sin(2 * B) - 7.53 * Math.cos(B) - 1.5 * Math.sin(B);
        }
        function _trueSolarTime(d, lonE) {
            const offsetMin = 4 * (lonE - 120) + _eotMinutes(d);
            const t = new Date(d.getTime() + offsetMin * 60000);
            return t.getFullYear() + '-' + _pad2(t.getMonth() + 1) + '-' + _pad2(t.getDate()) + ' ' + _pad2(t.getHours()) + ':' + _pad2(t.getMinutes());
        }
        function _rebuildDtLists() {
            const d = _dtDraft;
            _dtYearList = _buildYearRange();
            _dtHourList = [...Array(24)].map((_, i) => i);
            _dtMinuteList = [...Array(60)].map((_, i) => i);
            if (_dtMode === 'solar') {
                _dtMonthList = [...Array(12)].map((_, i) => i + 1);
                _dtDayList = [...Array(_daysInMonth(d.getFullYear(), d.getMonth() + 1))].map((_, i) => i + 1);
            } else {
                try {
                    const lsr = lunisolar(d);
                    const lu = lsr.lunar;
                    const ly = d.getFullYear();
                    // 生成农历月份列表（含闰月标记）
                    _dtMonthList = [];
                    for (let mi = 1; mi <= 12; mi++) {
                        _dtMonthList.push({ lunarMonth: mi, label: CMON[mi - 1] });
                        // 检查该农历年是否有闰月
                        const testDate = new Date(ly - 1, 11, 15);
                        for (let td = 0; td < 400; td++) {
                            const t = new Date(testDate.getTime() + td * 86400000);
                            const tlsr = lunisolar(t);
                            const tlu = tlsr.lunar;
                            const tnm = normLunarMonth(tlu.month);
                            if (tlu.isLeapMonth && tnm === mi) {
                                _dtMonthList.push({ lunarMonth: -mi, label: '闰' + CMON[mi - 1] });
                                break;
                            }
                        }
                    }
                    _dtDayList = [...Array(30)].map((_, i) => i + 1);
                } catch (e) {
                    _dtMonthList = [{ lunarMonth: 1, label: '正月' }];
                    _dtDayList = [...Array(30)].map((_, i) => i + 1);
                }
            }
        }
        function _fillDtCol(col, values, fmt) {
            col.innerHTML = '';
            values.forEach((val, idx) => {
                const div = document.createElement('div');
                div.className = 'dt-wheel-item';
                div.dataset.index = String(idx);
                div.textContent = fmt(val, idx);
                col.appendChild(div);
            });
        }
        function _scrollDtCol(col, idx, smooth) {
            col.scrollTo({ top: idx * DT_ROW, behavior: smooth ? 'smooth' : 'auto' });
        }
        function _getDtScrollIdx(col) { return Math.round(col.scrollTop / DT_ROW); }
        function _updateDtCenter() {
            const cols = document.querySelectorAll('#dtWheelCols .dt-wheel-col');
            cols.forEach(col => {
                const idx = _getDtScrollIdx(col);
                [...col.children].forEach((c, i) => c.classList.toggle('center', i === idx));
            });
        }
        function _readDtToDraft() {
            const cols = document.querySelectorAll('#dtWheelCols .dt-wheel-col');
            if (cols.length < 5) return;
            const iy = Math.min(_getDtScrollIdx(cols[0]), Math.max(0, _dtYearList.length - 1));
            const im = Math.min(_getDtScrollIdx(cols[1]), Math.max(0, _dtMonthList.length - 1));
            const id = Math.min(_getDtScrollIdx(cols[2]), Math.max(0, _dtDayList.length - 1));
            const ih = Math.min(_getDtScrollIdx(cols[3]), 23);
            const ii = Math.min(_getDtScrollIdx(cols[4]), 59);
            const y = _dtYearList[iy] || _dtYearList[0];
            const h = _dtHourList[ih] || 0;
            const mi = _dtMinuteList[ii] || 0;
            if (_dtMode === 'solar') {
                const m = _dtMonthList[im] || 1;
                const dd = _dtDayList[id] || 1;
                _setDraftSolar(y, m, dd, h, mi);
            } else {
                const mObj = _dtMonthList[im] || _dtMonthList[0];
                const dd = _dtDayList[id] || 1;
                const absM = Math.abs(mObj.lunarMonth);
                const isLeapTarget = mObj.lunarMonth < 0;
                try {
                    const start = new Date(y - 1, 11, 15);
                    for (let i = 0; i < 400; i++) {
                        const d2 = new Date(start.getTime() + i * 86400000);
                        const lsr2 = lunisolar(d2);
                        const lu2 = lsr2.lunar;
                        if (normLunarMonth(lu2.month) === absM && lu2.day === dd && !!lu2.isLeapMonth === isLeapTarget) {
                            _dtDraft = new Date(d2.getFullYear(), d2.getMonth(), d2.getDate(), h, mi, 0, 0);
                            break;
                        }
                    }
                } catch (e) { /* 农历日期搜索失败 */ }
            }
            _rebuildDtLists();
        }
        function _syncDtFromDraft() {
            _dtSyncing = true;
            const d = _dtDraft;
            let iy, im, id;
            const ih = _dtHourList.indexOf(d.getHours());
            const ii = _dtMinuteList.indexOf(d.getMinutes());
            if (_dtMode === 'solar') {
                iy = _dtYearList.indexOf(d.getFullYear());
                im = _dtMonthList.indexOf(d.getMonth() + 1);
                id = _dtDayList.indexOf(d.getDate());
            } else {
                try {
                    const lsr = lunisolar(d);
                    const lu = lsr.lunar;
                    iy = _dtYearList.indexOf(d.getFullYear());
                    im = _dtMonthList.findIndex(x => {
                        const xn = Math.abs(x.lunarMonth);
                        const xIsLeap = x.lunarMonth < 0;
                        return xn === normLunarMonth(lu.month) && xIsLeap === !!lu.isLeapMonth;
                    });
                    id = _dtDayList.indexOf(lu.day);
                } catch (e) { iy = 0; im = 0; id = 0; }
            }
            if (iy < 0) iy = 0; if (im < 0) im = 0; if (id < 0) id = 0;
            const cols = document.querySelectorAll('#dtWheelCols .dt-wheel-col');
            if (cols.length < 5) { _dtSyncing = false; return; }
            _fillDtCol(cols[0], _dtYearList, x => String(x));
            if (_dtMode === 'solar') {
                _fillDtCol(cols[1], _dtMonthList, x => _pad2(x));
                _fillDtCol(cols[2], _dtDayList, x => _pad2(x));
            } else {
                _fillDtCol(cols[1], _dtMonthList, x => x.label);
                _fillDtCol(cols[2], _dtDayList, x => _pad2(x));
            }
            _fillDtCol(cols[3], _dtHourList, x => _pad2(x));
            _fillDtCol(cols[4], _dtMinuteList, x => _pad2(x));
            // 更新标签和列可见性
            const lbls = document.getElementById('dtWheelLabels');
            if (_dtMode === 'lunar') {
                lbls.innerHTML = '<div>年</div><div>月</div><div>日</div>';
                cols[3].style.display = 'none'; cols[4].style.display = 'none';
                document.getElementById('dtLeapRow').style.display = '';
            } else {
                lbls.innerHTML = '<div>年</div><div>月</div><div>日</div><div>时</div><div>分</div>';
                cols[3].style.display = ''; cols[4].style.display = '';
                document.getElementById('dtLeapRow').style.display = 'none';
            }
            requestAnimationFrame(() => {
                _scrollDtCol(cols[0], iy, false);
                _scrollDtCol(cols[1], im, false);
                _scrollDtCol(cols[2], id, false);
                if (_dtMode === 'solar') {
                    _scrollDtCol(cols[3], ih >= 0 ? ih : 0, false);
                    _scrollDtCol(cols[4], ii >= 0 ? ii : 0, false);
                }
                _updateDtCenter();
                requestAnimationFrame(() => { _dtSyncing = false; });
            });
        }
        function _refreshDtFooter() {
            document.getElementById('dtLocText').textContent = _dtLocationLabel;
            document.getElementById('dtSunTime').textContent = _dtMode === 'solar' ? _trueSolarTime(_dtDraft, _dtLongitude) : '—';
        }
        function _refreshDtBar(ctx) {
            if (ctx === 'bar') document.getElementById('barDateDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_barY, _barM, _barD, _barH, _barMin);
            else if (ctx === 'zesolar') document.getElementById('zeSolarDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_zeY, _zeM, _zeD, _zeH, _zeMin);
            else if (ctx === 'bazi') document.getElementById('bzDateDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_bzY, _bzM, _bzD, _bzH, _bzMin);
        }
        function _openDtSheet(ctx) {
            _dtCtx = ctx;
            let y, m, d, h, min;
            if (ctx === 'bar') [y,m,d,h,min] = [_barY, _barM, _barD, _barH, _barMin];
            else if (ctx === 'zesolar') [y,m,d,h,min] = [_zeY, _zeM, _zeD, _zeH, _zeMin];
            else if (ctx === 'bazi') [y,m,d,h,min] = [_bzY, _bzM, _bzD, _bzH, _bzMin];
            _dtDraft = new Date(y, m - 1, d, h, min, 0, 0);
            _dtMode = 'solar';
            document.getElementById('dtTabSolar').classList.add('active');
            document.getElementById('dtTabLunar').classList.remove('active');
            document.getElementById('dtLeapRow').style.display = 'none';
            _rebuildDtLists();
            _syncDtFromDraft();
            _refreshDtFooter();
            const backdrop = document.getElementById('dtBackdrop');
            const sheet = document.getElementById('dtSheet');
            backdrop.hidden = false; sheet.hidden = false;
            requestAnimationFrame(() => {
                backdrop.classList.add('open');
                sheet.classList.add('open');
            });
            document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
        }
        function _closeDtSheet() {
            const backdrop = document.getElementById('dtBackdrop');
            const sheet = document.getElementById('dtSheet');
            backdrop.classList.remove('open');
            sheet.classList.remove('open');
            document.body.style.overflow = '';
            setTimeout(() => { backdrop.hidden = true; sheet.hidden = true; _dtCtx = null; }, 280);
        }
        function _applyDtDone() {
            _readDtToDraft();
            const y = _dtDraft.getFullYear(), m = _dtDraft.getMonth() + 1, d = _dtDraft.getDate();
            const h = _dtDraft.getHours(), min = _dtDraft.getMinutes();
            const ctx = _dtCtx;
            if (ctx === 'bar') {
                _barY = y; _barM = m; _barD = d; _barH = h; _barMin = min;
            } else if (ctx === 'zesolar') {
                _zeY = y; _zeM = m; _zeD = d; _zeH = h; _zeMin = min;
            } else if (ctx === 'bazi') {
                _bzY = y; _bzM = m; _bzD = d; _bzH = h; _bzMin = min;
            }
            _refreshDtBar(ctx);
            if (ctx === 'bar') { renderCal(y, m); highlightCell(y, m, d); renderSide(y, m, d, currentMonthDays); }
            _closeDtSheet();
        }
        function _dtGoToday() {
            const n = new Date();
            _dtDraft = new Date(n.getFullYear(), n.getMonth(), n.getDate(), n.getHours(), n.getMinutes(), 0, 0);
            _rebuildDtLists();
            _syncDtFromDraft();
            _refreshDtFooter();
        }
        function _setDtMode(mode) {
            _dtMode = mode;
            document.getElementById('dtTabSolar').classList.toggle('active', mode === 'solar');
            document.getElementById('dtTabLunar').classList.toggle('active', mode === 'lunar');
            _rebuildDtLists();
            _syncDtFromDraft();
            _refreshDtFooter();
        }
        function _attachDtColScroll(col) {
            let t;
            col.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
                if (_dtSyncing) return;
                clearTimeout(t);
                t = setTimeout(() => {
                    if (_dtSyncing) return;
                    _updateDtCenter();
                    const idx = Math.min(Math.max(0, _getDtScrollIdx(col)), col.children.length - 1);
                    _scrollDtCol(col, idx, true);
                    _readDtToDraft();
                    _syncDtFromDraft();
                    _refreshDtFooter();
                }, 60);
            }, { passive: true });
        }

        // 公开接口（兼容旧调用）
        window.openDtPicker = function(ctx) { _openDtSheet(ctx); };
        window.closeDtPicker = function() { _closeDtSheet(); };
        window.completeDtPicker = function() { _applyDtDone(); };
        window.switchDtMode = function(mode) { _setDtMode(mode); };
        window.dtPickerGoToday = function() { _dtGoToday(); };

        // 农历→公历 转换（二分估算+小范围扫描，平均仅需~90次lunisolar调用）
        function lunarToSolar(ly, lm, ld, isLeap) {
            const lmNorm = normLunarMonth(lm);
            // 估算：农历正月初一最早为1月21日，每月约29.53天
            const estDay = new Date(ly, 0, 21).getTime() + (lmNorm - 1) * 29.53 * 86400000;
            const start = new Date(estDay - 45 * 86400000); // 估算点前45天
            for (let i = 0; i < 90; i++) { // 扫描90天窗口
                const dt = new Date(start.getTime() + i * 86400000);
                try {
                    const lsr = lunisolar(dt);
                    const lu = lsr.lunar;
                    if (normLunarMonth(lu.month) === lmNorm && lu.day === ld) {
                        if (!!lu.isLeapMonth === !!isLeap) {
                            return { y: dt.getFullYear(), m: dt.getMonth() + 1, d: dt.getDate() };
                        }
                    }
                } catch (e) { /* lunisolar 转换失败 */ }
            }
            return null;
        }

        // ── 初始化 ──
        function initPickers() {
            const now = new Date();
            _barY = now.getFullYear(); _barM = now.getMonth() + 1; _barD = now.getDate();
            _barH = now.getHours(); _barMin = now.getMinutes();
            _zeY = _barY; _zeM = _barM; _zeD = _barD; _zeH = _barH; _zeMin = _barMin;
            _bzY = _barY; _bzM = _barM; _bzD = _barD; _bzH = _barH; _bzMin = _barMin;
            document.getElementById('barDateDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_barY, _barM, _barD, _barH, _barMin);
            document.getElementById('zeSolarDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_zeY, _zeM, _zeD, _zeH, _zeMin);
            document.getElementById('bzDateDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_bzY, _bzM, _bzD, _bzH, _bzMin);

            // 初始化模态框滚轮事件
            const cols = document.querySelectorAll('#dtWheelCols .dt-wheel-col');
            cols.forEach(_attachDtColScroll);

            // 模态框事件绑定
            document.getElementById('dtBtnCancel').addEventListener('click', () => { _closeDtSheet(); });
            document.getElementById('dtBtnDone').addEventListener('click', () => { _applyDtDone(); });
            document.getElementById('dtBackdrop').addEventListener('click', () => { _closeDtSheet(); });
            document.getElementById('dtSheetToday').addEventListener('click', () => { _dtGoToday(); });
            document.getElementById('dtTabSolar').addEventListener('click', () => { _setDtMode('solar'); });
            document.getElementById('dtTabLunar').addEventListener('click', () => { _setDtMode('lunar'); });
            document.getElementById('dtBtnLoc').addEventListener('click', () => {
                const name = prompt('请输入地点名称（例如：北京市 朝阳区）', _dtLocationLabel);
                if (!name) return;
                const lonStr = prompt('请输入东经经度（例如：116.40）', String(_dtLongitude));
                if (lonStr == null) return;
                const lon = parseFloat(lonStr);
                if (!Number.isFinite(lon)) return;
                _dtLocationLabel = name; _dtLongitude = lon;
                _refreshDtFooter();
            });
            document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
                if (e.key === 'Escape' && !document.getElementById('dtSheet').hidden) { _closeDtSheet(); }
            });
        }
        window.shiftMonth = function(delta) {
            let ny = _barY, nm = _barM + delta;
            if (nm > 12) { nm = 1; ny++; }
            if (nm < 1) { nm = 12; ny--; }
            _barY = ny; _barM = nm;
            const ld = new Date(ny, nm, 0).getDate();
            if (_barD > ld) _barD = ld;
            document.getElementById('barDateDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_barY, _barM, _barD, _barH, _barMin);
            renderCal(ny, nm);
        };
        window.goToday = function() {
            const n = new Date();
            _barY = n.getFullYear(); _barM = n.getMonth() + 1; _barD = n.getDate();
            _barH = n.getHours(); _barMin = n.getMinutes();
            document.getElementById('barDateDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_barY, _barM, _barD, _barH, _barMin);
            renderCal(_barY, _barM);
        };

        // 每日记事操作
        window.saveNoteAction = function(y, m, d) {
            const ta = document.getElementById('noteTextarea');
            if (!ta) return;
            saveNote(y, m, d, ta.value);
            const msg = document.getElementById('noteSavedMsg');
            if (msg) { msg.classList.add('show'); setTimeout(() => msg.classList.remove('show'), 1500); }
            const info = document.getElementById('noteInfo');
            if (info) info.innerHTML = ta.value.trim() ? '<i class="ti ti-pin"></i> 该日期已有记事' : '<i class="ti ti-pencil"></i>️ 暂无记事';
            const delBtn = document.getElementById('noteDelBtn');
            if (delBtn) delBtn.style.display = ta.value.trim() ? '' : 'none';
            // 刷新日历标记
            refreshCalDots();
        };
        window.deleteNote = function(y, m, d) {
            saveNote(y, m, d, '');
            const ta = document.getElementById('noteTextarea');
            if (ta) ta.value = '';
            const info = document.getElementById('noteInfo');
            if (info) info.innerHTML = '<i class="ti ti-pencil"></i>️ 暂无记事';
            const delBtn = document.getElementById('noteDelBtn');
            if (delBtn) delBtn.style.display = 'none';
            const msg = document.getElementById('noteSavedMsg');
            if (msg) { msg.innerHTML = '<i class="ti ti-check"></i> 已删除'; msg.classList.add('show'); setTimeout(() => { msg.innerHTML = '<i class="ti ti-check"></i> 已保存'; msg.classList.remove('show'); }, 1500); }
            refreshCalDots();
        };
        function refreshCalDots() {
            const cal = document.getElementById('calBody');
            cal.querySelectorAll('td[data-cur="true"]').forEach(td => {
                const y = +td.dataset.y, m = +td.dataset.m, d = +td.dataset.d;
                let dot = td.querySelector('.note-dot');
                if (hasNote(y, m, d)) {
                    if (!dot) {
                        dot = document.createElement('span');
                        dot.className = 'note-dot';
                        td.appendChild(dot);
                    }
                } else {
                    if (dot) dot.remove();
                }
            });
        }

        // 四柱卡片 / 解读入口（事件委托）
        document.getElementById('sideBody').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
            // 四柱卡片 -> 展开详情
            const card = e.target.closest('.pillar-card');
            if (card) {
                const panel = document.getElementById('pillarDetailPanel');
                if (panel) panel.classList.toggle('open');
                return;
            }
            // 命理解读入口
            const ieLink = e.target.closest('.ie-link');
            if (ieLink) {
                const itype = ieLink.dataset.interpret;
                if (itype) showInterpret(itype);
                return;
            }
        });


        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  命理解读弹窗
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        window.showInterpret = function(type) {
            const popup = document.getElementById('interpretPopup');
            const titleEl = document.getElementById('interpretTitle');
            const bodyEl = document.getElementById('interpretBody');
            // 若从八字排盘页面调用，使用八字排盘的日期（含时辰）
            const baziOverlay = document.getElementById('baziOverlay');
            const inBazi = baziOverlay && baziOverlay.classList.contains('show');
            const y = inBazi ? _bzY : currentViewDate.y;
            const m = inBazi ? _bzM : currentViewDate.m;
            const d = inBazi ? _bzD : currentViewDate.d;
            const h = inBazi ? _bzH : 12;
            if (!y || !m || !d) return;

            const dd = computeDay(y, m, d);
            if (!dd) return;

            // 从八字页面调用时使用真实的出生时辰，否则使用 computeDay 的午时
            const effHourGZ = inBazi ? getHourGZ(dd.stem, _bzH).gz : dd.hourGZ;
            const wxMap = getWangXiang(dd.monthGZ ? dd.monthGZ[1] : '辰');
            const wxCounts = getWuxingCounts(dd.yearGZ, dd.monthGZ, dd.dayGZ, effHourGZ);

            let title = '', body = '';

            if (type === 'strength') {
                title = '<i class="ti ti-sun"></i> 日主强弱分析';
                const sw = dd.stemWX;
                const selfCount = wxCounts[sw] || 0;
                const total = Object.values(wxCounts).reduce((a,b)=>a+b, 0);
                const pct = Math.round(selfCount / total * 100);
                let level = selfCount >= 3 ? '偏强' : selfCount <= 1 ? '偏弱' : '中和';
                body = `<p>日主 <strong style="color:${getWuxingCSS(sw).color}">${dd.stem} (${sw})</strong></p>
                  <p>日主五行在四柱中共出现 <strong>${selfCount}</strong> 次 (${pct}%)，属<strong>${level}</strong>。月令${wxMap[sw] || ''}。</p>
                  ${renderWuxingDist(wxCounts, wxMap)}
                  <p style="font-size:0.65rem;color:#8b6946;margin-top:0.4rem;">日主强弱决定命局根基，强则能担财官，弱则需印比扶助。具体需结合月令旺衰、通根透干综合判断。</p>`;
            } else if (type === 'favor') {
                title = '<i class="ti ti-diamond"></i> 五行喜忌';
                const sw = dd.stemWX;
                body = `<p>日主 <strong style="color:${getWuxingCSS(sw).color}">${dd.stem} (${sw})</strong> · 月令${wxMap[sw] || ''}</p>
                  ${renderWuxingDist(wxCounts, wxMap)}
                  <p style="font-size:0.65rem;color:#8b6946;margin-top:0.4rem;">五行的喜忌需结合具体八字格局、月令深浅、十神配置来定。一般而言：身强喜克泄耗（财官食伤），身弱喜生扶（印比）。建议参考专业命理师详细分析。</p>`;
            } else if (type === 'gods') {
                title = '<i class="ti ti-sparkles"></i> 神煞精要';
                body = `<p><strong>吉神：</strong>${dd.goodGods.length ? dd.goodGods.join('、') : '无'}</p>
                  <p><strong>凶神：</strong>${dd.badGods.length ? dd.badGods.join('、') : '无'}</p>
                  <p><strong>建除：</strong>${dd.jianchu}</p>
                  <p><strong>值神：</strong>${dd.by12Name}</p>
                  <p style="font-size:0.65rem;color:#8b6946;margin-top:0.4rem;">神煞为择日之重要参考，吉神多则百事顺遂，凶神众则需谨慎行事。</p>`;
            } else if (type === 'wxdist' || type === 'analysis') {
                title = '<i class="ti ti-chart-bar"></i> 五行分布';
                const order = ['木','火','土','金','水'];
                const desc = { '木':'仁·肝·春·东', '火':'礼·心·夏·南', '土':'信·脾·长夏·中', '金':'义·肺·秋·西', '水':'智·肾·冬·北' };
                body = renderWuxingDist(wxCounts, wxMap) + `<div style="text-align:left;font-size:0.62rem;color:#6b4d30;margin-top:0.4rem;">
                  <p style="margin-bottom:0.2rem;">旺相休囚死（月令：${dd.monthGZ ? dd.monthGZ[1] : '——'}）：${order.map(w => w+wxMap[w]).join(' ')}</p>
                  ${order.filter(w => (wxCounts[w]||0) > 0).map(w => `<p><strong>${w}</strong>(${wxCounts[w]}): ${desc[w]}</p>`).join('')}
                </div>`;
                body += `<p style="font-size:0.6rem;color:#8b6946;margin-top:0.3rem;">四柱干支共8字，年柱${dd.yearGZ}、月柱${dd.monthGZ}、日柱${dd.dayGZ}、时柱${effHourGZ}各有五行属性。</p>`;
            } else if (type === 'weight') {
                title = '<i class="ti ti-scale"></i> 八字重量详解';
                // 使用八字页面的时辰地支（若有），否则用 computeDay 的午时 hourGZ
                const hBranch = inBazi ? getHourGZ(dd.stem, _bzH).branch : (dd.hourGZ ? dd.hourGZ[1] : '子');
                const wt = dd.yearGZ ? getBaziWeight(dd.yearGZ, dd.monthGZ, dd.dayGZ, hBranch) : 0;
                const wtIdx2 = Math.round(wt * 10) - 21;
                const wtText2 = (wtIdx2 >= 0 && wtIdx2 < BZ_WEIGHT_TEXT.length) ? BZ_WEIGHT_TEXT[wtIdx2] : '';
                body = `<p><strong>总重量：</strong>${wt.toFixed(1)}两</p>`;
                if (wtText2) body += `<p style="margin-top:0.3rem;"><strong>袁天罡称骨断语：</strong>${wtText2}</p>`;
                body += `<p style="font-size:0.62rem;color:#8b6946;margin-top:0.3rem;">袁天罡称骨算命法，将年月日时各有重量，相加得总重量，对应不同断语。</p>`;
            } else if (type === 'pillars') {
                title = '<i class="ti ti-list-details"></i> 四柱详断';
                const yDuan = dd.yearGZ ? (BZ_YEAR_TEXT[getGZIdx(dd.yearGZ) % 60] || '') : '';
                const mDuan = dd.monthGZ ? (BZ_MONTH_TEXT[(getBranchIdx(dd.monthGZ[1]) - 2 + 12) % 12] || '') : '';
                const dDuan = dd.lunarDay ? (BZ_DAY_TEXT[(dd.lunarDay - 1) % 30] || '') : '';
                const hBranch2 = inBazi ? getHourGZ(dd.stem, _bzH).branch : (dd.hourGZ ? dd.hourGZ[1] : '子');
                const hDuan = BZ_HOUR_TEXT[getBranchIdx(hBranch2)] || '';
                body = '';
                if (yDuan) body += `<p><strong>年柱断：</strong>${yDuan}</p>`;
                if (mDuan) body += `<p style="margin-top:0.3rem;"><strong>月柱断：</strong>${mDuan}</p>`;
                if (dDuan) body += `<p style="margin-top:0.3rem;"><strong>日柱断：</strong>${dDuan}</p>`;
                if (hDuan) body += `<p style="margin-top:0.3rem;"><strong>时柱断：</strong>${hDuan}</p>`;
            } else if (type === 'daymaster') {
                title = '<i class="ti ti-user"></i> 日柱论断';
                const dmText = dd.stem ? (BZ_DAY_MASTER_TEXT[getStemIdx(dd.stem)] || '') : '';
                const stageTxt2 = dd.stem && dd.branch ? (BZ_STAGE12_TEXT[get12StageIdx(dd.stem, dd.branch)] || '') : '';
                body = '';
                if (dmText) body += `<p>${dmText}</p>`;
                if (stageTxt2) body += `<p style="margin-top:0.3rem;">${stageTxt2}</p>`;
                body += `<p style="font-size:0.62rem;color:#8b6946;margin-top:0.3rem;">日主论断根据日干五行推断个性特征，结合月令旺衰和十神配置综合分析。</p>`;
            } else if (type === 'relations') {
                title = '<i class="ti ti-arrows-exchange"></i> 合冲刑害详解';
                const stems2 = dd.yearGZ ? [dd.yearGZ[0], dd.monthGZ[0], dd.dayGZ[0], dd.hourGZ[0]] : [];
                const branches2 = dd.yearGZ ? [dd.yearGZ[1], dd.monthGZ[1], dd.dayGZ[1], dd.hourGZ[1]] : [];
                const tgR = findTianGanHe(stems2);
                const dzR = findSanHe(branches2) + findSanHui(branches2) + findLiuHe(branches2) + findLiuHai(branches2) + findLiuChong(branches2) + findXiangXing(branches2);
                body = `<p><strong>天干关系：</strong>${tgR ? '天干有' + tgR.replace(/，$/, '') : '天干无合'}</p>`;
                body += `<p style="margin-top:0.3rem;"><strong>地支关系：</strong>${dzR ? '地支有' + dzR.replace(/，$/, '') : '地支无刑冲害合'}</p>`;
                body += `<p style="font-size:0.62rem;color:#8b6946;margin-top:0.3rem;">天干合主外缘关系，地支合冲刑害主内在矛盾。三合三会力大，六合力小；相冲最急，相刑最烈。</p>`;
            }

            titleEl.innerHTML = title;
            bodyEl.innerHTML = body;
            popup.classList.add('show');
        };
        window.closeInterpret = function() {
            document.getElementById('interpretPopup').classList.remove('show');
        };
        document.getElementById('interpretPopup').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
            if (e.target === this) closeInterpret();
        });

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  数据导出 (文本格式)
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        window.exportText = function() {
            const dat = currentViewDate;
            if (!dat || !dat.y) return;
            const d = computeDay(dat.y, dat.m, dat.d);
            if (!d) return;
            const wday = new Date(dat.y, dat.m - 1, dat.d).getDay();
            const lm = normLunarMonth(d.lunarMonth);
            const lunarStr = (d.isLeap ? '闰' : '') + (CMON[lm - 1] || lm + '月') + (CDAY[d.lunarDay - 1] || d.lunarDay);
            const counts = getWuxingCounts(d.yearGZ, d.monthGZ, d.dayGZ, d.hourGZ);
            const wxMap = getWangXiang(d.monthGZ ? d.monthGZ[1] : '辰');
            const text = `══════════════════════════
  万年历 · 协纪辨方 排盘
══════════════════════════
公历：${dat.y}年${dat.m}月${dat.d}日 星期${WEEK[wday]}
农历：${d.lunarYear}年 ${lunarStr}
节气：${d.solarTerm || '——'}
生肖：${getYearZodiac(dat.y).full}

【四柱八字】
年柱：${d.yearGZ} · ${d.yearNaYin}
月柱：${d.monthGZ} · ${d.monthNaYin}
日柱：${d.dayGZ} · ${d.dayNaYin} (日主)
时柱：${d.hourGZ} · ${d.hourNaYin} · ${d.hourShichen}

【十神】(以日干${d.stem}为中心)
年干${d.yearGZ[0]}：${getShiShen(d.stem, d.yearGZ[0])}
月干${d.monthGZ[0]}：${getShiShen(d.stem, d.monthGZ[0])}
日干${d.stem}：比肩
时干${d.hourGZ[0]}：${getShiShen(d.stem, d.hourGZ[0])}

【空亡】${(() => { const xk = getXunKongBranches(d.stem, d.branch); return xk[0] + ' ' + xk[1]; })()}
【日支藏干】${getCangGan(d.branch).join('、') || '——'}

【五行分布】
木${counts['木']||0}(${wxMap['木']||''}) 火${counts['火']||0}(${wxMap['火']||''}) 土${counts['土']||0}(${wxMap['土']||''}) 金${counts['金']||0}(${wxMap['金']||''}) 水${counts['水']||0}(${wxMap['水']||''})

【九星】${d.nineStar ? d.nineStar.name + (d.nineStar.good ? '(吉)' : '(凶)') : '——'}
【无禄日】${d.wulu ? '是（大事不宜）' : '否'}
【倒家杀】${d.daojia ? '是（忌入宅、安床、开业）' : '否'}
【建除】${d.jianchu}
【值神】${d.by12Name}
【冲煞】冲${d.chong || '——'}·煞${d.sha || '——'}
【廿八宿】${d.xiuFull}
【吉神】${d.goodGods.join('、') || '——'}
【凶神】${d.badGods.join('、') || '——'}
【彭祖百忌】${d.pengzu || '——'}
══════════════════════════`;
            const blob = new Blob([text], {type: 'text/plain;charset=utf-8'});
            const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
            const a = document.createElement('a');
            a.href = url; a.download = `排盘_${dat.y}年${dat.m}月${dat.d}日.txt`;
            a.click(); URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
        };

        // 详情页事件委托
        document.getElementById('fullDetailBody').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
            const ieLink = e.target.closest('.ie-link');
            if (ieLink) {
                const itype = ieLink.dataset.interpret;
                if (itype) showInterpret(itype);
            }
        });

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  设置面板
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        window.openSettings = function() {
            document.getElementById('settingsOverlay').classList.add('show');
            document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
        };
        window.closeSettings = function() {
            document.getElementById('settingsOverlay').classList.remove('show');
            document.body.style.overflow = '';
        };
        document.getElementById('settingsOverlay').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
            if (e.target === this) closeSettings();
        });

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  主题切换
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        window.toggleTheme = function() {
            const isDark = document.body.classList.toggle('dark');
            const tog = document.getElementById('togDark');
            if (tog) tog.checked = isDark;
            saveSetting('darkTheme', isDark);
            const btn = document.getElementById('themeBtn');
            if (btn) btn.innerHTML = isDark ? '<i class="ti ti-sun"></i>' : '<i class="ti ti-sun-moon"></i>';
        };

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  择日推算
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        window.openDateCalc = function() {
            document.getElementById('dateCalcOverlay').classList.add('show');
            _zeY = _barY; _zeM = _barM; _zeD = _barD; _zeH = _barH; _zeMin = _barMin;
            document.getElementById('zeSolarDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_zeY, _zeM, _zeD, _zeH, _zeMin);
            document.getElementById('calcResult').innerHTML = '输入日期后点击推算，自动计算对应农历/公历…';
            closeSettings();
        };
        window.closeDateCalc = function() {
            document.getElementById('dateCalcOverlay').classList.remove('show');
        };
        document.getElementById('dateCalcOverlay').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
            if (e.target === this) closeDateCalc();
        });
        // 四柱表生成辅助
        function buildPillarsTable(ch, dayStem, h, min, sec) {
            const yearGZ = ch.year.toString();
            const monthGZ = ch.month.toString();
            const dayGZ = ch.day.toString();
            const hourGZ = ch.hour.toString();
            const hg = getHourGZ(dayStem, h);
            const pillars = [
                { label:'年柱', gz: yearGZ, stem: yearGZ[0], branch: yearGZ[1] },
                { label:'月柱', gz: monthGZ, stem: monthGZ[0], branch: monthGZ[1] },
                { label:'日柱', gz: dayGZ, stem: dayStem, branch: dayGZ[1] },
                { label:'时柱', gz: hg.gz, stem: hg.gz[0], branch: hg.gz[1] }
            ];
            let hh = '<table class="pillars-mini"><tr><th></th><th>年柱</th><th>月柱</th><th>日柱</th><th>时柱</th></tr>';
            // 十神
            hh += '<tr><td class="pl">十神</td>';
            for (const p of pillars) {
                const tg = getTenGod(dayStem, p.stem);
                hh += '<td class="' + (tg.cat === '比劫' ? 'ss-bj' : tg.cat === '食伤' ? 'ss-ss' : tg.cat === '财星' ? 'ss-cx' : tg.cat === '官杀' ? 'ss-gs' : 'ss-yx') + '">' + tg.full + '</td>';
            }
            hh += '</tr>';
            // 天干
            hh += '<tr><td class="pl">天干</td>';
            for (const p of pillars) hh += '<td class="gz-stem">' + p.stem + '</td>';
            hh += '</tr>';
            // 地支
            hh += '<tr><td class="pl">地支</td>';
            for (const p of pillars) hh += '<td class="gz-branch">' + p.branch + '</td>';
            hh += '</tr>';
            // 藏干
            hh += '<tr><td class="pl">藏干</td>';
            for (const p of pillars) hh += '<td class="cg">' + getHiddenStems(p.branch) + '</td>';
            hh += '</tr>';
            // 纳音
            hh += '<tr><td class="pl">纳音</td>';
            for (const p of pillars) hh += '<td class="ny">' + getNaYinForGZ(p.gz) + '</td>';
            hh += '</tr>';
            // 十二长生
            hh += '<tr><td class="pl">长生</td>';
            for (const p of pillars) hh += '<td class="zs">' + get12Stage(dayStem, p.branch) + '</td>';
            hh += '</tr>';
            hh += '</table>';
            return hh;
        }

        // 五行分布条（择日推算入口：接收天干+地支数组）
        function buildWuxingBar(stems, branches) {
            return renderWuxingDist(countWuxing(stems, branches));
        }

        window.doZeCalc = function() {
            const res = document.getElementById('calcResult');
            let y = _zeY, m = _zeM, d = _zeD, h = _zeH, min = _zeMin, sec = 0;
            try {
                const lsr = lunisolar(new Date(y, m - 1, d, h, min, sec));
                const lu = lsr.lunar;
                const ch = lsr.char8;
                const dayStem = ch.day.toString()[0];
                const dayGZ = ch.day.toString();
                const monthBranch = ch.month.toString()[1];
                const jqMonth = ((BRANCHES.indexOf(monthBranch) - 2 + 12) % 12) + 1;
                const xi = xiuIndex(y, m, d);
                const ns = getNineStar(dayGZ, jqMonth);
                const wulu = isWuluDay(dayGZ[0], dayGZ[1]);
                const daojia = isDaojiaDay(ch.year.toString()[0], dayGZ, lu.month);
                const duty12 = lsr.theGods.getDuty12God();
                const hongsha = isHongSha(ch.month.toString()[1], dayGZ[1]);
                const jinshen = isJinShen(xi);
                const lm = normLunarMonth(lu.month);
                const zeMonthName = (lu.isLeapMonth ? '闰' : '') + (CMON[lm - 1] || lm + '月');
                const zeDayName = (CDAY[lu.day - 1] || lu.day);
                const zeYearGZ = ch.year.toString(), zeMonthGZ = ch.month.toString(), zeDayGZ = dayGZ;
                let html = '<div class="ze-header-info"><i class="ti ti-sun"></i> 公历 ' + y + '年' + m + '月' + d + '日 ' + String(h).padStart(2,'0') + ':' + String(min).padStart(2,'0') + ':' + String(sec).padStart(2,'0') + '<br><i class="ti ti-moon"></i> 农历 ' + zeYearGZ + '年（' + getNaYinForGZ(zeYearGZ) + '）· ' + zeMonthName + zeMonthGZ + '（' + getNaYinForGZ(zeMonthGZ) + '）' + zeDayName + zeDayGZ + '（' + getNaYinForGZ(zeDayGZ) + '）' + '</div>';
                html += buildPillarsTable(ch, dayStem, h, min, sec);
                const allStems = [ch.year.toString()[0], ch.month.toString()[0], dayStem, getHourGZ(dayStem, h).stem];
                const allBranches = [ch.year.toString()[1], ch.month.toString()[1], dayGZ[1], getHourGZ(dayStem, h).branch];
                html += '<div class="ze-section-label"><i class="ti ti-flame"></i> 五行分布</div>';
                html += buildWuxingBar(allStems, allBranches);
                html += '<div class="ze-section-label"><i class="ti ti-clipboard-list"></i> 黄历信息</div>';
                html += '<div class="ze-result-item"><span class="ze-label"><i class="ti ti-home-off"></i> 倒家杀</span><span class="ze-val">' + (daojia ? '<span class="bad">是 — 忌入宅、安床、开业、修造</span>' : '<span class="good">无</span>') + '</span></div>';
                html += '<div class="ze-result-item"><span class="ze-label"><i class="ti ti-star"></i> 九星</span><span class="ze-val">' + (ns ? '<span class="' + (ns.good ? 'good' : 'bad') + '">' + ns.name + '（' + (ns.good ? '吉' : '凶') + '）— ' + ns.meaning + '</span>' : '<span>无</span>') + '</span></div>';
                html += '<div class="ze-result-item"><span class="ze-label"><i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i> 无禄日</span><span class="ze-val">' + (wulu ? '<span class="bad">是 — 大事不宜</span>' : '<span class="good">无</span>') + '</span></div>';
                html += '<div class="ze-result-item"><span class="ze-label"><i class="ti ti-star"></i> 廿八宿</span><span class="ze-val">' + XIU[xi] + '宿' + XIU_ANIMAL[xi] + (jinshen ? ' <span class="bad" style="animation:jinshen-blink 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;"><i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i> 金神七煞</span>' : '') + '</span></div>';
                html += '<div class="ze-result-item"><span class="ze-label"><i class="ti ti-triangle"></i> 红砂日</span><span class="ze-val">' + (hongsha ? '<span class="bad" style="font-family:KaiTi,STKaiti,楷体,serif;">是 — 小红砂凶日，大事不宜</span>' : '<span class="good">无</span>') + '</span></div>';
                html += '<div class="ze-result-item"><span class="ze-label"><i class="ti ti-building-castle"></i> 建除</span><span class="ze-val">' + (duty12 ? duty12.name + '（' + (DUTY12_GOOD[duty12.name] ? '黄道吉日' : '黑道凶日') + '）' : '无') + '</span></div>';
                res.innerHTML = html;
            } catch (e) {
                res.innerHTML = '<span style="color:#c43d3d;">推算出错：' + e.message + '</span>';
            }
        };

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  隐私/用户协议
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const LEGAL_TEXTS = {
            privacy: {
                title: '<i class="ti ti-lock"></i> 隐私协议',
                body: `<h4>一、信息收集</h4><p>本应用为纯前端应用，所有数据（包括记事、设置偏好等）均存储在您的设备本地（localStorage），不会上传至任何服务器。</p>
                <h4>二、信息使用</h4><p>您在本应用中记录的记事内容仅保留在您的设备上，用于日历标记与查看。我们不会收集、分析、分享您的任何个人信息。</p>
                <h4>三、第三方服务</h4><p>本应用使用 lunisolar 开源库（CDN加载）进行农历/干支计算，该CDN可能记录基本的访问日志。除此外不接入任何第三方统计或广告服务。</p>
                <h4>四、免责声明</h4><p>本程序为算法化实现，黄历数据仅供参考，不等同于古籍原文校勘或官方择日意见。使用本应用所做出的任何决策，开发者不承担责任。</p>
                <h4>五、联系方式</h4><p>如有隐私相关问题，请联系应用开发者。</p>`
            },
            terms: {
                title: '<i class="ti ti-file-text"></i> 用户协议',
                body: `<h4>一、服务说明</h4><p>万年历·协纪辨方（以下简称"本应用"）是一款提供公历/农历、干支、节气、神煞等传统文化信息查询的工具类应用。</p>
                <h4>二、使用规则</h4><p>用户应遵守中华人民共和国相关法律法规，不得利用本应用从事违法活动。本应用提供的黄历信息为传统文化参考，不可作为法律、投资、医疗等重大决策的唯一依据。</p>
                <h4>三、知识产权</h4><p>本应用的代码、算法、界面设计等知识产权归开发者所有。lunisolar 库及其插件遵循其各自的开源许可协议。</p>
                <h4>四、免责条款</h4><p>本应用按"现状"提供，不保证数据的绝对准确性与完整性。因使用本应用数据而产生的任何损失，开发者不承担任何责任。</p>
                <h4>五、协议变更</h4><p>开发者保留随时修改本协议的权利，修改后的协议将在应用更新时生效。</p>`
            }
        };
        window.openLegal = function(type) {
            const legal = LEGAL_TEXTS[type];
            if (!legal) return;
            document.getElementById('legalTitle').textContent = legal.title;
            document.getElementById('legalBody').innerHTML = legal.body;
            document.getElementById('legalOverlay').classList.add('show');
        };
        window.closeLegal = function() {
            document.getElementById('legalOverlay').classList.remove('show');
        };
        document.getElementById('legalOverlay').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
            if (e.target === this) closeLegal();
        });

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  八字排盘 — 覆层逻辑
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        let baziReturnCallback = null;
        let _lastBaziData = null;  // 最新一次排盘结果，供保存用

        window.openBaziFromZe = function(dateStr, h, min, sec) {
            baziReturnCallback = function() { document.getElementById('dateCalcOverlay').classList.add('show'); };
            document.getElementById('dateCalcOverlay').classList.remove('show');
            const [y, m, d] = dateStr.split('-').map(Number);
            _bzY = y; _bzM = m; _bzD = d; _bzH = +h || 12; _bzMin = +min || 0;
            document.getElementById('bzDateDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_bzY, _bzM, _bzD, _bzH, _bzMin);
            document.getElementById('bzName').value = '';
            document.getElementById('bzSex').value = '1';
            document.getElementById('baziResult').innerHTML = '';
            document.getElementById('baziOverlay').classList.add('show');
            setTimeout(() => doBaziCalc(), 100);
        };

        window.openBaziQuick = function() {
            baziReturnCallback = null;
            _bzY = _barY; _bzM = _barM; _bzD = _barD; _bzH = _barH; _bzMin = _barMin;
            document.getElementById('bzDateDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_bzY, _bzM, _bzD, _bzH, _bzMin);
            document.getElementById('bzName').value = '';
            document.getElementById('bzSex').value = '1';
            document.getElementById('baziResult').innerHTML = '';
            document.getElementById('baziOverlay').classList.add('show');
            setTimeout(() => doBaziCalc(), 100);
        };

        window.closeBazi = function() {
            document.getElementById('baziOverlay').classList.remove('show');
            if (baziReturnCallback) { baziReturnCallback(); baziReturnCallback = null; }
        };
        // 八字排盘保存/加载
        window.saveBaziRecord = function() {
            if (!_lastBaziData) { alert('请先排盘后再保存。'); return; }
            const list = loadBaziList();
            const record = Object.assign({}, _lastBaziData);
            record.savedAt = new Date().toISOString();
            record.htmlSummary = '';  // 清除HTML摘要节省空间，加载时重新生成
            const key = 'cal_bazi_' + record.y + String(record.m).padStart(2,'0') + String(record.d).padStart(2,'0') + String(record.h).padStart(2,'0') + String(record.min).padStart(2,'0');
            // 去重：同日期时间覆盖旧记录
            const existIdx = list.findIndex(r => r.y === record.y && r.m === record.m && r.d === record.d && r.h === record.h && r.min === record.min);
            if (existIdx >= 0) list[existIdx] = record;
            else list.unshift(record);
            if (list.length > 20) list.length = 20;  // 最多20条
            try { localStorage.setItem('cal_bazi_list', JSON.stringify(list)); } catch(e) { _flashMsg('存储空间不足，排盘未保存'); }
            _lastBaziData.savedAt = record.savedAt;
            renderBaziSavedList();
        };
        function loadBaziList() {
            try { const v = localStorage.getItem('cal_bazi_list'); return v ? JSON.parse(v) : []; } catch(e) { return []; }
        }
        window.renderBaziSavedList = function() {
            const el = document.getElementById('baziSavedList');
            if (!el) return;
            const list = loadBaziList();
            if (!list.length) { el.innerHTML = ''; return; }
            let h = '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-clipboard-list"></i> 已保存的排盘 (' + list.length + '条)</h4>';
            for (let i = 0; i < list.length; i++) {
                const r = list[i];
                const dt = r.savedAt ? new Date(r.savedAt) : null;
                const dtStr = dt ? (dt.getFullYear()+'-'+String(dt.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')+'-'+String(dt.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')+' '+String(dt.getHours()).padStart(2,'0')+':'+String(dt.getMinutes()).padStart(2,'0')) : '';
                h += '<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0.3rem 0.5rem;margin:0.15rem 0;background:rgba(255,251,240,0.5);border:1px solid #ede0cc;border-radius:6px;font-size:0.62rem;">';
                h += '<span><strong>' + (r.name || '无名') + '</strong> ' + r.sexLabel + ' · ' + r.y + '-' + r.m + '-' + r.d + ' ' + String(r.h).padStart(2,'0') + ':' + String(r.min).padStart(2,'0') + '<br><span style="color:#8b6946;">' + r.lunarStr + ' · ' + r.hourGZ + ' ' + r.hourShichen + '</span></span>';
                h += '<div style="display:flex;gap:0.2rem;flex-shrink:0;">';
                h += '<button class="note-btn sm" style="font-size:0.55rem;padding:0.15rem 0.4rem;" onclick="loadBaziRecord(' + i + ')"><i class="ti ti-clipboard-list"></i> 加载</button>';
                h += '<button class="note-btn sm del" style="font-size:0.55rem;padding:0.15rem 0.4rem;background:#e8c4c4;color:#7a1a1e;border-color:#d4a0a0;" onclick="deleteBaziRecord(' + i + ')"><i class="ti ti-x"></i></button>';
                h += '</div></div>';
            }
            h += '</div>';
            el.innerHTML = h;
        };
        window.loadBaziRecord = function(idx) {
            const list = loadBaziList();
            if (idx < 0 || idx >= list.length) return;
            const r = list[idx];
            _bzY = r.y; _bzM = r.m; _bzD = r.d; _bzH = r.h; _bzMin = r.min;
            document.getElementById('bzName').value = r.name || '';
            document.getElementById('bzSex').value = r.sex;
            document.getElementById('bzDateDisplay').textContent = fmtDt(_bzY, _bzM, _bzD, _bzH, _bzMin);
            doBaziCalc();
            // 滚动到结果
            setTimeout(() => { const r2 = document.getElementById('baziResult'); if (r2) r2.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'}); }, 200);
        };
        window.deleteBaziRecord = function(idx) {
            const list = loadBaziList();
            if (idx < 0 || idx >= list.length) return;
            list.splice(idx, 1);
            try { localStorage.setItem('cal_bazi_list', JSON.stringify(list)); } catch(e) { _flashMsg('存储写入失败'); }
            renderBaziSavedList();
        };

        // baziOverlay点击关闭 — 事件挂载统一到下方DOMContentLoaded中

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  神煞计算 (简化版 — 常用神煞)
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        // 天乙贵人
        function getTianYi(dayStem) {
            const map = { '甲':'丑未','乙':'子申','丙':'亥酉','丁':'亥酉','戊':'丑未','己':'子申','庚':'丑未','辛':'午寅','壬':'卯巳','癸':'卯巳' };
            return map[dayStem] || '';
        }
        // 文昌
        function getWenChang(dayStem) {
            const map = { '甲':'巳','乙':'午','丙':'申','丁':'酉','戊':'申','己':'酉','庚':'亥','辛':'子','壬':'寅','癸':'卯' };
            return map[dayStem] || '';
        }
        // 羊刃
        function getYangRen(dayStem) {
            const map = { '甲':'卯','乙':'寅','丙':'午','丁':'巳','戊':'午','己':'巳','庚':'酉','辛':'申','壬':'子','癸':'亥' };
            return map[dayStem] || '';
        }
        // 禄神
        function getLuShen(dayStem) {
            const map = { '甲':'寅','乙':'卯','丙':'巳','丁':'午','戊':'巳','己':'午','庚':'申','辛':'酉','壬':'亥','癸':'子' };
            return map[dayStem] || '';
        }
        // 桃花(咸池)
        function getXianChi(branch) {
            const map = { '申':'酉','子':'酉','辰':'酉','巳':'午','酉':'午','丑':'午','寅':'卯','午':'卯','戌':'卯','亥':'子','卯':'子','未':'子' };
            return map[branch] || '';
        }
        // 驿马
        function getYiMa(branch) {
            const map = { '申':'寅','子':'寅','辰':'寅','巳':'亥','酉':'亥','丑':'亥','寅':'申','午':'申','戌':'申','亥':'巳','卯':'巳','未':'巳' };
            return map[branch] || '';
        }
        // 华盖
        function getHuaGai(branch) {
            const map = { '申':'辰','子':'辰','辰':'辰','巳':'丑','酉':'丑','丑':'丑','寅':'戌','午':'戌','戌':'戌','亥':'未','卯':'未','未':'未' };
            return map[branch] || '';
        }
        // 将星
        function getJiangXing(branch) {
            const map = { '申':'子','子':'子','辰':'子','巳':'酉','酉':'酉','丑':'酉','寅':'午','午':'午','戌':'午','亥':'卯','卯':'卯','未':'卯' };
            return map[branch] || '';
        }
        // 孤辰
        function getGuChen(branch) {
            const map = { '亥':'寅','子':'寅','丑':'寅','寅':'巳','卯':'巳','辰':'巳','巳':'申','午':'申','未':'申','申':'亥','酉':'亥','戌':'亥' };
            return map[branch] || '';
        }
        // 红鸾
        function getHongLuan(branchIdx) {
            const arr = ['卯','寅','丑','子','亥','戌','酉','申','未','午','巳','辰'];
            return arr[branchIdx] || '';
        }
        // 天喜
        function getTianXi(branchIdx) {
            const arr = ['酉','申','未','午','巳','辰','卯','寅','丑','子','亥','戌'];
            return arr[branchIdx] || '';
        }
        // 学堂
        function getXueTang(dayStem) {
            const map = { '甲':'亥','乙':'午','丙':'寅','丁':'酉','戊':'寅','己':'酉','庚':'巳','辛':'子','壬':'申','癸':'卯' };
            return map[dayStem] || '';
        }
        // 金舆
        function getJinYu(dayStem) {
            const map = { '甲':'辰','乙':'巳','丙':'未','丁':'申','戊':'未','己':'申','庚':'戌','辛':'亥','壬':'丑','癸':'寅' };
            return map[dayStem] || '';
        }
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  新增神煞计算函数（移植自B8zi.html）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        // 月德
        function getYueDe(yearBranch) {
            const trigrams = [[2,6,10],[0,4,8],[3,7,11],[1,5,9]];
            const ydStems = ['丙','甲','壬','庚'];
            for (let g = 0; g < 4; g++) {
                if (trigrams[g].includes(getBranchIdx(yearBranch))) return ydStems[g];
            }
            return '';
        }
        // 国印
        function getGuoYin(stem) {
            const map = {'甲':'戌','乙':'亥','丙':'丑','丁':'寅','戊':'丑','己':'寅','庚':'辰','辛':'巳','壬':'未','癸':'申'};
            return map[stem] || '';
        }
        // 红艳
        function getHongYan(stem) {
            const map = {'甲':'午','乙':'午','丙':'寅','丁':'未','戊':'辰','己':'辰','庚':'戌','辛':'酉','壬':'子','癸':'申'};
            return map[stem] || '';
        }
        // 流霞
        function getLiuXia(stem) {
            const map = {'甲':'酉','乙':'戌','丙':'未','丁':'申','戊':'巳','己':'午','庚':'辰','辛':'卯','壬':'亥','癸':'寅'};
            return map[stem] || '';
        }
        // 亡神
        function getWangShen(yearBranch) {
            const trigrams = [[2,6,10],[0,4,8],[3,7,11],[1,5,9]];
            const wsBranches = ['寅','申','亥','巳'];
            for (let g = 0; g < 4; g++) {
                if (trigrams[g].includes(getBranchIdx(yearBranch))) return wsBranches[g];
            }
            return '';
        }
        // 劫煞
        function getJieSha(yearBranch) {
            const trigrams = [[2,6,10],[0,4,8],[3,7,11],[1,5,9]];
            const jsBranches = ['巳','寅','亥','申'];
            for (let g = 0; g < 4; g++) {
                if (trigrams[g].includes(getBranchIdx(yearBranch))) return jsBranches[g];
            }
            return '';
        }
        // 灾煞
        function getZaiSha(yearBranch) {
            const trigrams = [[2,6,10],[0,4,8],[3,7,11],[1,5,9]];
            const zsBranches = ['午','卯','子','酉'];
            for (let g = 0; g < 4; g++) {
                if (trigrams[g].includes(getBranchIdx(yearBranch))) return zsBranches[g];
            }
            return '';
        }
        // 六厄
        function getLiuE(yearBranch) {
            const trigrams = [[2,6,10],[0,4,8],[3,7,11],[1,5,9]];
            const leBranches = ['丑','戌','辰','未'];
            for (let g = 0; g < 4; g++) {
                if (trigrams[g].includes(getBranchIdx(yearBranch))) return leBranches[g];
            }
            return '';
        }
        // 寡宿
        function getGuaXiu(yearBranch) {
            const map = {'子':'戌','丑':'戌','寅':'丑','卯':'丑','辰':'丑','巳':'辰','午':'辰','未':'辰','申':'未','酉':'未','戌':'未','亥':'戌'};
            return map[yearBranch] || '';
        }
        // 天医
        function getTianYi2(yearBranch) {
            const map = {'子':'亥','丑':'子','寅':'丑','卯':'寅','辰':'卯','巳':'辰','午':'巳','未':'午','申':'未','酉':'申','戌':'酉','亥':'戌'};
            return map[yearBranch] || '';
        }
        // 大耗
        function getDaHao(yearBranch, sex) {
            const yangMap = {'子':'未','丑':'申','寅':'酉','卯':'戌','辰':'亥','巳':'子','午':'丑','未':'寅','申':'卯','酉':'辰','戌':'巳','亥':'午'};
            const yinMap = {'子':'巳','丑':'午','寅':'未','卯':'申','辰':'酉','巳':'戌','午':'亥','未':'子','申':'丑','酉':'寅','戌':'卯','亥':'辰'};
            const isYang = (getBranchIdx(yearBranch) + 1) % 2 === 1;
            if ((isYang && sex === '男') || (!isYang && sex === '女')) return yangMap[yearBranch] || '';
            return yinMap[yearBranch] || '';
        }
        // 太极贵人
        function getTaiJi(stem, branch) {
            const map = {'甲':['子','午'],'乙':['卯','酉'],'丙':['卯','酉'],'丁':['寅','申'],'戊':['辰','戌','丑','未'],'己':['辰','戌','丑','未'],'庚':['寅','申'],'辛':['巳','亥'],'壬':['巳','亥'],'癸':['卯','酉']};
            const list = map[stem];
            return list && list.includes(branch) ? '太极贵人' : '';
        }
        // 魁罡
        function isKuiGang(dayGZ) {
            return ['庚辰','壬辰','庚戌','戊戌'].includes(dayGZ);
        }
        // 阴差阳错
        function isYinYangCuo(dayGZ) {
            return ['丙子','丁丑','戊寅','辛卯','壬辰','癸巳','丙午','丁未','戊申','辛酉','壬戌','癸亥'].includes(dayGZ);
        }
        // 四废
        function isSiFei(monthBranch, dayGZ) {
            const mi = getBranchIdx(monthBranch);
            const spring = [2,3,4], summer = [5,6,7], autumn = [8,9,10], winter = [11,0,1];
            const maps = {
                spring: ['庚申','辛酉'],
                summer: ['壬子','癸亥'],
                autumn: ['甲寅','乙卯'],
                winter: ['丙午','丁未']
            };
            if (spring.includes(mi)) return maps.spring.includes(dayGZ);
            if (summer.includes(mi)) return maps.summer.includes(dayGZ);
            if (autumn.includes(mi)) return maps.autumn.includes(dayGZ);
            if (winter.includes(mi)) return maps.winter.includes(dayGZ);
            return false;
        }
        // 天赦
        function isTianShe(monthBranch, dayGZ) {
            const mi = getBranchIdx(monthBranch);
            const spring = [2,3,4], summer = [5,6,7], autumn = [8,9,10], winter = [11,0,1];
            if (spring.includes(mi)) return dayGZ === '戊寅';
            if (summer.includes(mi)) return dayGZ === '甲午';
            if (autumn.includes(mi)) return dayGZ === '戊申';
            if (winter.includes(mi)) return dayGZ === '甲子';
            return false;
        }
        // 天德
        function isTianDe(monthBranch, dayBranch) {
            const mi = getBranchIdx(monthBranch);
            const map = [6,7,4,9,9,8,12,1,10,3,3,2];
            return getBranchIdx(dayBranch) + 1 === map[mi];
        }
        // 天德合
        function isTianDeHe(monthBranch, dayStem) {
            const mi = getBranchIdx(monthBranch);
            const tdBranchMap = ['午','巳','辰','卯','寅','丑','子','亥','戌','酉','申','未'];
            const tdBranch = tdBranchMap[mi];
            const heMap = {'子':'丁','丑':'丙','寅':'丁','卯':'壬','辰':'辛','巳':'庚','午':'己','未':'戊','申':'己','酉':'戊','戌':'乙','亥':'丙'};
            return heMap[tdBranch] === dayStem;
        }
        // 月德合
        function isYueDeHe(monthBranch, dayStem) {
            const yd = getYueDe(monthBranch);
            if (!yd) return false;
            const heMap = {'甲':'己','乙':'庚','丙':'辛','丁':'壬','戊':'癸','己':'甲','庚':'乙','辛':'丙','壬':'丁','癸':'戊'};
            return heMap[yd] === dayStem;
        }
        // 十灵
        function isShiLing(dayGZ) {
            return ['甲辰','乙亥','丙辰','丁酉','戊午','庚寅','庚戌','辛亥','壬寅','癸未'].includes(dayGZ);
        }
        // 孤鸾
        function isGuLuan(dayGZ, monthGZ) {
            const targets = ['乙巳','丁巳','辛亥','戊申','壬寅','戊午','癸亥','丙午'];
            return targets.includes(dayGZ) && targets.includes(monthGZ);
        }
        // 日刃
        function isRiRen(dayGZ) {
            return ['丙午','戊午','壬子'].includes(dayGZ);
        }
        // 童子
        function isTongZi(monthBranch, dayBranch, yearNaYinWX) {
            const mi = getBranchIdx(monthBranch);
            const di = getBranchIdx(dayBranch);
            const spring = [2,3,4], summer = [5,6,7], autumn = [8,9,10], winter = [11,0,1];
            if ((spring.includes(mi) || autumn.includes(mi)) && (di === 0 || di === 2)) return true;
            if ((summer.includes(mi) || winter.includes(mi)) && (di === 3 || di === 7 || di === 4)) return true;
            if ((yearNaYinWX === '金' || yearNaYinWX === '木') && (di === 3 || di === 6)) return true;
            if ((yearNaYinWX === '水' || yearNaYinWX === '火') && (di === 9 || di === 10)) return true;
            if (yearNaYinWX === '土' && (di === 4 || di === 5)) return true;
            return false;
        }
        // 三奇
        function getSanQi(stems) {
            const s = stems.map(c => getStemIdx(c) + 1);
            const [i,j,k,m] = s;
            if ((i===2 && j===3 && k===4) || (j===2 && k===3 && m===4)) return '命带地下三奇';
            if ((i===9 && j===10 && k===8) || (j===9 && k===10 && m===8)) return '命带人中三奇';
            if ((i===1 && j===5 && k===7) || (j===1 && k===5 && m===7)) return '命带天上三奇';
            return '';
        }
        // 德秀
        function getDeXiu(stems, monthBranch) {
            const mi = getBranchIdx(monthBranch);
            const s = stems.map(c => getStemIdx(c));
            const checkStem = (val) => s.includes(val);
            if ([2,6,10].includes(mi)) {
                if (checkStem(2) || checkStem(3)) return '德秀';
            }
            if ([8,0,4].includes(mi)) {
                if (checkStem(8) || checkStem(9)) return '德秀';
            }
            if ([5,9,1].includes(mi)) {
                if (checkStem(6) || checkStem(7)) return '德秀';
            }
            if ([11,3,7].includes(mi)) {
                if (checkStem(0) || checkStem(1)) return '德秀';
            }
            return '';
        }
        // 天罗地网
        function isTianLuoDiWang(yearStem, yearBranch) {
            const si = getStemIdx(yearStem);
            const bi = getBranchIdx(yearBranch);
            const stemNum = si + 1;
            const branchNum = bi + 1;
            if ((stemNum === 3 || stemNum === 4) && (branchNum === 11 || branchNum === 12)) return '天罗';
            if ((stemNum === 5 || stemNum === 6 || stemNum === 9 || stemNum === 10) && (branchNum === 5 || branchNum === 6)) return '地网';
            return '';
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  合冲刑害关系分析函数（移植自B8zi.html）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        const PILLAR_LABELS = ['年','月','日','时'];
        const WX_J = WU_XING_J;  // 重用五行顺序数组，避免重复声明
        const GAN_HE_LEI = ['','淫匿','无情','中正','仁义','威制'];

        // 天干合
        function findTianGanHe(stems) {
            const pairs = [[0,5],[1,6],[2,7],[3,8],[4,9]];
let result = '';
            for (let a = 0; a < stems.length; a++) {
                for (let b = a + 1; b < stems.length; b++) {
                    const ai = getStemIdx(stems[a]);
                    const bi2 = getStemIdx(stems[b]);
                    for (const [x, y] of pairs) {
                        if ((ai === x && bi2 === y) || (ai === y && bi2 === x)) {
                            const heIdx = Math.max(x, y) - 4;
                            result += stems[a] + stems[b] + PILLAR_LABELS[a] + PILLAR_LABELS[b] + GAN_HE_LEI[heIdx] + '之合' + WX_J[(heIdx - 1 + 5) % 5] + '，';
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            return result;
        }
        // 三合局
        function findSanHe(branches) {
            const sanHeGroups = [
                {branches: ['申','子','辰'], wx: '水'},
                {branches: ['寅','午','戌'], wx: '火'},
                {branches: ['巳','酉','丑'], wx: '金'},
                {branches: ['亥','卯','未'], wx: '木'}
            ];
let result = '';
            for (const group of sanHeGroups) {
                const found = [];
                for (let i = 0; i < branches.length; i++) {
                    if (group.branches.includes(branches[i])) found.push(i);
                }
                if (found.length >= 3) {
                    const combo = found.slice(0, 3);
                    const names = combo.map(i => PILLAR_LABELS[i]).join('');
                    result += combo.map(i => branches[i]).join('') + names + '三合' + group.wx + '局，';
                }
            }
            return result;
        }
        // 三会局
        function findSanHui(branches) {
            const sanHuiGroups = [
                {branches: ['寅','卯','辰'], wx: '木'},
                {branches: ['巳','午','未'], wx: '火'},
                {branches: ['申','酉','戌'], wx: '金'},
                {branches: ['亥','子','丑'], wx: '水'}
            ];
let result = '';
            for (const group of sanHuiGroups) {
                const found = [];
                for (let i = 0; i < branches.length; i++) {
                    if (group.branches.includes(branches[i])) found.push(i);
                }
                if (found.length >= 3) {
                    const combo = found.slice(0, 3);
                    const names = combo.map(i => PILLAR_LABELS[i]).join('');
                    result += combo.map(i => branches[i]).join('') + names + '三会' + group.wx + '局，';
                }
            }
            return result;
        }
        // 六合
        function findLiuHe(branches) {
            const liuHePairs = [
                ['子','丑'],['寅','亥'],['卯','戌'],['辰','酉'],['巳','申'],['午','未']
            ];
            const liuHeWX = ['土','木','火','金','水','火'];
let result = '';
            for (let a = 0; a < branches.length; a++) {
                for (let b = a + 1; b < branches.length; b++) {
                    for (let p = 0; p < liuHePairs.length; p++) {
                        if ((branches[a] === liuHePairs[p][0] && branches[b] === liuHePairs[p][1]) ||
                            (branches[a] === liuHePairs[p][1] && branches[b] === liuHePairs[p][0])) {
                            result += branches[a] + branches[b] + PILLAR_LABELS[a] + PILLAR_LABELS[b] + '六合' + liuHeWX[p] + '，';
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            return result;
        }
        // 相冲
        function findLiuChong(branches) {
            const chongPairs = [['子','午'],['丑','未'],['寅','申'],['卯','酉'],['辰','戌'],['巳','亥']];
let result = '';
            for (let a = 0; a < branches.length; a++) {
                for (let b = a + 1; b < branches.length; b++) {
                    for (const [x, y] of chongPairs) {
                        if ((branches[a] === x && branches[b] === y) || (branches[a] === y && branches[b] === x)) {
                            result += branches[a] + branches[b] + PILLAR_LABELS[a] + PILLAR_LABELS[b] + '相冲，';
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            return result;
        }
        // 六害
        function findLiuHai(branches) {
            const haiPairs = [['子','未'],['丑','午'],['寅','巳'],['卯','辰'],['申','亥'],['酉','戌']];
let result = '';
            for (let a = 0; a < branches.length; a++) {
                for (let b = a + 1; b < branches.length; b++) {
                    for (const [x, y] of haiPairs) {
                        if ((branches[a] === x && branches[b] === y) || (branches[a] === y && branches[b] === x)) {
                            result += branches[a] + branches[b] + PILLAR_LABELS[a] + PILLAR_LABELS[b] + '相害，';
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            return result;
        }
        // 相刑
        function findXiangXing(branches) {
            const xingRules = [
                {pair: ['寅','巳'], name: '寅巳相刑'},
                {pair: ['巳','申'], name: '巳申相刑'},
                {pair: ['申','寅'], name: '申寅相刑'},
                {pair: ['丑','戌'], name: '丑戌相刑'},
                {pair: ['戌','未'], name: '戌未相刑'},
                {pair: ['未','丑'], name: '未丑相刑'},
                {pair: ['子','卯'], name: '子卯相刑'},
                {pair: ['卯','子'], name: '卯子相刑'},
                {self: '辰', name: '辰自刑'},
                {self: '午', name: '午自刑'},
                {self: '酉', name: '酉自刑'},
                {self: '亥', name: '亥自刑'}
            ];
let result = '';
            for (const rule of xingRules) {
                if (rule.pair) {
                    for (let a = 0; a < branches.length; a++) {
                        for (let b = a + 1; b < branches.length; b++) {
                            if (branches[a] === rule.pair[0] && branches[b] === rule.pair[1]) {
                                result += branches[a] + branches[b] + PILLAR_LABELS[a] + PILLAR_LABELS[b] + rule.name + '，';
                            }
                        }
                    }
                } else if (rule.self) {
                    const idxs = [];
                    for (let i = 0; i < branches.length; i++) {
                        if (branches[i] === rule.self) idxs.push(i);
                    }
                    if (idxs.length >= 2) {
                        for (let i = 0; i < idxs.length - 1; i++) {
                            result += branches[idxs[i]] + branches[idxs[i+1]] + PILLAR_LABELS[idxs[i]] + PILLAR_LABELS[idxs[i+1]] + rule.name + '，';
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
            return result;
        }

        // 收集一柱神煞
        function gatherPillarShensha(dayStem, pillarStem, pillarBranch, pillarGZ, monthBranch, sex, yearBranch, yearStem) {
            const bi = getBranchIdx(pillarBranch);
            const ss = [];
            // 天乙贵人 (查天干)
            const ty = getTianYi(pillarStem);
            if (ty && ty.includes(pillarBranch)) ss.push({ name:'天乙贵人', type:'good' });
            // 太极贵人
            if (getTaiJi(pillarStem, pillarBranch) === '太极贵人') ss.push({ name:'太极贵人', type:'good' });
            // 文昌
            if (getWenChang(pillarStem) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'文昌', type:'good' });
            // 学堂
            if (getXueTang(pillarStem) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'学堂', type:'good' });
            // 禄神
            if (getLuShen(pillarStem) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'禄神', type:'good' });
            // 金舆
            if (getJinYu(pillarStem) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'金舆', type:'good' });
            // 国印
            if (getGuoYin(pillarStem) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'国印', type:'good' });
            // 红鸾/天喜
            if (getHongLuan(bi) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'红鸾', type:'good' });
            if (getTianXi(bi) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'天喜', type:'good' });
            // 将星
            if (getJiangXing(pillarBranch) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'将星', type:'good' });
            // 天医
            if (yearBranch && getTianYi2(yearBranch) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'天医', type:'good' });
            // 羊刃
            if (getYangRen(pillarStem) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'羊刃', type:'bad' });
            // 红艳
            if (getHongYan(dayStem) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'红艳', type:'bad' });
            // 流霞
            if (getLiuXia(dayStem) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'流霞', type:'bad' });
            // 桃花
            if (getXianChi(pillarBranch) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'桃花', type:'bad' });
            // 驿马
            if (getYiMa(pillarBranch) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'驿马', type:'neutral' });
            // 华盖
            if (getHuaGai(pillarBranch) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'华盖', type:'neutral' });
            // 孤辰
            if (getGuChen(pillarBranch) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'孤辰', type:'bad' });
            // 寡宿
            if (getGuaXiu(yearBranch || pillarBranch) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'寡宿', type:'bad' });
            // 亡神
            if (yearBranch && getWangShen(yearBranch) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'亡神', type:'bad' });
            // 劫煞
            if (yearBranch && getJieSha(yearBranch) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'劫煞', type:'bad' });
            // 灾煞
            if (yearBranch && getZaiSha(yearBranch) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'灾煞', type:'bad' });
            // 六厄
            if (yearBranch && getLiuE(yearBranch) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'六厄', type:'bad' });
            // 大耗
            if (yearBranch && sex && getDaHao(yearBranch, sex) === pillarBranch) ss.push({ name:'大耗', type:'bad' });
            // 天德
            if (monthBranch && isTianDe(monthBranch, pillarBranch)) ss.push({ name:'天德', type:'good' });
            // 天德合
            if (monthBranch && isTianDeHe(monthBranch, pillarStem)) ss.push({ name:'天德合', type:'good' });
            // 月德合
            if (monthBranch && isYueDeHe(monthBranch, pillarStem)) ss.push({ name:'月德合', type:'good' });
            // 天罗地网
            if (yearStem && yearBranch) {
                const tldw = isTianLuoDiWang(yearStem, yearBranch);
                if (tldw) ss.push({ name: tldw, type:'bad' });
            }
            return ss;
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  命宫/胎元/身宫 计算
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function calcMingGong(monthBranch, hourBranch) {
            const mi = getBranchIdx(monthBranch);
            const hi = getBranchIdx(hourBranch);
            const mgIdx = ((mi + 1) + (hi + 1) - 1 + 12) % 12; // 正月起寅，顺数到月支，再从时支逆数
            // Simplified: 命宫 = (14 - 月支数 - 时支数) mod 12
            const mNum = mi + 1;
            const hNum = hi + 1;
            const mgNum = (26 - mNum - hNum) % 12;
            const mgBranch = BRANCHES[mgNum === 0 ? 11 : mgNum - 1];
            return mgBranch;
        }
        function calcTaiYuan(monthGZ) {
            // 胎元: 月柱天干顺推一位，地支顺推三位
            const ms = getStemIdx(monthGZ[0]);
            const mb = getBranchIdx(monthGZ[1]);
            const tyStem = STEMS[(ms + 1) % 10];
            const tyBranch = BRANCHES[(mb + 3) % 12];
            return tyStem + tyBranch;
        }
        function calcShenGong(monthBranch, hourBranch) {
            // 身宫: 与命宫对称
            const mi = getBranchIdx(monthBranch) + 1;
            const hi = getBranchIdx(hourBranch) + 1;
            const sgNum = (mi + hi) % 12;
            return BRANCHES[sgNum === 0 ? 11 : sgNum - 1];
        }
        // 命宫天干 (以年干五虎遁推)
        function calcMingGongGZ(yearStem, mgBranch) {
            const si = getStemIdx(yearStem);
            const startStem = (si % 5) * 2; // 甲己→0, 乙庚→2, 丙辛→4, 丁壬→6, 戊癸→8
            const bi = getBranchIdx(mgBranch);
            const mgStemIdx = (startStem + bi) % 10;
            return STEMS[mgStemIdx] + mgBranch;
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  用神简易判断 (基于日主旺衰)
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function judgeYongShen(dayStem, monthBranch, wxCounts) {
            const si = getStemIdx(dayStem);
            const dwx = Math.floor(si / 2); // 日主五行: 0木1火2土3金4水
            const wxOrder = ['木','火','土','金','水'];
            const mwx = wxOrder.indexOf(BRANCH_WX[monthBranch] || '土');
            // 月令旺相判断
            const isWang = (mwx === dwx); // 同五行=旺
            const isXiang = ((dwx + 1) % 5 === mwx); // 生月令=相
            const totalWx = (wxCounts[dwx] || 0) + (wxCounts[(dwx + 4) % 5] || 0);
            if (totalWx >= 5) {
                // 身强 → 克泄耗为用 (克我/我生/我克)
                const yong = [(dwx + 1) % 5, (dwx + 2) % 5, (dwx + 3) % 5];
                return { score: '偏强', sz: '身强', yong: yong.map(i => wxOrder[i]), desc: '日主偏强，喜' + yong.map(i => wxOrder[i]).join('、') + '，忌' + wxOrder[dwx] + wxOrder[(dwx+4)%5] };
            } else if (totalWx <= 2) {
                // 身弱 → 生扶为用 (同五行/生我)
                const yong = [dwx, (dwx + 4) % 5];
                return { score: '偏弱', sz: '身弱', yong: yong.map(i => wxOrder[i]), desc: '日主偏弱，喜' + yong.map(i => wxOrder[i]).join('、') + '，忌' + wxOrder[(dwx+1)%5] + wxOrder[(dwx+2)%5] + wxOrder[(dwx+3)%5] };
            } else {
                return { score: '平和', sz: '中和', yong: [], desc: '日主中和，五行较为平衡，宜具体分析' };
            }
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  大运排盘 — 精确节气计算（参照《大运排盘顺逆.md》）
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════

        // 12个月节名称（按寅→丑顺序，对应节气索引0,2,4,...,22）
        const MONTH_JIE = ['立春','惊蛰','清明','立夏','芒种','小暑','立秋','白露','寒露','立冬','大雪','小寒'];
        // 起运换算常量: 3天=1岁, 1天=4个月, 1时辰(2小时)=10天
        const QY_DAYS_PER_YEAR = 3;
        const QY_MS_PER_HOUR = 3600000;

        function calcQiYunDetail(yearGZ, monthGZ, sex, birthDate) {
            const isYangYear = STEM_YANG[getStemIdx(yearGZ[0])];
            const isMale = sex === '1' || sex === 1;
            const forward = (isYangYear && isMale) || (!isYangYear && !isMale);

            const branchIdx = getBranchIdx(monthGZ[1]);
            const jieOffset = (branchIdx - 2 + 12) % 12; // 子=0→寅=0 映射
            const targetJieName = MONTH_JIE[(jieOffset + (forward ? 1 : -1) + 12) % 12];

            const birthYear = birthDate.getFullYear();
            let ty, tm, td;
            try {
                [ty, tm, td] = lunisolar.SolarTerm.findDate(birthYear, targetJieName);
            } catch (e) {
                console.warn('SolarTerm.findDate failed for', targetJieName, birthYear, e);
                [ty, tm, td] = [birthYear, birthDate.getMonth() + 1, 15];
            }

            // 跨年边界：节气可能在前一年或后一年
            const birthTs = birthDate.getTime();
            if (forward && new Date(ty, tm - 1, td, 12, 0, 0).getTime() < birthTs) {
                [ty, tm, td] = lunisolar.SolarTerm.findDate(birthYear + 1, targetJieName);
            }
            if (!forward && new Date(ty, tm - 1, td, 23, 59, 59).getTime() > birthTs) {
                [ty, tm, td] = lunisolar.SolarTerm.findDate(birthYear - 1, targetJieName);
            }

            const queryDate = new Date(ty, tm - 1, td, 23, 59, 59);
            let exactTermDate;
            try {
                const [, termDate] = lunisolar.SolarTerm.findNode(queryDate, { nodeFlag: 0 });
                exactTermDate = termDate;
            } catch (e) {
                console.warn('SolarTerm.findNode failed for', queryDate, e);
                exactTermDate = new Date(ty, tm - 1, td, 12, 0, 0);
            }

            const diffMs = Math.max(0, forward
                ? exactTermDate.getTime() - birthTs
                : birthTs - exactTermDate.getTime());

            const totalHours = diffMs / QY_MS_PER_HOUR;
            const totalDays = Math.floor(totalHours / 24);
            const remainHours = totalHours - totalDays * 24;
            const shichen = remainHours / 2;

            const mingliDays = totalDays + shichen * 10;
            const yunYears = mingliDays / QY_DAYS_PER_YEAR;

            const years = Math.floor(yunYears);
            const monthsFloat = (yunYears - years) * 12;
            const months = Math.floor(monthsFloat);
            const days = Math.round((monthsFloat - months) * 30);

            return {
                years, months, days,
                forward, dir: forward ? '顺排' : '逆排',
                termName: targetJieName,
                termDate: exactTermDate
            };
        }

        function renderDayunFull(qiyun, monthGZ) {
            const { forward, years, months, days } = qiyun;
            const msi = getStemIdx(monthGZ[0]);
            const mbi = getBranchIdx(monthGZ[1]);

            let qyDesc = years + '岁';
            if (months > 0) qyDesc += months + '个月';
            if (days > 0) qyDesc += days + '天';

            const td = qiyun.termDate;
            const termStr = fmtDt(td.getFullYear(), td.getMonth() + 1, td.getDate(), td.getHours(), td.getMinutes());

            let html = '<div class="qiyun-header">';
            html += '起运：<strong>' + qyDesc + '</strong>';
            html += ' · 参照节气：<strong>' + qiyun.termName + '</strong>';
            html += ' · 交节：<strong>' + termStr + '</strong>';
            html += '</div>';

            const startAge = years + months / 12 + days / 365;
            for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {
                const offset = forward ? (i + 1) : -(i + 1);
                const si = ((msi + offset) % 10 + 10) % 10;
                const bi = ((mbi + offset) % 12 + 12) % 12;
                const stem = STEMS[si], branch = BRANCHES[bi];
                const gz = stem + branch;
                const nayin = getNayinForGZ(stem, branch);

                const segStart = startAge + i * 10;
                const segEnd = startAge + (i + 1) * 10;
                const sY = Math.floor(segStart);
                const sM = Math.floor((segStart - sY) * 12);
                const eY = Math.floor(segEnd);
                const eM = Math.floor((segEnd - eY) * 12);

                html += `<div class="bazi-dayun-item">
                  <span class="du-age">${sY}岁${sM > 0 ? sM + '月' : ''} - ${eY}岁${eM > 0 ? eM + '月' : ''}</span>
                  <span class="du-gz">${gz}</span>
                  <span class="du-nayin">${nayin}</span>
                </div>`;
            }
            return html;
        }

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  主函数: doBaziCalc
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        window.doBaziCalc = function() {
            const res = document.getElementById('baziResult');
            const y = _bzY, m = _bzM, d = _bzD, h = _bzH, min = _bzMin;
            if (!y || !m || !d) { res.innerHTML = '<div style="text-align:center;color:#c43d3d;padding:1rem;">请选择公历日期</div>'; return; }
            const sec = 0;
            const sex = document.getElementById('bzSex').value;
            const name = document.getElementById('bzName').value.trim() || '——';
            const sexLabel = sex === '1' ? '男' : '女';
            try {
                // 直接复用主页面 computeDay() 数据（保证公历/农历/干支与主页面完全一致）
                const dat = computeDay(y, m, d);
                if (!dat) { res.innerHTML = '<div style="text-align:center;color:#c43d3d;padding:1rem;">日期数据不可用</div>'; return; }
                const dayStem = dat.stem;
                const dayBranch = dat.branch;
                const dayGZ = dat.dayGZ;
                const yearGZ = dat.yearGZ;
                const monthGZ = dat.monthGZ;
                const hgz = getHourGZ(dayStem, h);
                const hourGZ = hgz.gz;
                const weekDay = new Date(y, m - 1, d).getDay();

                // 四柱
                const pillars = [
                    { label:'年柱', gz: yearGZ, stem: yearGZ[0], branch: yearGZ[1] },
                    { label:'月柱', gz: monthGZ, stem: monthGZ[0], branch: monthGZ[1] },
                    { label:'日柱', gz: dayGZ, stem: dayStem, branch: dayBranch, isDay: true },
                    { label:'时柱', gz: hourGZ, stem: hgz.stem, branch: hgz.branch }
                ];

                // 藏干/十神/纳音/十二长生
                const piData = pillars.map(p => ({
                    ...p,
                    nayin: getNaYinForGZ(p.gz),
                    tenGod: getTenGod(dayStem, p.stem),
                    hiddenStems: getHiddenStems(p.branch),
                    stage12: get12Stage(dayStem, p.branch),
                    xunKong: p.gz === dayGZ ? getXunKong(p.gz) : ''
                }));

                // 五行统计
                const allStems = piData.map(p => p.stem);
                const allBranches = piData.map(p => p.branch);
                const wxCounts = countWuxing(allStems, allBranches);

                // 空亡
                const xk = getXunKong(dayGZ);

                // 纳音
                const dayNaYin = getNaYinForGZ(dayGZ);

                // 八字重量
                const weight = getBaziWeight(yearGZ, monthGZ, dayGZ, hgz.branch);

                // 用神
                const yongShen = judgeYongShen(dayStem, monthGZ[1], wxCounts);

                // 大运
                const birthDate = new Date(y, m - 1, d, h, min, 0);
                const qiyun = calcQiYunDetail(yearGZ, monthGZ, sex, birthDate);
                const dayunHtml = renderDayunFull(qiyun, monthGZ);

                // 神煞
                const ssData = piData.map(p => ({
                    ...p,
                    shensha: gatherPillarShensha(dayStem, p.stem, p.branch, p.gz, monthGZ[1], sex, yearGZ[1], yearGZ[0])
                }));

                // 命宫/胎元/身宫
                const mgBranch = calcMingGong(monthGZ[1], hgz.branch);
                const mgGZ = calcMingGongGZ(yearGZ[0], mgBranch);
                const taiYuanGZ = calcTaiYuan(monthGZ);
                const shenGongBranch = calcShenGong(monthGZ[1], hgz.branch);
                const sgGZ = calcMingGongGZ(yearGZ[0], shenGongBranch);

                // 日柱 十二长生详解
                const rzStage = get12Stage(dayStem, dayBranch);

                const wxStatus = getWangXiang(monthGZ[1]);

                // 农历日期（直接使用主页面 computeDay 数据，格式一致）
                const lm = normLunarMonth(dat.lunarMonth);
                const ldName = CDAY[dat.lunarDay - 1] || dat.lunarDay;
                const lunarStr = dat.lunarYear + '年（' + dat.yearNaYin + '）· ' + (dat.isLeap ? '闰' : '') + (CMON[lm - 1] || lm + '月') + dat.monthGZ + '（' + dat.monthNaYin + '）' + ldName + dat.dayGZ + '（' + dat.dayNaYin + '）';
                const zIdx = (getBranchIdx(yearGZ[1]) + 4) % 12;
                const zodiac = { icon: ZODIAC_ICONS[zIdx], full: ZODIAC_ANIMALS_CN[zIdx] };
                const jqMonth = ((BRANCHES.indexOf(monthGZ[1]) - 2 + 12) % 12) + 1;
                const xi = xiuIndex(y, m, d);
                const ns = getNineStar(dayGZ, jqMonth);

                // 十神颜色
                function ssColor(cat) {
                    const m = { '比劫':'#5d4037','食伤':'#2e7d32','财星':'#e65100','官杀':'#c62828','印枭':'#0d47a1' };
                    return m[cat] || '#3c2415';
                }

                // 构建输出
                let html = '';

                // 基本信息行
                html += '<div class="bazi-info-row" style="margin-top:0.3rem;">';
                html += '<span><strong>姓名:</strong> ' + name + '</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>性别:</strong> ' + sexLabel + '</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>公历:</strong> ' + y + '-' + m + '-' + d + ' ' + String(h).padStart(2,'0') + ':' + String(min).padStart(2,'0') + ':' + String(sec).padStart(2,'0') + '</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>农历:</strong> ' + lunarStr + '</span>';
                html += '</div>';
                html += '<div class="bazi-info-row">';
                html += '<span><strong>节气:</strong> ' + (dat.solarTerm || '——') + '</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>星座:</strong> ' + getZodiac(m, d).n + '</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>生肖:</strong> ' + zodiac.full + '</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>廿八宿:</strong> ' + dat.xiu + '宿' + dat.xiuAnimal + '</span>';
                html += '</div>';

                // 四柱卡片
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-building-castle"></i> 四柱八字</h4>';
                html += '<div class="bazi-four-pillars">';
                for (const p of piData) {
                    const dmClass = p.isDay ? ' day-master' : '';
                    html += '<div class="bazi-pillar' + dmClass + '">';
                    html += '<div class="bp-label">' + p.label + (p.isDay ? ' (日主)' : '') + '</div>';
                    html += '<div class="bp-gz">' + p.gz + '</div>';
                    html += '<div class="bp-ten" style="color:' + ssColor(p.tenGod.cat) + '">' + p.tenGod.full + '</div>';
                    html += '<div class="bp-nayin">' + p.nayin + '</div>';
                    html += '<div class="bp-cg">藏: ' + p.hiddenStems + '</div>';
                    html += '<div class="bp-zs">' + p.stage12 + '</div>';
                    if (p.xunKong) html += '<div class="bp-zs">' + p.xunKong + '</div>';
                    html += '</div>';
                }
                html += '</div></div>';

                // 大运
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-refresh"></i> 大运排盘 (' + qiyun.dir + ')</h4>';
                html += '<div class="bazi-dayun-list">' + dayunHtml + '</div></div>';

                // 用神
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-scale"></i> 命理核心</h4>';
                html += '<div class="bazi-highlight-box">';
                html += '<div class="bh-title">日主强弱</div>';
                html += '<div class="bh-val">' + yongShen.score + ' (' + yongShen.sz + ')</div>';
                html += '<div style="font-size:0.65rem;color:#5c3d2e;margin-top:0.2rem;">' + yongShen.desc + '</div>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // 五行分布
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-flame"></i> 五行力量</h4>';
                html += renderWuxingDist(wxCounts, wxStatus);
                html += '<div style="font-size:0.55rem;color:#8b6946;text-align:center;margin-top:0.15rem;">天干: ' + allStems.map(s => s + '(' + WUXING_STEM[STEMS.indexOf(s)] + ')').join(' ') + '<br>地支: ' + allBranches.map(b => b + '(' + (WUXING_BRANCH[b] || '') + ')').join(' ') + '</div></div>';

                // 命宫/胎元/身宫
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-home"></i> 命宫 · 胎元 · 身宫</h4>';
                html += '<div class="bazi-info-row">';
                html += '<span><strong>胎元:</strong> ' + taiYuanGZ + ' (' + getNaYinForGZ(taiYuanGZ) + ')</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>命宫:</strong> ' + mgGZ + ' (' + getNaYinForGZ(mgGZ) + ')</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>身宫:</strong> ' + sgGZ + ' (' + getNaYinForGZ(sgGZ) + ')</span>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // 神煞
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-star"></i> 吉神凶煞</h4>';
                for (const p of ssData) {
                    if (p.shensha.length === 0) continue;
                    html += '<div style="margin-bottom:0.25rem;"><strong style="font-size:0.65rem;">' + p.label + ':</strong> ';
                    html += '<span class="bazi-shensha-tags" style="display:inline;">';
                    for (const ss of p.shensha) {
                        html += '<span class="ss-tag ' + ss.type + '">' + ss.name + '</span>';
                    }
                    html += '</span></div>';
                }

                // 空亡
                html += '<div style="font-size:0.62rem;color:#8b6946;text-align:center;margin-top:0.2rem;">日柱空亡: ' + xk + '</div>';
                html += '</div>';

                // 九星 & 建除
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-sparkles"></i> 当日信息</h4>';
                html += '<div class="bazi-info-row">';
                html += '<span><strong>九星:</strong> ' + (dat.nineStar ? dat.nineStar.name + '（' + (dat.nineStar.good ? '吉' : '凶') + '）' : '——') + '</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>建除:</strong> ' + dat.duty12Name + '（' + (dat.duty12Good ? '黄道' : '黑道') + '）</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>倒家杀:</strong> ' + (dat.daojia ? '<span style="color:#c62828;">是</span>' : '<span style="color:#3cb371;">无</span>') + '</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>无禄日:</strong> ' + (dat.wulu ? '<span style="color:#c62828;">是</span>' : '<span style="color:#3cb371;">无</span>') + '</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>红砂日:</strong> ' + (dat.hongsha ? '<span style="color:#c62828;">是</span>' : '<span style="color:#3cb371;">无</span>') + '</span>';
                html += '<span><strong>金神七煞:</strong> ' + (dat.jinshen ? '<span style="color:#c62828;animation:jinshen-blink 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;">是（' + dat.xiu + '宿）</span>' : '<span style="color:#3cb371;">无</span>') + '</span>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // ═══ 天干关系 / 地支关系 ═══
                const tgRel = findTianGanHe(allStems);
                const dzRelSanHe = findSanHe(allBranches);
                const dzRelSanHui = findSanHui(allBranches);
                const dzRelLiuHe = findLiuHe(allBranches);
                const dzRelChong = findLiuChong(allBranches);
                const dzRelHai = findLiuHai(allBranches);
                const dzRelXing = findXiangXing(allBranches);
                let dzRelAll = dzRelSanHe + dzRelSanHui + dzRelLiuHe + dzRelHai + dzRelChong + dzRelXing;
                if (dzRelAll.endsWith('，')) dzRelAll = dzRelAll.slice(0, -1);
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-arrows-exchange"></i> 天干地支关系</h4>';
                html += '<div style="font-size:0.68rem;line-height:1.6;">';
                html += '<div><strong>天干关系：</strong>' + (tgRel ? '天干有' + tgRel.replace(/，$/, '') : '天干无合') + '</div>';
                html += '<div><strong>地支关系：</strong>' + (dzRelAll ? '地支有' + dzRelAll : '地支无刑冲害合') + '</div>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // ═══ 生克制化分析 ═══
                const wxJ = ['木','火','土','金','水'];
                const dwxIdx = Math.floor(getStemIdx(dayStem) / 2);
                // 己生助=比劫+印枭, 克泄耗=食伤+财星+官杀
                const shengZhu = (wxCounts[dwxIdx] || 0) + (wxCounts[(dwxIdx + 4) % 5] || 0);
                const keXieHao = (wxCounts[(dwxIdx + 1) % 5] || 0) + (wxCounts[(dwxIdx + 2) % 5] || 0) + (wxCounts[(dwxIdx + 3) % 5] || 0);
                const totalWxNum = shengZhu + keXieHao;
                const shengPct = totalWxNum > 0 ? (shengZhu / totalWxNum * 100).toFixed(1) : '0.0';
                const kePct = totalWxNum > 0 ? (keXieHao / totalWxNum * 100).toFixed(1) : '0.0';
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-atom-2"></i> 生克制化分析</h4>';
                html += '<div style="font-size:0.65rem;line-height:1.6;background:#f8f9fa;padding:0.4rem 0.6rem;border-radius:6px;">';
                html += '<div><strong>五行个数(计干)：</strong>' + wxJ.map((w, i) => w + ':' + (wxCounts[i] || 0)).join('　') + '</div>';
                html += '<div style="margin-top:0.2rem;"><strong>己生助：</strong>' + shengPct + '%（' + wxJ[dwxIdx] + wxJ[(dwxIdx+4)%5] + '共' + shengZhu + '个）、<strong>克泄耗：</strong>' + kePct + '%（' + wxJ[(dwxIdx+1)%5] + wxJ[(dwxIdx+2)%5] + wxJ[(dwxIdx+3)%5] + '共' + keXieHao + '个）</div>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // ═══ 八字重量详细 ═══
                const wtIdx = Math.round(weight * 10) - 21;
                const wtText = (wtIdx >= 0 && wtIdx < BZ_WEIGHT_TEXT.length) ? BZ_WEIGHT_TEXT[wtIdx] : '';
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-scale"></i> 八字重量分析</h4>';
                html += '<div style="background:#e7f3ff;border:1px solid #b8daff;padding:0.5rem 0.6rem;border-radius:6px;font-size:0.68rem;color:#004085;">';
                html += '<div><strong>总重量：</strong>' + weight.toFixed(1) + '两　年:' + BZ_WT_Y[getGZIdx(yearGZ)].toFixed(1) + ' + 月:' + BZ_WT_M[getBranchIdx(monthGZ[1])].toFixed(1) + ' + 日:' + BZ_WT_D[getGZIdx(dayGZ) % 30].toFixed(1) + ' + 时:' + BZ_WT_H[getBranchIdx(hgz.branch)].toFixed(1) + '</div>';
                if (wtText) html += '<div style="margin-top:0.3rem;"><strong>袁天罡断：</strong>' + wtText + '</div>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // ═══ 命宫寓意 ═══
                const mgIdx = getBranchIdx(mgBranch);
                const mgText = BZ_MINGGONG_TEXT[mgIdx] || '';
                const mgBaZhai = getMingGongBaZhai(mgIdx) || '';
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-home"></i> 命宫寓意</h4>';
                html += '<div style="background:#f0f8ff;border:1px solid #b8daff;padding:0.5rem 0.6rem;border-radius:6px;font-size:0.68rem;color:#004085;line-height:1.5;">';
                if (mgText) html += '<div>★ ' + mgText + '</div>';
                if (mgBaZhai) html += '<div style="margin-top:0.3rem;">' + mgBaZhai + '</div>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // ═══ 四柱详断 ═══
                const yearDuan = BZ_YEAR_TEXT[getGZIdx(yearGZ) % 60] || '';
                const monthDuan = BZ_MONTH_TEXT[(getBranchIdx(monthGZ[1]) - 2 + 12) % 12] || '';
                const dayDuan = BZ_DAY_TEXT[(dat.lunarDay - 1) % 30] || '';
                const hourDuan = BZ_HOUR_TEXT[getBranchIdx(hgz.branch)] || '';
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-list-details"></i> 四柱详断</h4>';
                html += '<div style="font-size:0.65rem;line-height:1.6;background:#f8f9fa;padding:0.4rem 0.6rem;border-radius:6px;">';
                if (yearDuan) html += '<div><strong>年断：</strong>' + yearDuan + '</div>';
                if (monthDuan) html += '<div style="margin-top:0.3rem;"><strong>月断：</strong>' + monthDuan + '</div>';
                if (dayDuan) html += '<div style="margin-top:0.3rem;"><strong>日断：</strong>' + dayDuan + '</div>';
                if (hourDuan) html += '<div style="margin-top:0.3rem;"><strong>时断：</strong>' + hourDuan + '</div>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // ═══ 十神定位论断 ═══
                const ssSeatY = BZ_SHISHEN_SEAT[getRiZuo(getGZIdx(yearGZ), getGZIdx(dayGZ))] || '';
                const ssSeatM = BZ_SHISHEN_SEAT[getRiZuo(getGZIdx(monthGZ), getGZIdx(dayGZ))] || '';
                const ssSeatH = BZ_SHISHEN_SEAT[getRiZuo(getGZIdx(hourGZ), getGZIdx(dayGZ))] || '';
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-target"></i> 十神定位论断</h4>';
                html += '<div style="background:#fff8e1;border:1px solid #ffecb3;padding:0.5rem 0.6rem;border-radius:6px;font-size:0.65rem;color:#f57c00;line-height:1.5;">';
                if (ssSeatY) html += '<div>年:☆' + ssSeatY + '</div>';
                if (ssSeatM) html += '<div>月:☆' + ssSeatM + '</div>';
                if (ssSeatH) html += '<div>时:☆' + ssSeatH + '</div>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // ═══ 日柱论断 ═══
                const dayMasterText = BZ_DAY_MASTER_TEXT[getStemIdx(dayStem)] || '';
                const stageText = BZ_STAGE12_TEXT[get12StageIdx(dayStem, dayBranch)] || '';
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-user"></i> 日柱论断</h4>';
                html += '<div style="background:#fce4ec;border:1px solid #f8bbd9;padding:0.5rem 0.6rem;border-radius:6px;font-size:0.65rem;color:#c2185b;line-height:1.5;">';
                if (dayMasterText) html += '<div>' + dayMasterText + '</div>';
                if (stageText) html += '<div style="margin-top:0.3rem;">' + stageText + '</div>';
                html += '<div style="margin-top:0.3rem;font-weight:600;">' + yongShen.desc + '</div>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // ═══ 命主福元 / 文昌位 ═══
                const fangW = ['北','东北','东北','东','东南','东南','南','西南','西南','西','西北','西北'];
                const wenChangDir = fangW[getBranchIdx(getWenChang(dayStem))] || '';
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-compass"></i> 命主福元 · 文昌位</h4>';
                html += '<div style="font-size:0.65rem;line-height:1.6;background:#fff3cd;border:1px solid #ffeaa7;padding:0.4rem 0.6rem;border-radius:6px;">';
                html += '<div>☆文昌位在' + (getWenChang(dayStem) || '——') + '方，即' + wenChangDir + '方。</div>';
                const tianyiG = getTianYi(dayStem);
                html += '<div>☆天乙贵人：' + (tianyiG || '——') + '</div>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // 命理解读入口
                html += '<div class="bz-section"><h4><i class="ti ti-book"></i> 命理解读</h4>';
                html += '<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.4rem;justify-content:center;">';
                html += '<span class="ie-link" onclick="showInterpret(\'strength\')" style="padding:0.3rem 0.8rem;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:#f0e6d3;color:#5c3d0e;border:1px solid #dccaa5;transition:all 0.15s;">日主强弱</span>';
                html += '<span class="ie-link" onclick="showInterpret(\'favor\')" style="padding:0.3rem 0.8rem;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:#d4efdf;color:#14522a;border:1px solid #a8d5ba;transition:all 0.15s;">五行喜忌</span>';
                html += '<span class="ie-link" onclick="showInterpret(\'gods\')" style="padding:0.3rem 0.8rem;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:#fde0e0;color:#7a1a1e;border:1px solid #f0b0b0;transition:all 0.15s;">神煞精要</span>';
                html += '<span class="ie-link" onclick="showInterpret(\'analysis\')" style="padding:0.3rem 0.8rem;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:#e0d8f0;color:#3e2a6e;border:1px solid #c0b0e0;transition:all 0.15s;">五行分布</span>';
                html += '<span class="ie-link" onclick="showInterpret(\'weight\')" style="padding:0.3rem 0.8rem;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:#e7f3ff;color:#004085;border:1px solid #b8daff;transition:all 0.15s;">八字重量</span>';
                html += '<span class="ie-link" onclick="showInterpret(\'pillars\')" style="padding:0.3rem 0.8rem;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:#f8f9fa;color:#3c2415;border:1px solid #dccaa5;transition:all 0.15s;">四柱详断</span>';
                html += '<span class="ie-link" onclick="showInterpret(\'daymaster\')" style="padding:0.3rem 0.8rem;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:#fce4ec;color:#c2185b;border:1px solid #f8bbd9;transition:all 0.15s;">日柱论断</span>';
                html += '<span class="ie-link" onclick="showInterpret(\'relations\')" style="padding:0.3rem 0.8rem;border-radius:16px;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:#fff8e1;color:#f57c00;border:1px solid #ffecb3;transition:all 0.15s;">合冲刑害</span>';
                html += '</div></div>';

                // 保存按钮
                html += '<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:0.6rem;display:flex;gap:0.4rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">';
                html += '<button class="note-btn save" style="font-size:0.7rem;padding:0.35rem 1.2rem;" onclick="saveBaziRecord()"><i class="ti ti-device-floppy"></i> 保存此排盘</button>';
                html += '</div>';

                // 已保存记录列表
                html += '<div id="baziSavedList" style="margin-top:0.5rem;"></div>';

                // 存储排盘数据供保存
                _lastBaziData = {
                    name, sex, y, m, d, h, min, sec,
                    yearGZ, monthGZ, dayGZ,
                    hourGZ: hgz.gz, hourShichen: hgz.shichen,
                    lunarStr, sexLabel,
                    htmlSummary: html,
                    savedAt: null
                };
                res.innerHTML = html;
                renderBaziSavedList();
            } catch (e) {
                res.innerHTML = '<div style="text-align:center;color:#c43d3d;padding:1rem;">排盘出错：' + e.message + '</div>';
            }
        };

        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        //  初始化设置
        // ═══════════════════════════════════════
        function initSettings() {
            const dark = loadSetting('darkTheme', false);
            if (dark) { document.body.classList.add('dark'); document.getElementById('themeBtn').innerHTML = '<i class="ti ti-sun"></i>'; }
            document.getElementById('togDark').checked = dark;
            document.getElementById('togWuluBadge').checked = loadSetting('showWulu', true);
            document.getElementById('togDaojiaMonth').checked = loadSetting('showDaojiaMonth', true);
            document.getElementById('togDaojiaYear').checked = loadSetting('showDaojiaYear', true);
        }

        // 事件挂载（统一入口）
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            document.getElementById('baziOverlay').addEventListener('click', function(e) {
                if (e.target === this) closeBazi();
            });
            document.getElementById('calBody').addEventListener('click', onCalendarClick);
            // 左右滑动手势切换月份
            (function() {
                let swipeX0 = 0, swipeY0 = 0;
                const cal = document.getElementById('calBody');
                cal.addEventListener('touchstart', function(e) {
                    swipeX0 = e.touches[0].clientX;
                    swipeY0 = e.touches[0].clientY;
                }, { passive: true });
                cal.addEventListener('touchend', function(e) {
                    const dx = (e.changedTouches[0].clientX - swipeX0);
                    const dy = (e.changedTouches[0].clientY - swipeY0);
                    if (Math.abs(dx) > 50 && Math.abs(dx) > Math.abs(dy)) {
                        shiftMonth(dx > 0 ? -1 : 1);
                    }
                });
            })();
            initPickers();
            initSettings();
            const now = new Date();
            renderCal(now.getFullYear(), now.getMonth() + 1);
            startShichenTimer();
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
